window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4001,"title":"Chapter 4001: As Long As You’re Alive","paragraphs":["Chapter 4001: As Long As You’re Alive","Editor: Henyee Translations","She had to be sent to the hospital again.","G3 was stunned for a moment. He asked, “Was it caused by Q King grabbing her and throwing her to the side?”","“Yes.” K7 nodded.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit fell silent. This was a difficult matter to comment on.","The boyfriend beat up his girlfriend until she had to be sent to the hospital.","T6 asked softly, “You didn’t say it out loud, right?”","“No.” K7 shook his head. He wouldn’t say such things. He was afraid that Azure Bird would feel uncomfortable if he said it.","“It’s good that you didn’t say it. Let’s pretend that we don’t know anything.” G3 sighed softly. “When we receive news from Q King, the injury on Ye Jian’s waist will have almost recovered.”","But when would Q King send back news?","The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade knew that Ye Jian bit her tongue and quickly asked the medics in the team to treat her. She had been injured for so long. How could they let her be treated after she returned to the country?","They needed to suture her wound first!","When G3 and the rest heard that their brothers could suture Ye Jian’s tongue, they didn’t care about resting and quickly resolved the huge matter in their hearts.","K7 had secretly told them that Azure Bird’s tongue injury was serious and they needed to go back to China to get her treated as soon as possible. Hence, they didn’t even dare to rest for ten minutes on the way back. They quickened their pace and rushed back to their country.","The brothers were surprised at how fast they were. They could only smile without daring to say anything. They were just afraid that Azure Bird would feel burdened. So, this was good! The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade could handle something like this!","Ye Jian was in medical school in her past life, so she knew that there would be sequelae if the tongue wasn’t treated. K7 said that she needed to go back to China to treat it because he didn’t have the special surgical needle used to suture the tongue. Hence, she knew why they were traveling day and night.","Everyone knew this, but they didn’t point it out.","Now that the Cloud Leopard assaulter could handle it, Ye Jian immediately opened her mouth.","Zhou Yijin saw the surgical needle suture between Ye Jian’s tongue and flesh. She and Liu Le looked away. They didn’t dare to look at her anymore.","They would feel pain when they accidentally bite their tongue while eating. This time, the needle would pierce through Ye Jian’s tongue... Ye Jian endured it and didn’t make a sound. Zhou Yijin lowered her head and lay on Liu Le’s body. Her tears kept flowing.","While the suture was going on, the comrades from the Xueyu unit were keeping an eye on it. The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade was in charge of guarding the area. After about an hour, the team member in charge of stitching put away the needle and smiled. “Alright, don’t chew anything for the next few days and don’t speak too loudly. There won’t be a problem.”","G3 and the rest heaved a sigh of relief. Fortunately, the female soldier asked their comrades about it. They had to thank her properly.","Zhou Yijin didn’t need his thanks. She only knew that she had finally taken care of her sixth cousin-in-law and made good on Xia Jinyuan’s message.","After the Xueyu unit’s comrades settled their worries, Ye Jian asked them to rest. Everyone closed their eyes. Ye Jian, who was resting on Zhou Yijin’s lap, closed her eyes too.","She didn’t want to lie on Zhou Yijin’s lap, but... she had no choice. She had to admit that Yijin, who had the Xia family’s bloodline, was just like Captain Xia when he was domineering.","She wondered how Captain Xia was doing. He... should have been saved. He should have completed the surgery and should be out of danger...","Ye Jian couldn’t help but frown as she thought about it. Zhou Yijin, who had been massaging her temples, felt it and touched Ye Jian’s eyebrows with her fingers. “Sixth Cousin-in-law, have a good sleep. They said that you’ve been walking and haven’t rested at all. Now, it’s time to rest and sleep. You shouldn’t think about anything else.","“Sleep when it’s time to sleep. Think about things after you wake up.”","Hearing this, Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile. She should sleep. Maybe when she woke up, she would hear that Captain Xia was out of danger."]},{"number":4002,"title":"Chapter 4002: I Have A Return Date","paragraphs":["Chapter 4002: I Have A Return Date","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who had not had a good rest since she was locked up with Zhou Yijin and Liu Le, cleared her mind of all distracting thoughts. Finally, she stopped frowning, and her breathing became steady.","She had already fallen asleep.","Not long after Xia Jinyuan opened his eyes, he saw Luke with a head of weed-like hair and dark circles under his eyes. The beard around his mouth was so messy that it couldn’t be seen. He opened his mouth and exhaled white gas. Xia Jinyuan’s voice was weak, but it didn’t hide his disdain. “The smell on your body is too strong. I want to vomit.”","Luke, who was despised, took a deep breath of oxygen filled with disinfectant and criticized his unfriendly partner seriously. “It’s been... 22 hours since I moved you onto the helicopter. Buddy, I didn’t sleep for 22 hours. I kept waiting for you to wake up and thank me.","“I forgive your stupidity. Please thank me immediately. I’ll wait for you.”","Indeed, Xia Jinyuan needed to thank Luke.","“Thank you, Luke. You saved me.” Xia Jinyuan smiled and thanked him sincerely.","He dared to let his comrade stab his chest because he was betting on Luke’s loyalty to him. In Luke’s words, he had two partners in the past. When they died, he didn’t feel sad at all.","If something happened, he would need a long time to get over it. He didn’t even want another partner.","Luke was a soldier, and so was he. The two of them hid their soldiers’ characteristics to a depth that no one knew about. However, they could inadvertently resonate with each other.","Hence, he took the risk.","It was clear he made the right bet. His life was saved by Luke. Xia Jinyuan really needed to thank him seriously.","This ‘thank you’ made Luke smile. He didn’t break out into laughter. Instead, he smiled silently. His beard, which hadn’t been shaved for a few days, became even more... messy as he smiled silently.","Xia Jinyuan felt that his eyes were pricked by Luke’s beard. He closed his eyes. “Luke, you need to wash up and shave your face. I don’t think the beautiful nurse likes you because you’re really ugly.”","Luke felt that his pride had been hurt. However, when he thought of the beautiful nurse and looked at the person who made him worry, he felt that he should wash up.","He pressed the call button and told the doctor on duty that the patient who got stabbed in the heart had woken up. Before the doctor and the beautiful nurse could come, Luke went to take care of himself.","Before leaving, Luke looked at Xia Jinyuan’s eyes that were as black as the deep sea. He said softly, “Cobra has sent a bodyguard to guard you. Xia, congratulations.”","Without waiting for an answer, Luke turned and walked away.","When he opened the door of the ward and saw the bodyguard sent by Cobra, the casual look on Luke’s face disappeared. He ordered coldly, “Watch over here. Mr. Cobra doesn’t want anything to happen to Xia.”","After another round of investigation, Cobra finally believed this Asian man who suddenly appeared beside him a year ago. He knew all the experiences of his subordinates who saved him.","He asked one of his personal bodyguards to guard Xia Jinyuan. He had already revealed that once Xia Jinyuan recovered, he would become his personal bodyguard.","The bodyguard looked at the closed door and nodded, indicating that he understood."]},{"number":4003,"title":"Chapter 4003: A Gentleman Promises","paragraphs":["Chapter 4003: A Gentleman Promises","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Xia Jinyuan woke up, Cobra, who was staying at the hotel, learned of the news very quickly. He was on the phone with General Minlai. On the phone, General Minlai told him that he had already sent people to the capital city of China. General Minlai wanted to see if he could find out where Cobra’s old friend was.","Today, early in the morning, Cobra personally sent the prepared dollar bills to General Minlai, who was staying in the suite next door. He said that it was hard on the general to help him find his old friend from China. Cobra was very generous and smart. This made General Minlai very happy. He didn’t delay this matter and immediately got people to investigate.","Now, the subordinates who went to China to investigate had already entered China’s territory. They were just waiting for the news.","Cobra was in a good mood. From the looks of it, his cooperation with General Minlai was not bad. In addition, he didn’t have to go to China to know about his old friend. Cobra poured a glass of red wine for himself to celebrate the end of his unhappy experience in Myanmar.","When he knew that his subordinate had woken up, Cobra put down his wine glass and rushed to the hospital.","When Xia Jinyuan saw that Cobra had entered, he wanted to sit up. Cobra smiled at Luke and said, “Lie down. You need to lie down properly to recover as soon as possible.”","He walked to the side of the bed and looked down at Xia Jinyuan, who had lost too much blood. His face was pale. He said with concern, “Thank God that I didn’t lose such a good subordinate. Xia, rest well. Luke and I are still waiting for you to come back.","“Also, we’re very safe now. You don’t have to worry about what will happen. Now, you just need to do one thing for me. That is to recuperate.","“I look forward to seeing a healthy subordinate soon.”","His emotional words didn’t affect Xia Jinyuan’s expression. He just nodded softly. His weak voice came through the breathing mask calmly. “Mr. Cobra, this is what I should do.”","“No one can be as good as you. You look very tired. I’ll let Luke take care of you.” After he finished speaking, he raised his wrist and looked at the time. He revealed an apologetic expression. “Xia, I need to take a plane back to Molaban first. I will wait for you at Molaban.","“I hope you can come back as soon as possible. After all, I can’t have you not by my side anymore.”","He revealed his intention of letting Xia Jinyuan follow him. Luke couldn’t help but clench his fists secretly. Cobra believed Xia now. To him... it was good news.","“Luke...”","“Yes, sir.” Luke immediately agreed and waited for Cobra’s instructions.","“I think you definitely want to stay and take care of your partner, right? Fine, I’ll give you a chance. Stay and take care of Xia. I’ll call at any time to ask about Xia’s situation.”","“Don’t worry, sir. I’ll take good care of Xia until I can bring him to drink the best wine and woo the most beautiful woman.”","“You’re a pervert who can’t live without wine and women. However, I don’t think Xia will like your wine and women because your taste is still so bad.”","Cobra said humorously. This man, who was thinner than ordinary Westerners and had double identities, looked very amiable as he chatted with his subordinates. He even had afternoon tea with Xia Jinyuan before leaving with his bodyguard.","After walking out of the ward, he looked at the bodyguard who had been guarding outside the ward and instructed, “Memorize all the people who come while Xia is recuperating. I need to know everyone, including the nurses and doctors.”"]},{"number":4004,"title":"Chapter 4004: Everything Is Going Well","paragraphs":["Chapter 4004: Everything Is Going Well","Editor: Henyee Translations","The bodyguard nodded. He knew why Cobra made such an arrangement. This bodyguard and the others had never taken Xia seriously. In the past, they even teased him with the other fellow. They didn’t expect that... this Asian man would make Cobra trust him more and more.","What an unhappy ending.","In the ward, Luke looked at Xia Jinyuan who had fallen asleep again. He stood there for a while with a complicated look in his eyes before getting up and leaving.","The moment he closed the door, Xia Jinyuan opened his eyes. If he were Luke, he would go and contact his country to report the progress of the investigation.","He wanted to do that too. Unfortunately, he needed to bear with it for a while longer.","They should be out of danger now. He wondered how the little fox was doing. Was she hurt badly?","Her waist had been injured before. Now that she was injured by him again, he wondered if there would be any sequelae.","She must be worried about him now. She shouldn’t be too sad because of him.","He promised that he would come back alive. He never went back on his word. He would definitely go back and see her alive.","His future wife was waiting for him in the country. How could he break his promise?","Xia Jinyuan closed his eyes. His thoughts were in a mess. He gradually closed his eyes and fell asleep.","Ye Jian and the rest had already rested and started their march. They needed to reach the Mekong River in 48 hours. They had to speed up their march.","The assignments ships that were supposed to fetch them back to the country had already started their assignments. There were a total of two assignments ships. A total of more than 30 people would disguise as the assignments workers on the ships and return to the country.","The ones who were the most tired during the 48-hour march were Liu Le and Zhou Yijin. They were military arts soldiers and had never undergone very harsh and high-intensity training. The rapid march caused huge blisters to appear on the soles of their feet. After the blisters broke, their feet hurt with every step they took.","Fortunately, there were so many male soldiers around them. They took turns taking care of them, and the female soldiers continued to endure the hardship. The journey was not delayed.","Ye Jian, who was marching like the male soldiers, didn’t complain at all along the way. Sometimes, she even arranged for the male soldiers to be on guard with her. Every time Liu Le looked at her, it was as if she were looking at a monster.","She had never seen a female soldier so capable. This was the first time she met someone like that, and she was in awe.","Zhou Yijin was the same. She knew that her sixth cousin-in-law was not simple. She was not so simple, which was why the male soldiers would listen to her arrangements and suggestions sometimes. She was really not simple.","She wondered if Sixth Cousin knew that Sixth Cousin-in-law was ‘not simple’. Zhou Yijin even suspected that when Sixth Cousin faced Sixth Cousin-in-law, he would be at a disadvantage.","Her sixth cousin-in-law was even more powerful than the male soldiers. She was beautiful and intimidating.","Previously, she had asked Ye Jian how to leave the village. She had answered casually, “We’ll just do it.”","It was a simple answer, but for some reason, when Zhou Yijin heard it, she felt a chill on her back.","Her sixth cousin-in-law was not simple.","Anyway, she was now aware of it and would remember it.","Ye Jian didn’t know that her stamina was stronger than that of the male soldiers and even Zhou Yijin was afraid of her. After the reconnaissance helicopter flew away, the group started climbing the mountain again.","Originally, they were in the jungle at the border between Myanmar and another country. Now, they were walking along the mountain range toward the Mekong River that connected to China. Without any means of transportation, they could only rely on their own two legs.","69 hours had passed since the hellish combat that night. Now, they still had six hours of mountain roads. That meant that they would reach the port at around 9:00 pm tonight."]},{"number":4005,"title":"Chapter 4005: It’s Hard To Blame","paragraphs":["Chapter 4005: It’s Hard To Blame","Editor: Henyee Translations","There was always news from the two military units in the country. After knowing that they would reach the Mekong River in six hours, Commander Xia, who hadn’t been sleeping well for a few nights, finally smiled.","At six o’clock that evening, Commander Xia suddenly received a message on his cell phone. The message was so simple that there was only one ‘6’.","This message wasn’t signed, but when Commander Xia saw it, his figure swayed a few times.","Everything was going smoothly.","Everything went smoothly for Q King who had been stabbed in the chest.","Alright then!","Very good.","Commander Xia, who had been waiting for the news, felt tears in his eyes. This brat was really as lucky as what the old master and old madam said.","Everything was going smoothly.","Good, good, good!!","Commander Xia didn’t keep this piece of good news to himself. He told Major General Yang about it.","Xia Jinyuan was able to enter the Xueyu unit largely due to Major General Yang. If it weren’t for Major General Yang’s guidance, Xia Jinyuan would’ve entered another special military unit.","Knowing that the subordinate he groomed was safe and sound, Major General Yang pressed the corners of his eyes and whispered to Commander Xia, “Commander Xia, Ah Yuan once told me that he wants to become the youngest general. At this rate, it’s really possible.","“You beautified his original words. I’m sure that his original words weren’t so implicit.” Commander Xia understood his son. Even though they went against each other in the past, they were still father and son.","Major General Yang could hear that although Commander Xia sounded tired, he was very relaxed. He smiled and said, “A father understands his son the best. Ah Yuan said that he wants to become the youngest general who can surpass your military ranks. He even said that he wants you to salute him first every time he sees you.”","Mhm, that sounded like something he would say.","Commander Xia laughed and said, “Then I’ll wait for that day to come!”","‘Young brat, you’re quite ambitious. You still want to pull me down. Heh, heh, you’re asking for a beating again.’","After laughing, Commander Xia continued, “Inform his comrades, especially Little Ye. Let her know that Little Six is safe and sound.”","The vice-captain once reported that Little Ye saw the dagger stabbing into Little Six’s chest with her own eyes. Little Ye ended up vomiting blood on the spot. It was obvious how anxious she was.","This child cared too much about Little Six. Commander Xia mustn’t make her anxious.","Major General Yang replied, “Yes.” After ending the call, he immediately informed the Xueyu unit. When they received the news, the Xueyu unit was rushing to the Mekong River. When they heard the news, they were overjoyed.","Even the company’s K7, who didn’t like to smile, started grinning.","Ye Jian understood the situation. The torture that was like a shackle was finally released. She pressed her worry deep in her heart and smiled. She smiled until her eyes were like the stars and they were shining brightly.","They held each other’s hands tightly. They didn’t say why they were happy. The soldiers from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade only saw that their brothers’ faces were covered in paint. Even so, they could tell that the group of them was happy.","As for why they were happy, they didn’t know.","Zhou Yijin didn’t know either. When she saw Ye Jian smiling, she smiled too. Of course, Liu Le smiled too.","She would be able to take a boat back to China very soon. How could she not be happy? That was what Liu Le was thinking. That was why she started smiling too.","“Azure Bird, when the captain comes back, you can settle the score with him. We didn’t want to hide it from you. It was all his orders. As the saying goes, ‘Every grievance has its perpetrator and every debt has its debtor’. You can settle the score with him when the time comes.”"]},{"number":4006,"title":"Chapter 4006: Not Good, Not Good At All","paragraphs":["Chapter 4006: Not Good, Not Good At All","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan was fine. T6 quickly pushed the blame away. If he didn’t, he was afraid that Ye Jian would teach him a lesson and ask his girlfriend, Jiaxin, for help. If his girlfriend ignored him, he would feel wronged.","Hence, if he didn’t push the blame now, when would he?","It was time to ‘betray’ the comrades, and T6 was taking the lead. G3 said to Ye Jian seriously, “We’ll support you unconditionally no matter how you want to deal with him. Isn’t that right, brothers?”","“Yes! You have our unconditional support!”","They answered in unison. Although their voices were soft, they were majestic.","Ye Jian looked at them and smiled even more.","“Sorry, but I am a petty person. I’ll keep this grudge.” Ye Jian covered her mouth and laughed. The male soldiers’ hearts trembled when they saw this.","She was going to hold a grudge against them!","This was bad!","The good news swept away the fatigue of the Xueyu unit. The male soldiers from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade were all clueless.","The soldiers from the Xueyu unit weren’t tired at all. They were walking so fast!","It was the same for the female soldier!","The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade was the special forces unit of the Yun Province Military District. Yet, they were worse than a female soldier. They couldn’t maintain their dignity anymore. They wanted to hide their faces.","75 hours after the battle, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade brought the female soldiers, Zhou Yijin and Liu Le, onto the disguised assignments ship. 76 hours post-battle, the 15 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit boarded the ship.","The soldiers secretly sent by the Chinese side ended their dangerous journey in Myanmar and finally returned home.","General Minlai was so anxious that there was a huge blister at the corner of his mouth. It had been a few days but he still couldn’t find any traces of the Chinese female soldiers. Could it be that they had flown back to China?","General Minlai was a little exasperated that he couldn’t find the Chinese female soldiers. However, what could he do?","The checkpoints had been set up. They had also sent people along the borders of China and Myanmar. They even sent helicopters to scout. There had been no news for the past few days.","But soon, his attention was diverted. Cobra, who had returned to Molaban, had transferred the profits from the first cooperation to General Minlai’s private account and started the second cooperation.","Luke said to Xia Jinyuan, who was able to get up slowly, “Mr. Cobra has already completed a deal with General Minlai. It looks like their cooperation is very pleasant.”","Xia Jinyuan, who didn’t care about this, only said, “Not bad.” He didn’t take it to heart at all.","He only knew that his little fox must know that he was still alive. Now, all that was left for her to do was to wait for him to come back.","It had been a hasty farewell. Xia Jinyuan sighed softly. After returning to the country, he needed to compensate her properly.","Sitting in the boat, the soldiers could see Ye Jian drinking the vanilla water like wine. She refused to be disturbed by anyone and sat alone. Her back view was thin and lonely.","Her comrades, who were silently watching her back, were restrained and didn’t dare to disturb her. G3 sighed and said, “Let her be alone. Although she knows that the captain is fine, it won’t be easy to cross that hurdle.”","How hopeless was she when she saw her boyfriend falling in front of her?","It wasn’t easy for her, so they should let her sit alone in peace.","Ye Jian, who rarely drank, didn’t think about anything else. She just wanted to sit alone for a while. She didn’t want to think about anything. She wanted to empty her mind. She didn’t want to talk or be disturbed. She wanted to be alone."]},{"number":4007,"title":"Chapter 4007: Those Who Insult Our Country Must Be Killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4007: Those Who Insult Our Country Must Be Killed","Editor: Henyee Translations","She held the bottle of water in her right hand and used her left hand to cover the top of her right arm. She held it tightly as if she was trying to grab something.","The ship started to enter China’s territory. In the morning fog, Ye Jian saw a bright red flag fluttering in the morning breeze. The color was so red that it was dazzling.","This color was on her right arm too. That night, her man placed his hand here and held it tightly until he said, “Leave...”","His chest was in so much pain that he couldn’t say many words. He could only cover the position of the flag with his hand and tell her that she needed to prioritize the country. He wanted to let her know how important the country was to him.","No matter where he was, his heart never left his ‘country’. Even when he was heavily injured, he didn’t forget to touch the flag.","‘Captain Xia, I’ll wait for you in our country!’","Looking at the flag that was getting brighter and brighter in the morning mist, Ye Jian slowly stood up. The sound of orderly footsteps came from behind. Ye Jian turned around and walked over firmly to complete the formation.","“Salute!”","G3’s hoarse but majestic voice sounded. All the members looked at the flag that was fluttering in the wind firmly. With a swish, they raised their arms and saluted.","They had returned to their country!","‘Q King, we’re back. Please come back as soon as possible!’","The border defense armed police officers who boarded the ship to welcome them puffed out their chests and held steel guns in their hands. They raised their chins slightly and looked at the bright red flag with unwavering eyes.","They came back victorious and lived up to their mission!","Those who humiliated their country had to be killed no matter how far they were!","A few minutes past 7:00 am, the captain of the border defense drug hunting team, Xu Yu, called. The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had successfully returned to the country while protecting the two female soldiers. They would go to the border defense hospital for a physical examination after a short rest at the main border defense station.","Zhou Yijin, who was undergoing a physical examination, suddenly started crying for some reason. When the female military surgeon who was examining her saw this, she gently waved her hand and asked everyone to leave so that the female soldier could cry for a while.","Sometimes, crying was a form of self-regulation. It was better to cry.","Ye Jian came back an hour later than Zhou Yijin. She checked into the border defense general hospital and told the doctor about her situation. She did a waist CT scan before going to the doctor to remove the broken thorns in her calves.","She lifted her leg pants and lay flat on the bed. The nurse beside her, who was holding a medical tray, couldn’t bear to look.","There was not a single piece of intact skin below her knees. Blood lines were drawn out by the thorns. There were even a few areas where her flesh was torn off.","The male soldier who examined her during the march had even said that it was not a big problem...","It wasn’t a big problem?","There wasn’t a single part of her calves that was fine. How could he say that it wasn’t a big problem?","What would define a big problem?","As for the wound on Ye Jian’s tongue, although it had been sutured, it still hurt during the examination.","The doctor wore white medical gloves and said to Ye Jian, “I need to use saline to clean your wound before I can proceed. It’ll hurt a little. Just bear with it.”","As he spoke, he looked at the female soldier lying on the bed and sighed. “We can’t use an anesthetic needle. It’ll hurt for a long time. I’ll speed up.”","“Okay,” Ye Jian closed her eyes and replied with a smile. She would bear with the pain for a while. It was not a big deal.","K7 said that it was not a big deal. Ye Jian felt that it was not a big deal too.","Several bottles of saline were used to clean the wound. The doctor didn’t dare to use too much strength when he was using tweezers to wipe the wound. The nurse at the side was afraid that Ye Jian wouldn’t be able to take it, so she kept saying, “Hang in there for a while more. It’s almost done. It’ll be done soon.”"]},{"number":4008,"title":"Chapter 4008: A Tolerant Female Soldiers","paragraphs":["Chapter 4008: A Tolerant Female Soldiers","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian nodded sleepily. It was a little painful, but it was alright.","After using a few bottles of saline, the doctor raised his head and said to the female soldier who had her eyes closed, “We can start picking out the thorns now. Some of the thorns are too deep. If you can’t stand it, you can tell me. We’ll stop for a moment before starting again.”","The female soldier, who had her eyes closed, didn’t answer. The nurse took a look and walked closer. She lowered her voice and said in surprise, “Director Dai, she’s asleep.”","“She’s asleep?” Director Dai got up slightly to take a look. Ye Jian was really asleep!","He thought that she would be in so much pain that she wouldn’t be able to take it. However, he didn’t expect her to fall asleep.","How tired was she?","Ye Jian was too tired after returning to the country. The pain in her legs couldn’t stop the drowsiness from sweeping over her. Even Director Dai, who was in charge of picking out the thorns, didn’t wake her up.","The nurse’s heart ached when she saw this.","It took Director Dai three hours to remove all the broken thorns from Ye Jian’s calves. Looking at the bloody thorns on the tray, the numb nurse rushed out.","Commander Xia, who was about to push the door open, saw the tray in the nurse’s hand. He looked at it with a dark gaze and asked the nurse, “Have you picked out everything?”","This was the border defense general hospital. The nurse was very familiar with the military ranks. When she saw that it was a lieutenant general, she immediately said, “Chief, Director Dai has already picked out all the thorns. That female soldier has been sleeping and hasn’t woken up.”","Little Ye fell asleep?","If she was asleep, he wouldn’t be able to wake her up.","Commander Xia, who specially came to take a look at Ye Jian’s condition, stopped in his tracks. After Doctor Dai came out, he asked about Ye Jian’s situation seriously.","The results of the CT scan on Ye Jian’s waist were out. Doctor Dai took the CT scan from the nurse and replied seriously, “The overall situation is not bad. All the broken thorns on her calves have been picked out. Although there’s inflammation, it’s not a big problem.”","After taking a closer look at the scan, Director Dai saw the stern face of the commander sitting in front of him. He didn’t dare to look at him directly, but he smiled.","Seeing the doctor smile, Commander Xia’s tense expression relaxed.","“It looks like there’s nothing major with her waist. Her waist muscles are injured, and she needs to rest for two to three months. She can’t undergo excessive training for the next few months.”","Commander Xia remembered everything. He planned to let Ye Jian have a good rest for the next two to three months after she went to the National Science University.","While Ye Jian was sleeping soundly, Commander Xia went to visit other wards. However... everyone was asleep. Those who needed to be checked and those who needed to treat their wounds... had all fallen asleep after they were examined and treated.","The border defense had sent an armed police soldier to keep an eye on the patients’ IV drip at every ward. When they saw a chief with the military rank of a lieutenant general pushing the door open and entering, they hurriedly saluted. However, Commander Xia stopped them gently.","The Chinese soldiers lying on the sickbeds were too tired. They should have a good sleep. They shouldn’t be woken up because of him.","Not all the comrades were asleep. G3 wasn’t asleep. He was looking through the medical records of his comrades so that he could know about their situation immediately.","Commander Xia pushed open the last ward at the end of the corridor. G3, whose arm was still on an IV drip, looked up. Commander Xia was here!","He pulled the needle out of his arm. His actions were so fast that Commander Xia didn’t even have the time to stop him. G3 pulled the needle out and jumped down from the bed. Then, he saluted and said, “Chief.”","Commander Xia didn’t expect him to move so quickly. It was so fast that he was shocked."]},{"number":4009,"title":"Chapter 4009: The Good People Of China","paragraphs":["Chapter 4009: The Good People Of China","Editor: Henyee Translations","The loud call of ‘Chief’ woke V8 up from his sleep. V8 opened his eyes abruptly. His first reaction was the same as G3.","This time, Commander Xia reacted in time and shouted, “Don’t move.” He finally managed to stop V8 from pulling the needle.","“Stop the bleeding on your arm first.” Commander Xia finished his drink and looked at G3, who was pulling out the needle quickly. He glanced at G3’s bloodstained arm and strode into the ward.","V8 had woken up. Sitting on his bed, he watched Commander Xia walk in with a serious expression. He pressed the call bell beside their bed and informed the nurse to come over and reattach the needle.","G3 was ordered by the commander to lie back down on the bed. Then, V8 slowly lay back on the bed too.","It was a little scary. Even the commander came to patrol the wards. How were they supposed to lie down?","“I came to see you. You don’t have to look like you’re facing a formidable enemy.” Commander Xia, who was waiting for the nurse to come over, stood and said to the two of them, “I didn’t expect to wake you up. I’m very sorry.”","How could they let the commander apologize? The two of them replied in unison, “You’re being too polite, Chief!”","“I’m really sorry. You’re all good men from our country. You came back victorious. On behalf of our country and our people, I thank you. Thank you for protecting the dignity of our country. Thank you for protecting our country and letting those despicable people know the consequences of insulting our country.","“Thank you!”","The commander stood and saluted the two iron-blooded soldiers. G3 and V8, who were sitting on their beds, saluted back at the same time. “Chief, this is our responsibility!”","Protecting the dignity of the country and protecting the country’s territory was what a soldier should do.","Commander Xia felt proud of them as he looked at their resolute gazes.","It was precisely because of this group of soldiers who weren’t afraid of making sacrifices that the country was stable and the people were safe.","Commander Xia waited for the nurse to reattach the IV drip on G3 again. After chatting with them for a while, he asked the two of them to have a good rest. He ordered G3 to go through his comrades’ medical records after he had rested.","Before he left, he took all the medical records away and didn’t give G3 a chance to look at them again.","After watching Commander Xia leave, V8 whispered to G3, “The more I look at him, the more I feel that our captain and the commander are very similar. Both of them have the surname Xia. Do you think... they’re really father and son?”","Could they be father and son? They were father and son to begin with.","“If you know too much, you might be silenced by the captain. Sleep!” G3, who knew Xia Jinyuan’s identity, glanced at the curious V8. V8 was shocked by the revelation. He fell onto the bed, closed his eyes, and fell asleep quickly.","The chief had already ordered him to sleep. He must listen to his orders and sleep.","V8 was shocked by the sudden news. Father and son... Commander Xia and their captain were really father and son.","F*ck!","There had been a crown prince beside him!","He didn’t know about it until today!","“Yin Rong, stop pretending to be asleep. Tell me, when did you know who the captain is?”","G3 replied to his comrade with his snoring.","When did he know?","When he took over the vice-captain position, he had been as shocked as V8.","He didn’t know that there had been a crown prince beside him!","He had even fought with the crown prince before, even discussing how to spar with the crown prince.","When the crown prince’s identity was exposed, G3 almost wanted to become a deserter."]},{"number":4010,"title":"Chapter 4010: Having A Low Profile Is Scary Too","paragraphs":["Chapter 4010: Having A Low Profile Is Scary Too","Editor: Henyee Translations","That was why it was not good to keep a low profile sometimes. It was easy to scare your comrades!","G3 fell asleep as he thought about it. V8 bit on the blanket. In the end, he couldn’t win against G3 and fell asleep too. The good men who finally returned to the country put down their armor and didn’t have to worry about the dangers around them anymore. They finally fell asleep.","When Ye Jian opened her eyes, a corner of the warm sunset shone through the window of the ward. She blinked lightly. She couldn’t tell how long she had slept. One day and one night? Or was it just one day?","“You’re awake? Did you sleep well?”","A kind and deep voice was heard. Ye Jian was squinting her eyes as she looked at the setting sun. When she heard the familiar voice, she jumped up from the bed. It was Commander Xia’s voice!","Why was the commander here?","Commander Xia felt helpless. Why were all of them so shocked?","They kept pulling out their needles and jumping up. They didn’t give him enough time to react!","Commander Xia became more casual in front of his future daughter-in-law. He walked over and said to Ye Jian, “I was shocked by your reaction.","“Hurry up and lie down. Don’t hurt your waist.”","After he finished speaking, he said to the armed police officer beside him, “Let the doctor take a look.”","“Yes, Chief!” The armed police officer sent by the border defense got pardoned and hurriedly left the ward. He had to control the number of times he blinked when he stayed in the same room as the chief. It was too stressful.","Ye Jian had no intention of lying down. She wasn’t as afraid of Commander Xia as before. Especially when she heard his tone, Ye Jian knew that she wasn’t facing the commander of the military right now. She was facing her elder.","“Why are you here?” Ye Jian’s black eyes were bright after sleeping. She was pleasantly surprised.","“How long have you been here? Why didn’t you wake me up? I kept you waiting.”","The wound on her tongue caused her to sound a little muffled when she spoke. However, it was much better than before.","Seeing that she had no intention of lying down, Commander Xia looked at the end of the sickbed. Then, he bent down and cranked the wand that could control the angle of the sickbed. Amidst the creaking sounds, Commander Xia smiled and said, “You were sleeping too soundly. I couldn’t bear to wake you up. You don’t want to lie down? Sit down and talk to me. Don’t speak too fast, though. Your tongue is still injured.”","In front of Ye Jian, Commander Xia directly told her to address him as ‘Dad’.","In the past, Ye Jian used to feel embarrassed when she heard this. Now, she was used to it.","However, she still felt a little embarrassed. Commander Xia had already come to take care of her. If she knew this would happen... she would have asked the armed police for help.","“Dad, take a break. It’s very comfortable for me to lean like this.” Ye Jian asked the commander to stop adjusting the bed. She obediently called him ‘Dad’. The smile on Commander Xia’s face deepened.","Commander Xia sat beside the bed and looked at Ye Jian, who had gotten skinnier. Her face was smaller than before. He sighed and said, “You need to rest well during this period of time. You can’t force yourself when you go back to school. If you don’t recover from your waist injury, it’ll become an old illness that will affect your future.","“Fight when you need to and rest when you need to. The two can’t be confused. I’ll call your school and ask them to keep an eye on you. Don’t let yourself go the moment you relax.”","Ye Jian, who was leaning against the bed, listened and nodded from time to time. She had to be sensible and not go against the elders who cared about her."]},{"number":4011,"title":"Chapter 4011: That’s Not Right","paragraphs":["Chapter 4011: That’s Not Right","Editor: Henyee Translations","Every time Captain Xia met Commander Xia, the father and son would argue with each other. Thus, she would go along with Commander Xia and not let him think that she was a thorn in his side too.","Commander Xia felt comfortable with Ye Jian’s obedience.","That was why daughters were better than sons!","His son was born to anger his parents. When had Little Six ever listened to him obediently?","Every time he opened his mouth, his arrogance would easily ignite the anger in Commander Xia’s heart. He really wanted to shoot his son.","A daughter was still the best. Look at how thoughtful and obedient Ye Jian was!","He wanted a granddaughter in the future. He didn’t even want a grandson anymore. If his grandson inherited all the flaws of his father, the two rascals in the family would cause a mess every day!","Ye Jian, who was always well-behaved in front of her elders, waited for Commander Xia to finish speaking. Then, she nodded and replied, “I’ll listen to your arrangements, Dad. I’ll definitely take good care of myself.”","“That’s right. If Little Six were as obedient as you, I wouldn’t have to worry about becoming old.” Commander Xia smiled and nodded. He naturally changed the topic to Xia Jinyuan. The smile on his face didn’t disappear. “You’re lying on the bed now, and here I am, nagging at you. Little Ye, I hope you won’t complain that I’m noisy.”","The commander turned the sad topic into a joke. Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile again. “I’ll definitely note your concern for him and pass word of it to him.”","“Yes, you need to tell him. He acts arrogantly in front of me and even wants me to salute him in the future. Listen, is this what a son should say? Why is he trying to kick me down?","“He has always been someone with his own opinions. Once he decides on something, even ten horses won’t be able to pull him back. If I want to teach him a lesson, he’ll say that I’m being nosy. He’ll only be happy if I jump up in anger every time.","“However, this kid does have some ability. Despite my objection, he’ll still do what he wants and complete his mission beautifully. After that, he will show off in front of me. I really want to slap him.”","Commander Xia reprimanded his unfilial son in front of his future daughter-in-law. It sounded like he was reprimanding Captain Xia, but he was telling Ye Jian that Xia Jinyuan would never make a wrong decision.","How could the intelligent Ye Jian not tell? Her gaze was gentle as she smiled. Of course, she knew that Captain Xia wouldn’t do anything stupid.","As her future father-in-law, Commander Xia was worried. When he knew that the injury on Ye Jian was caused by his son, Commander Xia wanted to rush to his unfilial son who was at risk of losing Ye Jian anytime and scold him for a few days.","Xia Jinyuan had said that he would coax Ye Jian, but look at what he did. Just when did he coax her?","Commander Xia, who was afraid that Ye Jian would dump Xia Jinyuan, felt that he needed to appear and coax Ye Jian for his unfilial son.","Ye Jian smiled and said slowly, “Captain Xia is very smart and powerful. He has considered all his decisions carefully. He wouldn’t make a decision casually.","“Our comrades are very impressed with him. Sometimes, I feel that there’s nothing he can’t do. I even wonder if there’s nothing in this world that can stump him.”","She spoke in an admiring tone. The gaze in her eyes became more intense.","Commander Xia wanted to ask if they were talking about the same person. Why didn’t they sound alike?"]},{"number":4012,"title":"Chapter 4012: Conscientious","paragraphs":["Chapter 4012: Conscientious","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Dad, you definitely don’t know how powerful Captain Xia is in the military, right? Two years ago, there were new recruits in the military unit. They were all top soldiers chosen by the various military districts in the country. They didn’t respect Captain Xia at all. Later on, they all respected him. It didn’t take long before they were all subdued by him.”","This is a magical Beastmaster World called “Blue Star.”","Over two thousand years ago, when Blue Star developed two moons, the world saw the birth of Guardian Beastmasters and Star Martial Artists.","Becoming a Guardian Beastmaster, obtaining the qualifications of Beastmaster’s Space, one could contract with and fight alongside awakened Demon Beasts.","Those who couldn’t become Guardian Beastmasters had the chance to awaken as Star Martial Artists, absorbing Star Power and practicing Martial Arts.","However, Star Martial Artists are far inferior to Guardian Beastmasters.","Here, it is the world of Guardian Beasts!","This is the era of Guardian Beasts!","Every year on this day, two hundred thousand young men and women are transported to this world by the “Mist.”","Two hundred thousand people are randomly selected and scattered across the world.","This is the Guidance Plaza outside East Sea City in Tang Country.","Currently, there are twenty thousand people at the Guidance Plaza.","Next, these twenty thousand people will undergo “Awakening Guidance” in batches.","Through the Awakening Guidance, they may awaken their talents and become Guardian Beastmasters or Star Martial Artists.","After the Awakening Guidance is completed, whether awakened or not, everyone must collect cold weapons such as swords and participate in a trial; the trial is...","To stay in the wilderness jungle outside the square for three days and three nights!","Those who survive three days later have passed the trial!","Teams are allowed, but each team must not exceed four members.","Those who pass the trial, whether as Guardian Beastmasters or Star Martial Artists, can directly enter one of the three major academies in East Sea City to train in Beast Mastery and Martial Arts.","Those who did not awaken talents but passed the trial can get a second chance for Awakening.","Whether transported here or born on Blue Star, everyone only has two chances to awaken in their lifetime.","If, after undergoing the life-and-death trial, the second Awakening Guidance still does not awaken any talents...","Then these people must work as Miners in the mines outside East Sea City for three years before they can enter East Sea City to live.","This rule applies to the main cities of all countries on Blue Star.","“What? Even if I awaken talent, I still have to participate in this life and death trial!”","“The wilderness jungle outside has trees towering over three hundred feet, who knows what kind of monsters are inside? Providing us only with cold weapons like swords, how can we possibly defeat them?”","“Even if you had guns, what good would they be? You see that giant ant, do you think ordinary guns can kill it? And that King Kong... the King Kong from King Kong’s Skull Island, it has destroyed several fighter jets!”","“Damn, they even restrict the team size to four people! If we encounter these four horrifying Demon Beasts at once, even if all four of us were carrying rocket launchers, we might still not stand a chance!”","In the square, noise and panic arose once more.","People were alarmed and at a loss.","But the giant Black Ape whispered a quiet roar, and all the noise vanished instantly.","In this Different World, rules are made by the strong!","Surviving well in this world is not easy.","Without bargaining chips, without value, without strength, you are merely dust.","Many people calmed down after the Black Ape’s roar.","“Alright!”","The woman on the shoulder of the twenty-meter-tall Black Ape gently waved her hand and said, “I believe you all roughly understand your situation now and know where this place is... This is Tang Country, East Sea City!”","“After the Awakening Guidance is completed, we will give each of you a Smart wristwatch to wear on your wrist. It is a combination of a mobile phone and a computer, and you can connect to the network using that device to access a lot of information you may want to know.”","At this moment, a young man mustered the courage to ask, “After the Awakening Guidance, can we choose not to participate in the trial?”","“If we still cannot awaken as Guardian Beastmasters or Star Martial Artists after trying the trial, can we choose not to work as Miners?”","The woman on the Black Ape’s shoulder started laughing, “You cannot choose not to participate. Those unwilling to participate will be killed on the spot!”","“Killed on the spot...” The previously speaking young man was greatly startled.","The woman continued, “Of course, after partaking in the trial, you can choose not to work as a Miner.”","“If you don’t work as a Miner, you can’t live in East Sea City; you’ll have to live in the wilderness... outside the main city, which we generally refer to as the wilderness.”","“The world is vast, and if you possess strength, you can go anywhere.”","“But let me remind you...”","“Outside the main city, the wilderness is fraught with peril, teeming with countless extraordinary monsters and alien races. Even the powerful Guardian Beastmasters and Star Martial Artists tread carefully as if on thin ice.”","“So think it through whether you want to be a Miner or not.”","“Alright, let’s start lining up now.”","“Prepare for the Awakening guidance!”","“Fifty people in a group, forming three circles around a lighthouse.”","“Each group has only five minutes for Awakening.”","“Begin!”","The woman standing on the Black Ape’s shoulder did not give people another chance to ask questions.","Teams of fully armed soldiers came and started guiding the people to line up.","On the east side of the square, a group of soldiers brought out several objects resembling lighthouses.","Ten “lighthouses” in total, each over three meters tall and emitting a faint blue light.","The crowd surged forward, with many people beginning to push towards the front.","Nearby, a burly young man tugged at Chen Fan’s sleeve: “Little brother, since everyone has a chance to awaken, there’s no need to rush. Let’s hang back a bit and watch first?”","Chen Fan nodded and extended his right hand: “Chen Fan.”","The young man grinned and shook his hand: “Wang Teng.”","Chen Fan: “...”","My son Wang Teng has the makings of an Emperor!","That name...","Chen Fan looked peculiar: “Brother Wang, do you usually read novels?”","Wang Teng was taken aback: “Why would I read those things?”","Chen Fan: “...”","Alright, this guy probably doesn’t read novels normally, and because he is physically strong and big, people don’t dare to joke with him about it, so he’s always been unaware.","“Little brother, after the Awakening guidance is over, let’s form a team together?”","Wang Teng looked at Chen Fan and whispered, “Then we’ll find two more people and take a crack at the jungle!”","“If we can awaken and become Guardian Beastmasters or Star Martial Artists, we can help each other and grow together!”","Chen Fan nodded slightly: “Okay.”","Suddenly!","Chen Fan felt as if an electric current had passed through his entire body.","“Beastmaster System activating, 10%, 40%, 70%...”","“Beastmaster System successfully activated!”","“Beastmaster’s Space successfully established!”","The next moment...","“Boom!”","In Chen Fan’s mind, a strange square space was opened.","This square space, roughly thirty square meters in size, had a sky dotted with white clouds, green grass on the ground, and even a body of water... oh, it was actually just a small water pit.","“There has never been a problem with his decisions. If there’s a problem, he’d never make his own decision. He’d definitely discuss it with all the comrades. Once danger comes, he’d be the first to rush in and the last to retreat.","“He often jokes with us and trains us until we can’t even get up. We went from being unconvinced to being convinced. It’s all because we respect the captain.”","..."]},{"number":4013,"title":"Chapter 4013: An Outstanding Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 4013: An Outstanding Person","Editor: Henyee Translations","Commander Xia listened attentively. The more he listened, the more solemn his facial expressions became.","Xia Jinyuan was the rascal of the family, but it wasn’t that way in the eyes of others. In Little Ye’s eyes, he was a responsible man. In his comrades’ eyes, he was a charismatic and courageous captain.","Was this... really his son?","Why did it sound like two different people?","Or did he really not understand his son? Was that why he felt this way?","He also knew that Little Six was an unyielding soldier who lived up to his country’s reputation. In order to find out the last power around Cobra as soon as possible, he didn’t hesitate to use ruthless methods such as letting his comrade stab a dagger into his heart.","Although he had always looked down on Little Six, he was proud of having such an outstanding son.","He always knew that his son, who was becoming a lieutenant colonel step by step, was very capable. However, he didn’t expect him to have such a high position in his comrades’ hearts.","Good job, Little Six!","This was how the men of the Xia family should be. They were heroes in life and heroes in death!","At first, Commander Xia thought that Ye Jian was being bullied by Xia Jinyuan and needed to take a breather. But now, he understood a new side of his son. He didn’t know it, but it made him proud.","Commander Xia finally understood why Ye Jian admired Xia Jinyuan so much. He had too many shining points. It was easy for people to admire him.","Commander Xia finally stopped thinking that the person his future daughter-in-law was talking about was not the same person as his son. He returned to her ward.","G3, who had returned to his ward, wiped the cold sweat off his forehead and said to V8 with lingering fear, “Just now, the commander stopped me and asked me to talk about the captain. At that time, I really thought that he was here to settle the scores with me. I was so frightened that I almost became a deserter.”","“F*ck, what did you say?” V8 widened his eyes in shock. “The commander only called you for questioning? He didn’t call anyone else, right?”","Damn, he might want to be a deserter too.","“That should be all. Should I inform K7 and let him be mentally prepared?” G3 was about to go out again, but V8 stopped him. “Don’t go. What if you meet the commander? Won’t he know that you went to inform K7 immediately?","“What did you say to the commander? Did you say anything bad about the captain? There’s nothing wrong with the captain. You didn’t say anything bad, right?","“What can’t I say? I just told the truth. The commander didn’t have any expression on his face. I couldn’t tell if he was happy or not.”","“If he lets you see whether he’s happy or not, the commander wouldn’t be the commander.” V8 glanced at the door of the ward as he spoke. Then, he whispered, “Why don’t we go back to the military unit tonight? I’m a little anxious to be in the same hospital as the commander.”","He had punched and kicked the commander’s son. In the end, the commander’s son was stabbed in the chest. Although there was a reason why he did this and the commander knew about it... he felt a little guilty now. He wasn’t confident.","“Don’t panic, don’t panic. Don’t forget that we still have Azure Bird as our trump card. Think about Azure Bird. Calm down, calm down.” G3 comforted his comrade and himself.","The ace, Azure Bird, was chatting happily with Commander Xia. The topic continued to revolve around Xia Jinyuan. Even though Commander Xia already knew his son’s new side, he was a little worried when he saw Ye Jian’s infatuated gaze.","Didn’t Little Ye suppress Little Six in the past? Why did everything... change?","If this continued, would she become afraid of her husband?","That wouldn’t do!","All the men in the Xia family were afraid of their wives. Little Six was no exception."]},{"number":4014,"title":"Chapter 4014: Need To Be A Little Domineering","paragraphs":["Chapter 4014: Need To Be A Little Domineering","Editor: Henyee Translations","Commander Xia said earnestly, “Little Ye, you can’t pamper Little Six too much. That’s not right. I told you before that Little Six has a bright personality. You can’t pamper him too much.","“You can’t spoil a man. If you spoil him, he’ll get into trouble. Your eldest uncle has a high position, but in front of your aunt, your uncle can’t say anything harsh.","“Your youngest uncle is the same. He challenged your aunt once, but in the end, Old Madam appeared and took photos of your uncle and grandson...” Commander Xia immediately changed his words. “Your uncle immediately became obedient. He no longer challenges your aunt anymore.","“You’ve seen the others too. When your sisters-in-law play cards, your brothers-in-law have to serve them tea and water. Your brothers-in-law can’t go home all year round, so your sisters-in-law handle all the big and small matters in the family. When they come back for their vacation, they have to perform well to make up for their wives’ hard work.","“Little Ye, I hope that you can continue the glorious tradition of the Xia family. Don’t lose it. Yes, I know that Little Six is indeed powerful and I admit that I misunderstood him. I chatted with your comrades for a while just now. I’m proud of Little Six.","“But you can’t be mesmerized by him just because he’s amazing. You have to suppress him. Otherwise, I won’t feel at ease.”","Halfway through, Ye Jian opened her mouth a few times. Then, she was stunned by Commander Xia’s stern gaze.","“Little Six is lying down now, but you’re lying down too. You don’t have to feel that you owe him. You don’t owe him anything. When he’s working hard, you’re working hard too. When he’s in danger, you’re in danger too. You owe him nothing.","“Remember what I said today. Don’t put shackles on yourself. That’s his responsibility. Don’t regret the mission given to him by his military uniform.","“You’ll be the same in the future. You’ll be an outstanding person in life and a hero in death. You were born on this path. You’ll walk a path that’ll be glorious for thousands of years. You’ll protect the dignity of the country and protect the integrity of the country. This piece of land will be beautiful because of you.","“We live and die for the benefit of our country. We can’t avoid calamity and fortune. There’s no way out. We can only move forward. This is the nature of a soldier. You don’t owe him anything. Do you hear me?”","The last sentence was as loud as thunder. Ye Jian, who was leaning against the wall, straightened her body instantly. Her facial expression was extremely solemn as she accepted Commander Xia’s instructions.","Then, she successfully swallowed the words in her heart that she didn’t finish.","Commander Xia saw that Ye Jian had taken his words to heart and nodded in satisfaction. It was getting late, so he asked Ye Jian to have a good rest. He would go and see if his niece had woken up.","“Dad, Captain Xia and I will always be fine. Don’t worry. Also, Dad, I’ll always remember the things you say. I won’t forget them.","“I admire Captain Xia very much, but it’s not just because of him. It’s also because of his loyalty to this country. I’ve always admired him, but I will never let him bully me.","“After all, sometimes life requires a bit of dominance, don’t you think?”","As expected of the daughter-in-law Commander Xia was satisfied with. Her comprehension was high.","Now, he knew that she would wait for Little Six to come back in peace. He was relieved that she didn’t have any psychological trauma.","Commander Xia, who specially waited for Ye Jian to wake up to talk, left the ward in satisfaction."]},{"number":4015,"title":"Chapter 4015: It’s Human Nature To Be Selfish","paragraphs":["Chapter 4015: It’s Human Nature To Be Selfish","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Commander Xia knew that Ye Jian saw her comrade stab a knife into Little Six’s chest with her own eyes and couldn’t stop herself from vomiting blood, his expression had immediately turned sharp. He quickly called a psychologist to ask about the potential psychological problems she would face.","It could be said that Commander Xia had been waiting for Ye Jian to wake up. He wanted to enlighten Ye Jian immediately so that she wouldn’t have any sequelae after the battle. That was what often happened when a soldier saw their comrade collapse.","He would never allow Ye Jian to have this kind of sequela that would trouble her for life.","Commander Xia was relieved now. His son and future daughter-in-law, who he was so proud of, had returned safely. He could finally have a good sleep tonight.","Zhou Yijin was sleeping soundly. Her sleeping posture wasn’t proper. Commander Xia covered her with a blanket and quietly sat at the side to rest.","The three children were fine. He felt at ease sitting down.","Zhou Yijin had never suffered much since she was young. Although she entered the military unit and became a military arts soldier, she didn’t suffer as much as Little Ye did during her month of training. However, this time, she had received a big shock.","She seemed to have lost a lot of weight. She needed to replenish her energy.","Commander Xia sat quietly for a while before getting up to leave. He had been in Yun Province for many days. It was time to return to the military.","Zhou Yijin, who was woken up by hunger, opened her eyes in a daze. She looked at the side of the bed unintentionally. Then, she saw a black shadow and screamed.","The armed police officer outside had already placed his hand on the door lock. He thought for a moment and retracted his hand.","The chief probably didn’t turn on the lights, which scared the female soldier.","Zhou Yijin was shocked. Commander Xia, who was thinking about something, got a shock too. He said in a low voice, “Yijin, it’s me, Third Uncle.”","The lights were turned on with a click. Zhou Yijin’s face was pale. She looked at her uncle with shock in her eyes. Her teeth were trembling. “Third Uncle, you scared me so much that my soul left my body! I thought I had been kidnapped again!”","“There are a bunch of people guarding you outside. Why are you afraid of getting kidnapped? Who can kidnap you?” Commander Xia rubbed his temples that were hurting from the scream. He wanted to ask her where she was feeling unwell, but Zhou Yijin had already opened her mouth anxiously.","“Third Uncle, have you seen Sixth Cousin-in-law? Is she back? How is she now? Is she in the hospital too?”","After a series of questions, Commander Xia couldn’t help but laugh. This woman was two years older than Little Ye, but she addressed Little Ye as ‘Sixth Cousin-in-law’ so easily.","“Your sixth cousin-in-law is fine. She’s in the same hospital as you. I just saw her. Everything is fine. You just need to take care of yourself.”","When Zhou Yijin heard this, she fell back onto the bed forcefully. She started talking about her own affairs.","In the end, she sobbed softly and said to Commander Xia, “Third Uncle, I feel that I’ll never be able to become a female soldier like Sixth Cousin-in-law. I won’t be able to be like Sixth Cousin-in-law who came to save me without any fear because of my words alone.","“Third Uncle, am I very selfish? Sixth Cousin-in-law can risk her life to save me, but I’ve asked myself many times if I can do the same. There’s only one answer. I can’t do it. I really can’t.”","It seemed like the person with the most psychological trauma wasn’t Little Ye. It was his niece, Yijin.","Commander Xia poured a glass of warm water and passed it to her. He said kindly, “Silly girl, how can you think that way? Your responsibilities are different from your sixth cousin-in-law’s. Everything is different.","“It’s human nature to be selfish. Besides, if you’re selfish, you’ll know how to protect yourself. Let me ask you. If you know that your sixth cousin-in-law is in danger one day, will you find someone to save her? Will you be afraid of retaliation?”"]},{"number":4016,"title":"Chapter 4016: Good Thoughts","paragraphs":["Chapter 4016: Good Thoughts","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin, whose eyes were swollen, shook her head. “I can’t save Sixth Cousin-in-law myself, but I’ll definitely look for someone else to save her. I’m not afraid of retaliation.”","“That’s right. This is the biggest difference between selfishness and self-protection. Every single one of us has to learn to protect ourselves first. Your sixth cousin-in-law is no exception. Think about it. Did she do anything to protect herself? I think so. I can tell from the photos.”","Commander Xia had never studied psychology, but at his age and after experiencing so many hardships, he knew how to enlighten others.","Moreover, the person in front of him was his niece.","After hearing what he said, Zhou Yijin seemed to understand something. She said with uncertainty, “Third Uncle, you’re not coaxing me, right?”","...","“You’re a child. Do you still need to be coaxed?” Commander Xia smiled. “You’re already an adult. You’re past the point where you need to be coaxed. Are you hungry? Do you want to eat something? Your sixth cousin-in-law probably isn’t asleep. Do you want to go and take a look?”","Zhou Yijin immediately got out of bed. “I’m not hungry. I want to see Sixth Cousin-in-law.”","Commander Xia, who had to rush back to the capital city overnight, asked the two juniors in his family to chat among themselves. They were both smart children. They would surely have a good chat together. They would enlighten and comfort each other. After experiencing such a thing together, they would warm each other up and survive the most difficult times.","He just hoped that the younger generation in the family would be fine. Commander Xia had put in a lot of effort to make sure of this.","He didn’t ask Ye Jian to send him off. He reminded Ye Jian and Zhou Yijin to take good care of their bodies and chatted with the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit. That night, Commander Xia rushed back to the capital city.","China’s successful rescue of the female soldiers didn’t cause any waves on the international scene. Besides China, there was only Myanmar’s General Minlai who was aware of it.","After searching for a week, he couldn’t find the Chinese female soldiers. General Minlai didn’t put in effort to look for them anymore. He understood that the Chinese female soldiers had already returned to China.","Qin Maosheng’s trusted aide wanted to blow things up but was suppressed by General Minlai.","Two days ago, Ye Jian, who returned to a certain company in the Military District of Southern Province, saw an international piece of news. It reported that General Minlai of Myanmar had sent troops to capture a drug cartel that had been operating at the borders of the four countries for a long time. The cartel relied on drug trafficking for a living. He also executed the three leaders of this group. For a moment, the international community reported about General Minlai.","Ye Jian looked at General Minlai who was speaking righteously on the television. She picked up the remote control and changed the channel.","As she was a patient, she had returned to the Nanguang Military District and had been staying in the military police hospital. She was exempted from all the training and was only waiting to return to school the day after tomorrow.","For the past two days, she had been talking to her comrades who had returned to the military unit. She knew that G3 was on leave after returning to the military unit. He was on wedding leave. He would hold the wedding that was supposed to be held last year on the 15th.","Thus, after she finished reporting to school, she immediately took a plane to G3’s hometown to witness G3’s wedding with several comrades who were on leave.","At 6:00 pm, the students from the National Science University, who were sent down to the company with her, appeared in the ward with two large fruit baskets. They only knew today that Ye Jian, who went out some time ago, was injured and was hospitalized at the military police hospital. They would return to school the next day. The third company commander came to the hospital with them to visit.","The third company commander looked at Ye Jian and didn’t say anything else. He just smiled and said, “Scars represent medals. Congratulations, Ye Jian. You got multiple medals in one go.”","He knew that the female soldier, Ye Jian, had some background. As expected, her injuries after her return alerted the military. The regimental commander even personally reminded him not to ask about her matters after returning to the company. Ye Jian needed to recuperate at the hospital.","It was hard to say how serious her injuries were, but it was obvious that her tongue was severely injured."]},{"number":4017,"title":"Chapter 4017: Something Happened, Return Quick","paragraphs":["Chapter 4017: Something Happened, Return Quick","Editor: Henyee Translations","Looking at the young student whose face revealed nothing, the company commander sighed in his heart. Such a promising female soldier. The next time he saw her, her military rank would probably be higher than his.","The third company commander exchanged a few words with Ye Jian before leaving. He needed to give some space to the young students.","The moment the company commander left, the students exploded.","Ding Ling was a female student. She saw that Ye Jian’s calves were filled with scars and her tongue was so badly injured that she couldn’t speak properly. She sat down and held Ye Jian’s hand. She said with lingering fear, “You almost scared us to death. The company commander told us in the afternoon that you were injured and hospitalized. We didn’t have the mood to train for the entire afternoon. Why did you get injured? You’re so badly injured...”","As she spoke, Ding Ling sounded like she was about to cry.","...","Although they only interacted with Ye Jian for a short period of time, they were familiar with her. When they heard that Ye Jian was injured and hospitalized, they started to worry.","They thought that Ye Jian was seriously injured.","From the looks of it now, she was still alright. Besides the scars on her legs, her body was fine.","“I participated in a drill. I didn’t pay attention and fell into the pit. My legs were pricked by the thorns below. I also hit my waist and accidentally bit my tongue. Other than that, there’s nothing else.","“It’s not a big deal. Why did you come and see me?”","Ye Jian was a little embarrassed. She wasn’t seriously injured. In the end, she made so many people worry about her.","“It’s not a big deal? Look at your pretty face. There are new wounds on it. It’d be a pity if your face was disfigured.”","The students felt more at ease when they heard what she said. Ding Ling smiled and teased Ye Jian. The seriousness in the ward disappeared. They started chatting and laughing.","The students didn’t get up and leave the hospital until 7:30 pm.","The next day, the third company commander asked Ding Ling to come over and accompany Ye Jian back to school on the sleeping berth. The rest of the students sat on hard seats.","On the day they returned to school, Ye Jian didn’t return to school with Ding Ling. She had already reached the train station and was an hour away from boarding the train when she received a call. She rushed to the airport at an extremely urgent speed and flew straight to the capital city.","Uncle Chen, who had spoken to her on New Year’s Eve, was at the general military hospital now. As for what happened, the instructor from the sniper base said that it was best to ask the doctor.","A second ago, Ye Jian was still chatting and laughing with the students. The next second, her expression changed drastically. She only had time to tell Ding Ling that something happened to her family and that she had to go back to the capital city. Ye Jian then picked up her luggage. Before Ding Ling could reply, Ye Jian had already left Ding Ling’s vision.","“What happened?”","“What happened to Ye Jian? Where is she going?”","“Ding Ling, what happened to Ye Jian?”","The male students couldn’t help but ask Ding Ling. Before Ding Ling could react, she said in a daze, “I don’t know. She just said that something happened to her family and she wanted to go back to the capital city. Before I could say anything, she ran off.”","Something happened to her family?","What happened?","“Contact Ye Jian first and ask about the situation before reporting to the school,” said Yu Rong in a low voice. Not many students had cell phones, and neither did he. After taking out the contact list, he asked a student who had a cell phone to contact Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t hear them. She ran out of the train station and jumped into a taxi. Then, she took out her phone and prepared to call the school.","She saw the missed call and called back. “I’ll contact the school myself. Have a safe trip. I’ll contact you when I reach.”"]},{"number":4018,"title":"Chapter 4018: Extremely Urgent","paragraphs":["Chapter 4018: Extremely Urgent","Editor: Henyee Translations","Her voice sounded stable, but in actual fact, Ye Jian was clenching her fists tightly on her knees.","Something had happened to Uncle Chen! She must rush over to visit him.","But why... did something happen to Uncle Chen in the capital city?","When did he go to the capital city?","Why did he go to the capital city?","...","Ever since Li Chuhai appeared and Uncle Chen knew that this identity might be exposed, Uncle Chen had never stepped out of the base. Why did something happen when he came to the capital city?","The person who informed Ye Jian was the instructor of the sniper training base. He knew that besides Ye Jian, Instructor Chen didn’t have any other relatives.","After informing Ye Jian, he waited anxiously.","Instructor Chen was in trouble. He had just come out of the train station when... he got shot!","He was shot at the train station in the capital city. At this moment, the entire train station was under control. The armed police and special police were mobilized to evacuate the crowd quickly while looking for suspicious people.","The instructor of the sniper base was a little worried that Principal Chen wouldn’t be able to make it. In the end, he called Ye Jian.","Commander Xia found out about Principal Chen’s situation later than Ye Jian. Ye Jian arrived in the capital city at 7:00 pm. Commander Xia only found out about Principal Chen’s accident at 9:00 pm after his meeting ended.","At this moment, Ye Jian had already arrived at the hospital. She was still injured, but she quickly ran toward the elevator doors while talking to the instructor of the sniper base.","Her speed was very fast. She was like a gust of wind. Before one could see clearly, she had already run a few meters away.","In the elevator, Qin Xiu was stunned when he saw the figure that suddenly rushed in. Then, he saw that the floor Ye Jian pressed was where the operating room was. Qin Xiu frowned.","Operating room? Old Master Fu?","There was a rich lady beside him who didn’t look too good. She looked similar to Qin Xiu. She was holding a pile of test results in her hand. There was a hint of worry on her face. She still looked as elegant as when she was young. She said to Qin Xiu, “We can’t find any problems every time we come here. Xiu, do you think we should go overseas to take a look? Let’s see if the doctors overseas can find out the problem.”","This was Mrs. Qin. She was having a headache. After dinner today, she suddenly felt pain. Qin Xiu immediately accompanied her to the hospital for a check-up.","After a bunch of check-ups, the results showed that nothing was wrong. But Mrs. Qin felt uneasy.","Ye Jian didn’t notice her surroundings. Her attention was all on the rising numbers in the elevator. Mrs. Qin, who was worried about her own matters, didn’t pay much attention to her either. She didn’t hear Qin Xiu’s reply even after she finished speaking. Mrs. Qin looked up from the papers and saw her son staring at a female student who had entered the elevator.","Mrs. Qin had never seen her son staring at a woman for a long time. She couldn’t help but find it strange. Could it be that this woman was prettier than the daughter of the Du family? Even her son was stunned.","However, it was too rude to stare at a lady like this. Mrs. Qin restrained her expression and reminded him in a low voice, “Qin Xiu, look at these test results.”","Qin Xiu wasn’t stunned because he was looking at Ye Jian. He was wondering if something had happened to Old Master Fu. Then, he remembered that Ye Jian’s identity hadn’t been revealed. He suppressed his urge to ask about the situation and replied to Mrs. Qin patiently, “You have a headache. You just need to rest well. Don’t worry and don’t get angry. You’ll recover naturally.”","Ye Jian’s breathing gradually calmed down. She recognized Qin Xiu’s voice, but she didn’t take the initiative to greet him. She stood on the spot and waited for Qin Xiu to leave the elevator first."]},{"number":4019,"title":"Chapter 4019: Intentional And Accidental","paragraphs":["Chapter 4019: Intentional And Accidental","Editor: Henyee Translations","There were still many people in the general military hospital at around 8:00 pm. The same went for the elevator. When the elevator doors opened again on the third floor, a few more people came in. Ye Jian, who was standing at the front, had to take a step back.","Qin Xiu saw that Ye Jian, who was standing at the front, didn’t seem to have heard his voice. She didn’t even turn her head slightly. What a ruthless woman.","He had confessed to her and said that he wouldn’t cause her any trouble. He had made it clear, but in the end, this heartless woman even rejected a relationship as ordinary friends.","After all, they had fought side by side before and escaped death together. He thought that he was different, but who knew... this difference meant that they couldn’t even be friends.","‘Ruthless woman, do you really want to draw the line between us so clearly?’","...","If they couldn’t be lovers, why couldn’t they be ordinary friends?","Qin Xiu smiled bitterly and sighed softly in his heart. However, Mrs. Qin didn’t realize that she was in the same elevator as the woman her son had a crush on. She saw a hint of resignation in the smile on Qin Xiu’s lips and recalled what Qin Xiu said just now. Mrs. Qin misunderstood.","Mrs. Qin was a little unhappy. She said softly, “I want to worry less and rest more too, but when will you let me stop worrying about your affairs?","“If you want me to rest, don’t make me worry about you.”","Mrs. Qin didn’t say much because they were in public.","However, Ye Jian was really close to the mother and son. Every word that Mrs. Qin said floated into Ye Jian’s ears. Qin Xiu knew that she heard it, and his handsome face showed a little awkwardness.","When the elevator reached the fourth floor, someone wanted to walk out. He opened a path in the middle and squeezed Qin Xiu and Mrs. Qin to the side. Someone else came in from the fourth floor. Ye Jian, who was standing at the front, had to stand to the side too. Qin Xiu raised his arm to protect Mrs. Qin from being squeezed. His bent arm bumped into Ye Jian’s head.","Qin Xiu didn’t expect to bump into Ye Jian’s head either. The smile on his face turned resigned. This time... would she misunderstand him again?","Just now, he really didn’t do it on purpose. It was purely an accident.","“I’m sorry,” he apologized in a low voice. Although it was an accident, there was a hint of anticipation in his heart... He hoped that she would turn around and look at him.","Ye Jian didn’t turn around. She just tilted her head slightly so that Qin Xiu could see her side profile. She said calmly, “It’s alright.”","It was a very calm reply. It was like an interaction between strangers. He thought that she would turn around and take a look at him, but what he got in return was her ruthlessness.","Although he never begged her, his heart still ached. Qin Xiu didn’t say anything else. Everything about her had already told him... that they were strangers who had no interactions. She had already let go of their shared life-and-death experience. Only he was still living in his memories.","They were already on the sixth floor. Qin Xiu escorted Mrs. Qin out of the elevator. Qin Xiu didn’t look back. Instead, Mrs. Qin looked back. Although her gaze was gentle, she didn’t hide the shrewdness in her eyes.","She wanted to see what the woman who made her son lose his mind looked like.","Mrs. Qin’s eyes lit up.","Not bad. This woman’s appearance was even better than the woman she had introduced to Qin Xiu before. She had beautiful eyes and ripples in her eyes. From her gaze, Mrs. Qin felt that this woman had a good heart.","She had a good appearance and a good heart. If she had a good family background, it would be perfect!","Ye Jian, who was looking at the front calmly and naturally, felt Mrs. Qin turning her head and sizing her up. She pretended that she didn’t see anything until the elevator doors closed slowly."]},{"number":4020,"title":"Chapter 4020: Something’s Wrong","paragraphs":["Chapter 4020: Something’s Wrong","Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Qin couldn’t size her up anymore. There was only so much time left. She didn’t even have the chance to take another look.","After the elevator doors closed, Mrs. Qin smiled and said, “No wonder you were in a daze just now. I took a look. She’s not bad. Have you seen her before? Where is she from? I just took a look at her armband. She’s a student from the National Science University. It’s impressive that a woman can enter the National Science University.","“If you like her, I’ll ask around for you. Oh my, look. As long as I mention that there’s hope for your marriage, my head won’t hurt anymore. People are energetic when there’s happy news. I don’t even want to look for a doctor now.”","At first, Qin Xiu felt resigned when Mrs. Qin kept pressuring her. He didn’t want to pay her any attention, but he couldn’t do that now.","That was Ye Jian, not anyone else.","...","“Mom, you’re thinking too much. I’m not lost in thought because of her. I’m thinking if I should really send you overseas to get you examined. Maybe you can go overseas to recuperate. You talked about the woman for so long just now. I don’t know what she looks like at all. I didn’t pay attention to her just now.”","A mother knew her son best. Although Qin Xiu denied it, Mrs. Qin didn’t believe him.","Mrs. Qin looked at him suspiciously and said with a faint smile, “Xiu, you’re my son. Although I can’t guess what you’re thinking, I can still notice the changes in you.","“You elbowed her and stared at her when you apologized. You probably wanted the woman to look back at you.”","All the mothers in the world were the same. They were all experienced. Even the slightest change couldn’t escape their eyes.","Especially a mother who was in a hurry to help her child settle their marriage.","Ye Jian, who was in the elevator, didn’t know what Mrs. Qin was saying. She had to go to the eighth floor first. The instructor of the sniper base was waiting for her on the eighth floor.","As soon as she reached the eighth floor, the elevator doors opened with a ding. Ye Jian rushed out. The entire corridor was filled with Ye Jian’s hurried footsteps.","The sound was like a drum. Just by listening to it, one could tell how anxious the person running was.","The instructor of the sniper base was explaining the situation to the police officer in charge of investigating this matter. The investigation required his cooperation.","Ye Jian ran over and looked at the sign at the door. That’s right, it was the doctor’s conference room on the eighth floor.","She knocked on the door a few times. Before the person inside could reply, Ye Jian had already pushed the door open and entered. She glanced around and saw three uniformed police officers sitting at the conference table. The instructor who called her was sitting opposite them and was being... questioned? Investigated? Interviewed?","Countless thoughts flashed past her mind. In the end, Ye Jian’s expression turned serious.","Something was wrong.","How could there be police when Uncle Chen was sick? Everyone’s expression was serious. There was something wrong!","She thought that she had to go to the doctor’s conference room because Uncle Chen’s condition was serious and the doctors needed to discuss with his family about his condition and the subsequent problems.","However, the appearance of the police told Ye Jian that this was not the case.","The doctors were saving a life while the police were investigating a case. Uncle Chen was indeed not well, but he didn’t fall sick!","She made eye contact with the three police officers and then looked at the instructor of the base. She asked in a deep voice, “Uncle Chen didn’t fall sick. Something happened to him, right?”","The policeman who was taking notes put down the pen in his hand and glanced at his phone. He didn’t know what was going on. But when he and his colleagues took a look at Ye Jian, their gazes turned more serious.","He stood up with his colleagues. “Hello, you’re Uncle Chen’s relative, Ye Jian, right? We’re police officers from the Eastern District. My surname is Lu. These two are my colleagues, Yan Chi and Ji Jie.”"]},{"number":4021,"title":"Chapter 4021: Scheme","paragraphs":["Chapter 4021: Scheme","Editor: Henyee Translations","The moment the instructor saw Ye Jian entering, he heaved a sigh of relief. When Instructor Chen fell, he only said, “Contact Ye Jian as a last resort.”","This was the last resort. Uncle Chen’s family needed to take care of this.","“Ye Jian, Uncle Chen and I came to the capital city together. Uncle Chen was shot by a bullet when we reached the train station square. I’m sorry. I was afraid that you wouldn’t be able to handle it, so I didn’t explain it clearly over the phone.”","Uncle Chen was shot by a bullet?","Hearing this, Ye Jian’s gaze turned sharp. A cold and sharp light shot out like an arrow. She asked the instructor of the base, “Why did Uncle Chen come to the capital city? Who asked Uncle Chen to come? Uncle Chen is still undergoing surgery, right? Which operating room is he in?”","...","He wasn’t sick! Someone had attempted murder on him!","“Ye Jian, calm down a little. This is what we want to know too. The surgery hasn’t ended. We’ll go over together later and wait for the surgery to end.” Officer Lu, who was taking notes, added, “This is the most suspicious part of this case. Besides the person involved, no one knows why he wanted to come to the capital city.","“This comrade doesn’t know either. He and the person involved came to the capital city on leave.”","As he spoke, he used his gaze to signal his colleagues to pour a glass of water for the female soldier who came in. She was so anxious that he couldn’t speak properly. She should drink a glass of water to calm herself down first.","Ye Jian wasn’t so flustered that she needed to drink water to calm down. Her tongue was still healing. The hospital said it would take at least a month before she could speak. Only eleven days had passed.","“Uncle Chen is undergoing surgery now. I can’t stand here and talk. I’m sorry, officers.” Ye Jian wasn’t in the mood to sit here and accept the police’s questioning. She needed to wait outside the operating room. She said to the instructor of the sniper base, “Instructor, cooperate with Officer Lu and the rest for the questioning first. I’ll go to the operating room.”","The policeman poured some water and placed the glass in front of Ye Jian. He said in a low voice, “He’s still undergoing emergency treatment. Let’s take the chance while the patient is undergoing surgery to understand the situation first.","“I need your cooperation too. I want to ask if the person in question has contacted you recently.”","Ye Jian took the glass of water and thanked him. She didn’t drink it but placed it on the table of the conference room. She couldn’t speak faster, so she could only take her time. “Uncle Chen and I talked on New Year’s Eve. I was sent to the grassroots company in the Nanguang Military District. I couldn’t come back to accompany Uncle Chen for New Year’s, so I contacted Uncle Chen.","“On the morning of the first day of the new year, I called Uncle Chen again. After that, I had something on, so it was inconvenient for me to talk to him. I didn’t contact Uncle Chen again after that.”","“You spoke to the person in question twice. Did he reveal that he was coming to the capital city? You’re his only relative. Did you realize that he was hiding something from you?”","Ye Jian replied firmly, “There was nothing abnormal. If Uncle Chen was hiding something from me, I would have more or less noticed it. However, I didn’t.","“At least not during the two calls with my Uncle Chen. If there’s anything amiss with Uncle Chen, it must have happened after he talked to me.","“Also, this matter might exceed the scope of your investigation.” After Ye Jian finished speaking, she looked at the instructor of the sniper base and asked him, “Instructor, did you inform anyone else besides me?","“Where’s Uncle Chen’s phone? See if there are any clues on it. If not, you need to check the recent records on Uncle Chen’s phone. I’m sorry, I need to go to the operating room now. I’m sorry.”"]},{"number":4022,"title":"Chapter 4022: Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4022: Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian wasn’t as calm as her expression. She was anxious. She just wanted to leave this place as soon as possible and wait outside the operating room.","In the past, when something happened to Uncle Chen, she could feel it even when she was in the deep mountains and forests. But this time... she didn’t feel anything at all!","Seeing this, Officer Lu could understand Ye Jian’s anxiety. He nodded and said, “Okay, let’s go over together. Our colleagues are guarding outside the operating room. Don’t worry.”","However, he remembered Ye Jian’s words. This matter might exceed the scope of their investigation. Could it be that... this female soldier knew something but it was inconvenient to reveal it to them?","After receiving the news, Commander Xia called the military. An urgent order was given. Four elites from the guard company rushed over immediately.","...","The guards who came over were not ordinary guards. They were guards who were responsible for guarding the important leaders. The four of them were already on their way to the hospital.","At the same time, Commander Xia arranged for the guards around him to contact the director of the Eastern District branch. They had to retrieve all the surveillance footage at the train station and keep the original disk.","When the director of the Eastern District branch saw that even the military district was alarmed, he personally arranged it and contacted Officer Lu, who was in charge of the case.","At this moment, Officer Lu and his colleagues were in the elevator. The three of them accompanied Ye Jian to the operating room and waited for Uncle Chen’s surgery to end.","Officer Lu, who was holding his phone, listened to the director’s words quietly. The seriousness in his eyes became deeper. The military was taking it seriously. It seemed like the female soldier was right. This case might have exceeded the scope of their investigation.","Currently, they only knew that the person involved, Instructor Chen Dongfeng, was a specially-appointed instructor of a sniper base. As for his personal information... Officer Lu didn’t have it. He couldn’t find Instructor Chen’s personal information even after entering the system. It could be seen that although Instructor Chen was a specially-appointed person and had retired, the military had specially processed his personal information so that others couldn’t find it.","If others couldn’t find any personal information on someone, it meant that the military valued them. This case indeed exceeded Office Lu’s scope of investigation, and the director even personally called to remind him... The three of them would probably be transferred away soon.","The keen criminal investigation officer had already sensed that something was amiss.","The two police officers guarding outside the operating room saw Officer Lu coming over. They stood up from their seats and called him Brother Lu. Then, their gazes landed on Ye Jian.","Uncle Chen hadn’t come out yet. The surgery was still ongoing. They didn’t know the exact situation. They had to wait.","Ye Jian, who wanted to understand the situation, couldn’t even ask the doctors or nurses. She could only wait.","The instructor of the sniper base frowned as he looked at the entrance of the operating room. After taking a few steps, he walked to Ye Jian’s side and used his gaze to signal Ye Jian to talk to him at the side.","Officer Lu took a look and narrowed his eyes.","He thought that he had already understood everything he needed to know. Now, it seemed like that wasn’t the case. Between the police and soldiers... both sides weren’t on par.","“Ye Jian, Instructor Chen’s holiday was a last-minute decision. We didn’t hear Instructor Chen mention it before. A few days ago, Instructor Chen didn’t appear for an afternoon. He said that he was feeling unwell and rested in the dormitory alone. We sent people over to ask Instructor Chen to go get himself checked at the infirmary, but he rejected.”","The instructor of the sniper base didn’t explain these to Officer Lu, who was investigating this case. Principal Chen’s words alerted him, and he subconsciously hid these details.","Now that Ye Jian was here, he told her everything.","When Ye Jian heard that, she clenched her fists tightly. Before entering the capital city... Uncle Chen probably knew that the trip was dangerous.","The only thing that could make Uncle Chen feel threatened... was his identity."]},{"number":4023,"title":"Chapter 4023: Disclosure","paragraphs":["Chapter 4023: Disclosure","Editor: Henyee Translations","The instructor of the sniper base was surnamed Feng. He was from the capital city. He wasn’t the resident instructor of the sniper base. He was an instructor sent by a regiment stationed at the borders of the North Province Military District to learn. His eight-month learning period was over. As he hadn’t gone home to visit his family for three years, he reported to the regiment to rest for 20 days before returning to report.","Unexpectedly, something happened to Instructor Chen.","Instructor Feng gritted his teeth and said angrily, “Ye Jian, this is not a simple matter. I’ve already reported this matter to the base before you came. I feel that it’s useless to rely on the police to investigate this matter.”","Snipers and police officers had very sharp intuition. Sometimes, this intuition could make people’s hair stand on end. That was because their intuition was most likely correct.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but look up at Instructor Feng, who had the accent of the capital city. Uncle Chen’s identity was special. Every sniper and every instructor in the base was informed of the same thing after entering the base. Once they walked out of the base, they were not allowed to reveal anyone or anything in the base. Everyone’s identity and information were classified as top military secrets. Once it was discovered that someone had leaked the information, they would be punished by the military law.","...","No one or anything here was referring to Uncle Chen. The main reason was that they didn’t want the snipers and instructors to know that Uncle Chen’s identity was special.","Now that Instructor Feng said this, Ye Jian raised her head slightly. There was a hint of vigilance in her eyes. Could it be that... an instructor had mentioned Uncle Chen’s identity outside the sniper base?","Ye Jian asked in a hoarse voice, “Do the instructors and soldiers in the base like to talk about Uncle Chen? Do they talk about him in public after leaving the base?”","“No, no soldier or instructor in the base will mention anything about the base outside. For instance, I went for sniper training for eight months. Even my brothers in my regiment only know that I went out to study. They don’t know where I went.","“We can discuss freely in the base. However, once we leave the base, everything will become confidential. No matter where we live, we must not reveal it.","“After leaving the main entrance, we can’t even talk about our company, let alone discuss Instructor Chen. We all know how important Instructor Chen is.”","Principal Chen was the chief instructor of the base. No one could surpass him in sniping. He was also the King of Sniper Rifles in the hearts of all the snipers in the base.","Now, the King of Sniper Rifles was injured. How could Instructor Feng be in the mood to rest? He wished that he could throw himself into the investigation and find that bastard together.","The King of Sniper Rifles was plotted against. This must be investigated!","He continued, “If the base can’t deal with it, we’ll hand it over to the provincial military. If the provincial military can’t deal with it, we’ll have to report it to the higher-ups. We have to find the truth. We must resolve this!”","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief when she heard what instructor Feng said.","Her eyes were slightly lowered. Her slender hands held the aluminum alloy railing that was placed by the window tightly. The thin scars on the back of her hand, which were obviously fairer than the surrounding skin, were pulled tightly. It made people worried that if she used more strength, these wounds that had healed would tear apart.","“Instructor Feng, thank you for sending Uncle Chen to the hospital in time. If it weren’t for you, I don’t know if Uncle Chen would’ve gotten into trouble. Now... he’s still in the hospital.","“I’ll take care of the rest. You can go home after you cooperate with the police investigation. You can’t miss out on visiting your family.”"]},{"number":4024,"title":"Chapter 4024: Heartache","paragraphs":["Chapter 4024: Heartache","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian leaned against the window. Her face was half-lit and half in the shadows. The same went for her emotions. Instructor Feng, who was talking to her, could feel the intense sorrow coming from the young student beside him. He wanted to comfort her too, but... Instructor Chen had been shot in the chest. His fate was unknown. As his only relative, no matter how sad Ye Jian was, he had to stand up firmly. He couldn’t let his sorrow delay the things he needed to resolve.","Fortunately, she was very firm and didn’t panic like ordinary women. She knew that she needed to understand the situation first.","“I’ve already canceled my family visit leave. The base has ordered me to accompany Instructor Chen. The leaders of the base are rushing over to visit. When the time comes, you’ll be questioned. Ye Jian, you have to control your emotions. Don’t let your sorrow crush you.”","“Yes, I understand. Don’t worry. Instructor Feng, go over and sit for a while. I want to be alone.” Ye Jian nodded lightly. Then, she slowly hunched her back. Her face was hidden by the light, so no one could see her face. She hid her expression.","At this moment, Ye Jian’s back was arched so much that it was hunched. Her fragile appearance made people’s hearts ache, but there was also a stubbornness to her.","...","Instructor Feng turned around and looked at the female soldier’s skinny back. As it turned out... she was only wearing summer clothes.","Seeing this, instructor Feng couldn’t help but sigh softly.","At that time, she must have been in a hurry when she received the call. She was so anxious that she didn’t bring a coat to resist the cold. The temperature outside the capital city was so low at night that it was only a few degrees below zero. Wasn’t she cold when she was waiting for the car at the airport?","Fortunately, there was a heater in the building. If not, her anxious and sorrowful body wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","Instructor Feng sighed and retracted his gaze. He turned his head and met the gaze of Officer Lu from the Eastern District. He nodded at the other party without any intention of talking to him.","“Brother Lu, he’s hiding something from us. If they don’t cooperate with this case, it won’t be easy for us to investigate.” The relatively young police officer, Yan Chi, said in a low voice, “If they don’t cooperate and the director wants us to hurry up and investigate...”","Officer Lu raised his hand, indicating to Yan Chi that there was no need to say anything else.","He started doing criminal investigations when he was 24 years old. In the past 15 years, he had encountered many different cases. He had come into contact with all kinds of cases but... he had never come into contact with a case as troublesome as today.","He knew where to start the investigation, but the two people around him were still wary of him.","They were guarding against him. Officer Lu felt that his already white hair was getting whiter.","“I’ll talk to the director. You guys guard the place. Also...” He looked at the young lady who was alone and didn’t want anyone to see her sorrow. Alas, this young lady was too sensible. Now that something had happened, she wanted to shoulder it alone. She didn’t want anyone to see her in pain.","His daughter, who was in grade twelve, had her finger cut by a sheet of A4 paper and hugged her mother while moaning in pain for a long time.","Officer Lu sighed too. If the children were immature, their parents would be anxious. If the children were too mature and independent... their parents would worry too.","This lady was probably crying...","Ye Jian closed her eyes and didn’t cry. She had cried too much recently and experienced too many things.","She saw with her own eyes how her lover’s chest was stabbed with a dagger by her comrade. At that moment, the pain was so excruciating that her organs felt like they had shattered. Even now, when she knew that he was out of danger, her heart would still bleed every time she recalled that scene."]},{"number":4025,"title":"Chapter 4025: If She Fell","paragraphs":["Chapter 4025: If She Fell","Editor: Henyee Translations","She was still recovering from the pain when Uncle Chen was shot. The surgery had been going on for eight hours, but it wasn’t over. She didn’t know how to cry.","In less than half a month, life changed drastically. She experienced the unknown life and death of her lover and the unknown life and death of her relative. Her hands, which were holding the aluminum alloy railing tightly, had already reached the point where her knuckles had turned white.","She just didn’t let anyone see her cry. She didn’t let anyone see her panic either. She buried everything in her heart and faced all the difficulties with her strongest side.","Uncle Chen, who had accompanied her and encouraged her to face difficulties, would be fine. She had to wait for Uncle Chen’s surgery to end and for him to come out safely.","Pressing her chest, she felt the heartbeat underneath. Here, her heart was still beating. It was still telling her that no matter how difficult it was, it wouldn’t beat her down. She wasn’t dead. She was still alive...","...","She needed to live well and face all the difficulties that couldn’t knock her down.","Everyone thought that she was a very strong woman. She faced everything calmly. She didn’t panic at all. Actually, no one knew that... when this strong woman knew that Principal Chen was shot, her heart seemed to have collapsed instantly.","Her heart felt like it was being cut by a knife, but it wasn’t painful anymore. Her heart was about to die.","She was strong because she knew that she couldn’t fall.","If she fell, she wouldn’t be able to wait for her lover.","If she fell, she wouldn’t know who shot Principal Chen.","If she fell, her grandpa and father, who had finally reunited, would be sad.","If she fell, her friends and comrades who loved her and cared about her would be sad.","After being reborn, she was no longer the weak Ye Jian from her past life. Back then, no one would care about her or be sad about her. No one would even pay attention to her. Ye Jian was alone for her entire life.","Now, she had a lover, family, comrades, friends, and the profession she liked. Hence, she couldn’t fall.","Even if her heart was dead, as long as there were still sparks, she would rely on herself to turn these sparks into a fire that could burn the plains. She would overcome every obstacle and be reborn.","‘Ye Jian, you can’t fall. You have to persevere.’","Ye Jian held the railing tightly with one hand and pressed her chest with the other. She bit her lower lip tightly. Just like that, she didn’t tell anyone about her pain. Even when the dark swamp was about to devour her, she relied on herself to walk out step by step and come back to life.","After some time, Ye Jian finally lowered the hand on her chest. She let go of the hand that was holding the railing and slowly wiped away the handprint that was left on the clean and bright railing. When she couldn’t see the handprint anymore, she let go of her lower lip.","She seemed to have wiped away the panic in her heart.","Ye Jian lowered her head and looked at the distorted face reflected on the aluminum railing. She heaved a long sigh of relief.","‘Uncle Chen, you promised Grandpa Gen that you’d see me climb higher and higher in the military on his behalf. You promised Grandpa Gen that, so you... must not go back on your word.","‘You taught me to keep my word. You won’t forget it, right?’","Ye Jian straightened her back again and stood in front of the window. She looked out of the window with an indestructible determination in her eyes. Officer Lu, who came back after the call, was slightly stunned.","The woman who was so fragile that her spine was about to break just now was no longer fragile. Her aura was so strong that it was like the coldness of a sword that was about to cut through the darkness. She was showing her fiercest side."]},{"number":4026,"title":"Chapter 4026: Concern","paragraphs":["Chapter 4026: Concern","Editor: Henyee Translations","This woman was probably... not simple.","The person who got shot was not simple either.","The soldiers who were hindering their investigation were not simple either.","Just like what the director said, they probably needed to avoid arousing suspicion.","Officer Lu walked back and sat down. He thought about it silently. Later, he would remind Ye Jian to wear a coat. The hospital was warm, but it was cold outside.","...","On the other hand, Qin Xiu had already realized that Ye Jian didn’t bring a coat with her. He accompanied Mrs. Qin to consult the doctor and received the same ‘neuropathic headache’ diagnosis as before. There were no changes.","Even the doctor’s advice was the same. She mustn’t get angry. She needed to calm down, rest, and worry less... Mrs. Qin sighed as she walked toward the parking lot. “It looks like there’s no way to treat my condition. I’ll discuss it with your father later. I’ll just stay overseas for a while.","“It’s just that the procedures are a little troublesome. I have to apply, let them investigate, and answer questions. I have to leave this to you. Oh... I...”","Mrs. Qin thought about how she had to go through all kinds of procedures before going overseas for treatment because of her identity. She felt her head hurting again.","When Qin Xiu saw this, he stopped and massaged Mrs. Qin’s temples. He said gently, “Leave this matter to Dad. Dad has been overseas alone for so many years while you’ve been in the country. It’s good to accompany him.","“You can take the car back first. I’ll go back later.”","The driver had already driven over. Mrs. Qin wanted to ask her son what he planned on doing, but the driver had already gotten out of the car and quickly opened the door. Qin Xiu took the opportunity to help Mrs. Qin, who was about to ask a bunch of questions, into the car.","He held the car door with one hand and bent over. He leaned over and said to Mrs. Qin, “I might go to Dangui Garden to accompany Grandpa tonight. Don’t wait for me to come back.","“Also, postpone the gathering tomorrow and rest at home.”","After he finished speaking, he closed the car door. Mrs. Qin yelled a few times in the car. Seeing that Qin Xiu didn’t seem to hear her, Mrs. Qin was so angry that her head hurt.","The driver hurriedly drove off, making Qin Xiu relax a little.","He turned around and looked around. His footsteps paused for a moment as he thought about where he came from. Then, he took a step forward.","He didn’t have a sense of direction. After three years of treatment, he had improved greatly. He would remember everything like a drawing. He listened to the doctor’s advice and didn’t always rely on the people around him. Now, he could finally walk around like a normal person.","When he reached the first floor, Qin Xiu called his driver. After a while, the driver walked over quickly and handed a bag to Qin Xiu. “According to the height and physique description you gave me, the staff recommended this coat to me. See if you’re satisfied.”","Qin Xiu took the bag and glanced at it before nodding slightly. He didn’t know if it was okay. He would send it over first. If she didn’t like it... he would think about it later.","Qin Xiu appeared in front of Ye Jian with a bag. Ye Jian frowned imperceptibly.","When she heard Qin Xiu calling her just now, she almost thought that she was hallucinating. She looked up and saw Qin Xiu standing not far away. Then, she realized that she wasn’t hallucinating.","She didn’t understand why Qin Xiu came to look for her. He even passed her a bag containing a coat.","“Put it on. Since you’re dealing with an emergency, you have to take care of your body,” Qin Xiu said gently like an ordinary friend with a hint of concern."]},{"number":4027,"title":"Chapter 4027: Please Leave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4027: Please Leave","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian looked down slightly. She looked at the bag that Qin Xiu handed over and frowned.","She didn’t reach out her hand. After taking a look, she looked up and looked at Qin Xiu calmly with her clear black eyes. She said distantly and politely, “No need. I’m not cold. Thank you.”","His slender hands held the two thin ribbons of the bag tightly. Qin Xiu looked at Ye Jian calmly. After a while, a helpless smile appeared on his handsome face.","“Ye Jian, you don’t have to be so vigilant against me. I ate and drank for free at Grandpa Fu’s house when I was young. Grandpa Fu often bought toys for me.","“I received so much care from Grandpa Fu. Now, I’m just repaying his kindness. You don’t have to... think that I have bad intentions.”","...","“You’ve misunderstood me. I don’t mean that. The one who took care of you is my grandpa. It has nothing to do with me. My grandpa once told me that you often went to the hospital to take care of him when he was sick, so you don’t have to take care of me. Thank you.”","As she spoke, Ye Jian bowed sincerely to show her sincerity to Qin Xiu.","She was really thanking him sincerely. Back then, she hadn’t returned to the Fu family yet. Her grandpa was seriously ill and had to undergo three rescues. The first two times, her eldest cousin was by his side. The third time, he was rescued and sent back to the military unit. It was all thanks to Qin Xiu that her grandpa was able to survive the third rescue.","When she returned to the Fu family, it had only been less than two months after his discharge.","This was the ‘thank you’ she owed Qin Xiu. It could be said that she was very late.","Qin Xiu didn’t need such an apology. He just didn’t want to see her sick. He just wanted to express his concern.","But obviously, Ye Jian didn’t need it.","It was understandable. If she could, she wouldn’t even want him to appear in front of her.","Qin Xiu was a little angry.","However, because of his self-restraint, he didn’t show it on his face. He took back the bag that hadn’t been taken from him for a long time and placed it naturally on the side of his arm.","He asked her, “You still want to avoid arousing suspicion, right? Do you really... want to go to this extent? I can’t even... show the most ordinary concern, even if it’s just as a friend?”","“Yes, you can’t.”","After he finished speaking, Ye Jian immediately replied without any hesitation. She replied directly and firmly, “Ambassador Qin, I thank you for your concern and thank you for treating me as a friend. However, I’m sorry that I can’t accept your concern.","“That’s because I can’t accept the concern of an adult man who clearly has feelings for me. I’ve already rejected you. I can’t be ambiguous.","“Since I’ve rejected you, I need to reject your concern and kindness. I can’t reject your kindness while claiming that you and I are friends and accept your concern and gifts with a clear conscience.","“I’m sorry. I think it’s immoral and irresponsible.”","Qin Xiu was speechless...","He was angry, but he couldn’t get angry. It was immoral and irresponsible to accept the care and gifts of a guy who had confessed to her... This was the first time he heard of it!","This was the first time he knew of it.","Was that really the case?","Did he misunderstand or did she misunderstand?","Ye Jian rejected him and didn’t plan to continue talking to Qin Xiu.","In order to come back to see her as soon as possible, her man risked his life to set up a trap. He was still lying in the hospital. It was immoral for her to accept the concern of a man who was interested in her!"]},{"number":4028,"title":"Chapter 4028: Ruthless Ye Jian","paragraphs":["Chapter 4028: Ruthless Ye Jian","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian stubbornly insisted on her thoughts.","If it were anyone else, she would have said it directly too. Grandpa Gen and Uncle Chen had taught her how to be responsible and immoral.","As a human, one must have one’s own principles. When rejecting someone, one had to be firm and not ambiguous.","“I’m sorry, I still have something on. Ambassador Qin, you must be busy too. Please go back. Thank you again for your concern.” Ye Jian bowed slightly and turned around, preparing to leave without any hesitation.","“Ye Jian, wait.”","...","Qin Xiu reacted quickly. Frowning, he looked ahead and looked around. His voice was so low that only the two of them could hear him. He asked in a low voice, “Who’s in the operating room? I saw Grandpa Fu when I went back to Dangui Garden the day before yesterday. He’s very healthy.”","“It’s not Grandpa. It’s my family member in the Southern Province,” Ye Jian replied. She just didn’t want to elaborate. “The surgery is still ongoing. I need to go over. Goodbye.”","“Take good care of yourself so that you have the energy to take care of your family. Your clothes are thin, and it’s cold outside. Try your best to avoid going out. Also, if you need anything, you can contact me.”","“Yes, thank you.” Ye Jian nodded and returned to the operating room. She didn’t care if Qin Xiu left immediately.","Qin Xiu held the bag so tightly that the two thin ribbons in the bag were about to break. His elegant and handsome face was a little tense, but there was more resignation in his heart.","He knew that the woman he liked was ruthless, and he had seen her ruthlessness before. However, after another collision, her heart felt like it had been stabbed twice. He couldn’t let her go, but he wished that he could.","This was the first time in his nearly 30 years of life that he felt so frustrated!","If he were to reject someone he didn’t like, he would do the same thing. He wouldn’t give her any hope or mercy.","When he rejected other women’s feelings, he didn’t think that it was wrong at all. He didn’t think that he was ruthless or heartless either.","Now, it was his turn to be rejected by the woman he loved. He finally knew how ruthless and heartless he was.","Looking at the straight figure that never looked at him, Qin Xiu, who had been standing for a long time, finally took his first step. He had been standing for a long time, so his slender legs were still a little stiff. After taking a few steps, he became as elegant and calm as usual.","He turned around and walked to the corner of the elevator. Qin Xiu suddenly stopped in his tracks. He saw... Mrs. Qin standing there with a furious expression. Didn’t he already ask the driver to send her home?","Qin Xiu frowned, and his handsome face was filled with anger. “Mom, are you following me?”","“You don’t know that woman? Qin Xiu, when did you learn to lie to me?” Mrs. Qin was very angry, but she was still able to control herself. She asked sternly, “You even lied to me for a woman with an unknown identity?”","Mrs. Qin was a domineering person. She wouldn’t allow her children to lie to her. This was why she was able to become friends with Madam Li.","Both of them had strong personalities, so they had many things in common. If they had something in common, they wouldn’t have to worry about not becoming friends.","“Mom, you followed me.” Qin Xiu didn’t answer directly. He was also quite angry now. Moreover, his anger was getting stronger. He wouldn’t look angry when he was angry. Instead, his expression would get colder and colder. He looked so cold that there was no emotion in his eyes. It was as if a pile of ice had melted in them. His gaze was cold and heavy, making Mrs. Qin’s heart tighten uncontrollably.","“I didn’t know that you had such a hobby.” His voice was cold too."]},{"number":4029,"title":"Chapter 4029: I’m Tired, Ill Leave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4029: I’m Tired, I’ll Leave","Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Qin’s heart tightened. This was the first time she saw her son, who had always been gentle and elegant, reveal a cold side to her. Although she was a little flustered, her domineering personality didn’t let her take a step back because of her panic.","Hearing this, she smiled coldly, and her gaze turned sharper. “I’m just concerned about you. I didn’t expect you to lie to me.”","At this moment, Qin Xiu felt extremely tired.","He said in a very calm voice, “Mom, you’ve already forced my sister away. Are you trying to force me away now? Fine. I’ll do as you wish. I’ll disappear from your sight within a week. This way, you don’t have to worry about us anymore. You don’t have to be angry at us anymore. You won’t have a headache either.","“If you force your two unfilial children away, you’ll live a better and happier life!”","...","His calm voice made people’s hearts tremble. Mrs. Qin panicked, but more than that, she was angry.","If she weren’t in the hospital, Mrs. Qin would have reprimanded him furiously. She wouldn’t be like this now. She was clearly furious, but in order to maintain her elegant image, she had to endure her trembling. “Qin Xiu, what’s with your attitude?”","“My attitude is to tell you that you don’t have to worry about me in the future. It’s late. Go back early. I still have things to settle.”","“You have something to deal with? You want to buy an expensive dress for that woman? Qin Xiu, when did you become a man who only looks at appearance and not inner qualities? You’ve disappointed me!”","Qin Xiu’s handsome face, which was so elegant that it looked like it was carved from fine white jade, became fierce when he heard this. He stopped in his tracks and turned around. He looked at Mrs. Qin calmly like before. “Mom, you like Madam Li’s daughter very much. You think that she’s virtuous and capable and can manage the family well, right?","“Mom, why don’t you ask the friends around Madam Li’s daughter if Miss Du is a virtuous and capable person?”","“They’re all young ladies. Young ladies are narrow-minded and don’t know how to speak properly. What’s there to ask? Madam Li gave birth to two children. Both of them are promising, and their characters are naturally good...”","Qin Xiu didn’t want to listen anymore. He smiled lightly. “Why don’t you acknowledge a godson and marry the good Miss Du to him?”","When he smiled, pain and resignation appeared on his face.","He finally understood why his sister didn’t come home for so many years. She didn’t even want to talk to Mrs. Qin on the phone. He finally understood. It was time for him to escape.","“Mom, I’ve disappointed you, and you’ve made me very tired. Goodbye, Mom.” Qin Xiu smiled. It was a tired smile. He turned around and left after seeing Mrs. Qin’s dumbfounded expression.","“Qin Xiu! Qin Xiu! Stop right there!”","Mrs. Qin, who was completely flustered, used her usual domineering attitude to order Xiu to stand still. However, what she saw was only Qin Xiu’s back view, which was filled with fatigue.","At first, Ye Jian didn’t know when Qin Xiu would leave. Suddenly, a frustrated shout came from the quiet surgical floor. Although it was a distance away from her, she could hear it clearly.","She didn’t pay attention to why someone would scold Qin Xiu to stop. She was still waiting for the surgery to end. Another hour had passed, and there was still no news. It had been nine hours. How long must she wait?","Before the surgery ended, the four guards sent by Commander Xia arrived."]},{"number":4030,"title":"Chapter 4030: Cruel Facts","paragraphs":["Chapter 4030: Cruel Facts","Editor: Henyee Translations","The guards were all in plain clothes. When the four of them came out at the same time, a murderous aura surged forward. Officer Lu and his colleagues, who were guarding the door, couldn’t help but stand straight.","The four guards’ gazes were like X-rays as they scanned the faces in front of them with a cold aura. In the end, they nodded at the oldest officer, Officer Lu, before walking to Ye Jian’s side.","Dressed in casual clothes, they stood in front of Ye Jian and said, “Hello, Ye Jian. Our superiors have ordered us to stand guard. You can order us to do anything at any time.”","His voice was so cold that it made people feel safe. Every word was powerful. One could tell that they were not ordinary guards with just the few sentences that man said. One could tell that they were disciplined and powerful.","The colleagues beside Officer Lu looked at the four soldiers in casual clothes who were standing in front of them with an imposing aura. After glancing at them, they looked at their own people while moving away.","...","Even though they were wearing casual clothes, the officers knew that they were soldiers through their strong aura alone.","A retired soldier who was specially hired back to the military unit gained the attention of the military and even guards were specially sent over. Yan Chi and Ji Jie, the two younger police officers, instantly thought that they must’ve been blind. They didn’t realize the true identity of the person involved!","Could it be... a certain head of the military?","Ye Jian was very grateful for their arrival. With them guarding this place, she felt more at ease.","Also, if this matter was leaked because of Uncle Chen’s identity, the police investigating this matter might be in danger. They couldn’t implicate the innocent police anymore.","She asked, “I wonder if there are any other arrangements from the higher-ups? Will we have to handle it ourselves?”","“Leave it to us. The police will only be in charge of the preliminary investigation and the investigation of suspicious people in the train station square. This matter has already been reported to the higher-ups. Commander Xia asked us to tell you that Principal Chen has the military backing him. Don’t worry.","“Just wait for Principal Chen’s surgery to end. Leave the rest to the higher-ups.”","Just as Ye Jian was about to speak, the light above the operating room suddenly turned from red to green. One needed to swipe an access card to enter the first protective heavy door of the operating room. The door opened automatically, and a doctor wearing a light green surgical gown, a sterile cap, and a mask walked out.","The police officers who were looking at the four guards turned around. Ye Jian rushed over and asked, “Doctor, how’s my uncle?”","There was no need to ask who the family member was. The doctor took off his mask and looked at the young female soldier who had an anxious facial expression but was hopeful because he had come out. He sighed softly and said, “I’m sorry. We tried our best. The patient is still unconscious. You can go in and take a look at him.”","As he spoke, he bowed deeply to Ye Jian.","‘Sorry... we... tried... our... best?’","His words were like a thunderclap. Ye Jian’s slender body shook violently.","‘Sorry, we tried our best.’","She grabbed the doctor’s hand tightly and forcefully. Ye Jian asked the doctor very softly, “Doctor, what do you mean? What do you mean?","“Why are you apologizing? Why...","“What about my Uncle Chen? Do we still need to carry out the surgery? Hurry up and go in. I won’t delay you anymore. I can wait. I can wait. Hurry up and go in. I can wait.”","The doctor had seen too many situations like this. He patted Ye Jian’s hand that was grabbing his arm and sighed. “Hurry up and go in. The patient is holding on. Go and take a last look.”","It was a cruel but irreversible fact."]},{"number":4031,"title":"Chapter 4031: Every Step Is Dripping With Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 4031: Every Step Is Dripping With Blood","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone knew what the doctor meant. Ye Jian... she knew too. She just didn’t want to accept it.","How could she accept this?","That was the Uncle Chen who grew up with her and helped her through the darkest times when she was reborn. He educated her and guided her in the right direction of her life. He was her teacher, her friend, and her father. He was none other than her family. She remembered him in her heart. No matter where she went, she would think about him. She had always respected him.","That was none other than Uncle Chen, who gave her a mountain of fatherly love in the most painful and unbearable darkness.","Although she never called him ‘Dad’, in her heart, Uncle Chen was already her father. Just like Mr. Fu, he was her biological father.","...","However, now... she was going to lose him.","She dragged her heavy feet. Every step she took felt heavy. She took the first step and didn’t want to take the second step. She was afraid that if she took another step, Uncle Chen, who she respected the most like a father, would take a step away from her.","Every step was dripping with blood.","Her face was so pale that it was almost transparent. Her lips were pale too. The four guards who went in with her couldn’t help but worry.","Instructor Feng called the leader of the base who was rushing to the hospital. The leader, who was still a distance away from the hospital, was accompanied by the leader of the Military District of Southern Province and an old friend of Principal Chen, Commissar Yan. He had also helped Ye Jian many times.","“What?! He can’t hold on anymore?!” The leader of the base’s expression changed drastically when he heard that. He said to the driver, “Hurry, hurry, hurry!”","Commissar Yan’s heart sank to the bottom.","He couldn’t make it. Old Chen... couldn’t make it!","‘Old Chen, you’re too outrageous! Why can’t you take it? You’re the King of Sniper Rifles who stepped on the corpses of your enemies on the battlefield!","‘Why can’t you?","‘Why not?’","The taxi driver gritted his teeth and stepped on the accelerator. Fortunately, it was almost 10:00 pm. The peak period had passed. If not, he wouldn’t be able to go fast even if he wanted to.","“Old Chen won’t be able to make it. We have to rush over and see him one last time. We have to hear if he has anything else to say.” The leader of the base’s face was a little pale. He clenched his fists and said to the political commissar, “Fortunately, Little Ye has already reached the hospital. If not, Old Chen wouldn’t be able to see the junior he misses the most.”","With a serious expression on his face, Commissar Yan pursed his lips. After some time, he lowered his head and said, “If Uncle Chen passes, Little Ye will be in the most pain.","“That child has been by Old Chen’s side for the longest time. That year, Old Chen promised an old comrade that he would accompany Little Ye as she grew up. He wanted to see Little Ye enter the military camp with his own eyes and see Little Ye find a lifetime of happiness. This fellow... This fellow...”","His voice got lower and lower. When he finished speaking, Political Commissar Yan was already choking. “This fellow has always been a man of his words. Why did he go back on his word now?","“I need to settle the score with him.”","That year, Principal Chen retired secretly and came to Fujun Town Middle School to become a principal. Very few people knew his true identity. Commander Liu and Commissar Yan, who were assigned to the Fujun Town military unit deep in the mountains, were insiders.","When Commissar Yan suddenly found out that his old friend, whom he had worked with for many years, was hit by a bullet and couldn’t make it, he couldn’t accept it for a moment.","Even he couldn’t accept it, let alone Ye Jian."]},{"number":4032,"title":"Chapter 4032: What To Do","paragraphs":["Chapter 4032: What To Do","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, Commissar Yan was worried about Ye Jian, whom he hadn’t seen for almost three years.","Ye Jian was now looking at Principal Chen, who had all kinds of tubes all over his body. She saw Principal Chen lying motionless on the operating table. The snow-white light shone on the ceiling, illuminating Principal Chen’s face. It was... gray. His life was gradually disappearing.","Ye Jian, who was standing at the entrance of the operating room, didn’t move. She stood there in a daze. She was staring at him in a daze. They were so close, but she didn’t have the energy to take a step forward.","If she took this step, she would be worlds apart from her father, Uncle Chen.","She couldn’t move anymore. She couldn’t move a single step.","...","Principal Chen knew that he didn’t have much time left. He seemed to feel that the child he missed the most was standing in a place where he couldn’t see her. Principal Chen heaved a sigh of relief. He wanted to raise his hand and wave at the child he missed the most...","However, he didn’t have the energy. Besides flicking his fingers, he didn’t have the energy to raise his hand anymore.","What should she do?","What should she do if she was left alone...","After making the call, Instructor Feng rushed into the operating room. When he saw that Ye Jian hadn’t walked over even after a long time, his hand trembled. He didn’t hold his cell phone properly, and it fell to the ground with a bang.","The sound wasn’t loud, but in such a quiet environment where the air was oppressive, it was loud.","Ye Jian, who was clenching her fingers tightly, finally reacted. Why was she standing here?","She had to talk to Uncle Chen. She had to tell Uncle Chen that he had to live. He had already promised Grandpa Gen. He couldn’t go back on his word.","She rushed into the operating room. Ye Jian saw Principal Chen struggling to raise his eyes.","Her hand was trembling as she grabbed about wildly. She didn’t know what she wanted to grab. The guard who came in with Principal Chen silently held Principal Chen’s hand and then grabbed Ye Jian’s hand. The two of them finally held each other’s hand.","The sound of crying was heard. Ye Jian, who was kneeling by the operating table, cried. She wasn’t someone who could vent her emotions at once. Her emotions didn’t explode instantly, but it made people sad because of her sorrow.","“Uncle Chen, it’s Ye Jian. It’s Ye Jian. I’m here... Ye Jian is here. Look at me. Can you talk to me...”","Ye Jian’s tears fell like rain as she spoke softly, as if she feared that Principal Chen would fall asleep. Her voice was so soft but so desolate.","Principal Chen had a hard time talking. He wanted to talk. He wanted to say many things. He wanted to tell the child that he was worried about not to be too sad. Everyone had to go through this. Now, it was his turn.","However, he was most worried about Ye Jian.","Even so, what made him gratified was that the hardships of this girl had finally come to an end. She had found a home that truly belonged to her. She had her grandpa, her father, and Xia Jinyuan, who still cared about her. There were so many people who loved her. He could leave in peace.","“Girl...” Principal Chen’s voice was so weak that it was almost inaudible. No matter what he wanted to say, the words were stuck in his heart. He couldn’t say them properly. He could only try his best."]},{"number":4033,"title":"Chapter 4033: Tears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4033: Tears","Editor: Henyee Translations","Principal Chen blinked his heavy eyes. His breathing was very light. Even his chest didn’t move much. “Don’t... cry... Take care of yourself... Don’t... cry. My matter... is dangerous... Don’t... care about it. Don’t... meddle. You must... not... meddle...”","Principal Chen used all his strength to say his last words clearly. His breathing was so weak that it felt like it would break at any moment.","Ye Jian couldn’t interfere with his business. She couldn’t even show her face.","He had been enduring all this while because he wanted to see Ye Jian before he left. He was already very satisfied to see her now.","His parents died when he was young. Later on, he lived a wandering life. He didn’t have a way out until he joined the military and served his country.","...","After he retired, he had no one to rely on until he had a daughter. He groomed her and taught her. He watched her grow and become stronger day by day.","Then, she was groomed by the military to become an outstanding sniper and special forces soldier. Now, she had been admitted to the military school. In another year, she would have to go to the military unit. The child he raised had grown up. He could let go now.","Before he let go completely, he needed her to promise him one thing. If not, he would become a sinner even if he died.","Principal Chen’s breath was stuck in his throat. At this moment, he couldn’t even hear Ye Jian’s sobbing clearly. He wanted to hold Ye Jian’s hand and remind her, but he couldn’t exert any strength in his body. His life... had really entered the final countdown.","He wasn’t afraid of death. He was just afraid that the stubborn girl would investigate and interfere...","“Promise me... Don’t... care about me. Take care of yourself. Don’t let... me... feel... uneasy. Promise... Promise... me...”","Ye Jian knew what Principal Chen wanted her to promise, but she didn’t want to. She didn’t want to promise him at all. However, she had to promise him now. She had never disappointed Uncle Chen in the past. She couldn’t disappoint him now.","“I promise, I promise. But you can’t go back on your word. You have to promise me that you will survive. Uncle Chen, I beg you. You have to survive too.”","She wiped her face haphazardly. She wanted to wipe her tears clean so that Principal Chen could see that she wasn’t crying. However, she couldn’t wipe it clean no matter how hard she tried. After she wiped her face, more tears appeared. The more she wiped, the more tears seemed to appear...","Principal Chen’s face turned paler and paler. Even the light in his eyes became fainter. Ye Jian panicked. She was afraid. She felt that the hand she was holding, which used to be so strong, was getting colder and colder...","No, no... She didn’t want this... She didn’t want this!!!","She said that she wouldn’t cry, but more and more tears flowed down her face. Ye Jian, who was kneeling beside the operating table, felt like she was kneeling on the abyss of despair. If she moved any closer, she would be crushed.","“Uncle Chen, the doctor still needs to operate on you. You have to hold on properly. You can’t sleep, understand? You told me in the past that there’s nothing a person can’t endure in their life. Just grit your teeth and endure it.","“If you grit your teeth and endure it, you’ll be fine. Don’t sleep. Don’t sleep, okay? I’m begging you, please.","“You promised Grandpa Gen that you would watch me grow up and send me into the military unit on his behalf. Uncle Chen, you promised Grandpa Gen. You can’t go back on your word. I beg you, I beg you...”","Her cries weren’t loud, but the sorrow in the entire operating theater could lock people’s throats and suffocate them. Their eyes were red because of her cries, and their hearts trembled because of her pleas."]},{"number":4034,"title":"Chapter 4034: Use The News Of Victory To Commemorate Me","paragraphs":["Chapter 4034: Use The News Of Victory To Commemorate Me","Editor: Henyee Translations","Even the four unyielding guards sent by the company were pursing their lips tightly at this moment. They stood on both sides of the operating table, and their eyes were bloodshot.","Tears flowed down from the corners of Principal Chen’s eyes as he listened to Ye Jian pleading.","When the bullet hit his chest, he knew that he wouldn’t be able to make it. That was why he informed Instructor Feng to notify Ye Jian as a last resort.","He had endured until now. It was hard for him too.","His old comrades had come to see him. His comrades, who had all faded into black and white photos, were all here.","...","They walked through the world, wearing the same military uniforms as when they first met. They stood among the green mountains and waters with guns on their shoulders. They looked at him so vividly and then walked toward him again.","“Chen Dongfeng, you’re amazing! You’ve become the King of Sniper Rifles!”","“Chen Dongfeng, even when we retire, you can’t. You need to groom a few more sniper rifles for our country.”","“Chen Dongfeng, you’re finally here. We’ve been waiting for you for a long time!”","“Chen Dongfeng, the mountains and rivers are still here. We didn’t disappoint you!”","“Chen Dongfeng... Chen Dongfeng... Chen Dongfeng...”","Look, they were all his comrades. They were all his comrades. The bald men from Shanxi Province, the loudmouths from the Southern Province, and... Teacher Guan, who had the highest education level among them and could speak English well.","They were all here.","He could leave now. His comrades had been waiting for him for so long. The bones under the green mountain might have turned to dust. He was finally reunited with them.","He was leaving. He really was leaving.","He wanted to reunite with his comrades. They hadn’t seen each other for decades. This time, they could chat and laugh loudly again.","Principal Chen’s dull lips moved. His breath was weak. He used his last bit of strength and held Ye Jian’s hand tightly. “You’ve grown up... See... you... again.”","“Chen Dongfeng, it’s time for us to leave. Hurry up and catch up! Don’t lose to us again!”","“Hahahaha, we won’t lose. We won’t lose!”","“Let’s go! Let’s go, let’s go.”","Ten years had passed since the flames of war in the Southern Kingdom.","This head must hang at the gates of the country.","Later on, everyone would work hard.","They would use the news of victory to commemorate those fallen!","Principal Chen smiled. His comrades’ voices sounded in his ears. He closed his eyes slowly and smiled.","‘Ye Jian, remember to use the news of victory to commemorate me.’","Principal Chen caught up with the comrades who came to fetch him. He was wearing the old-fashioned military uniform he wore when he entered the military in the past. He carried a Type 59 rifle and walked into the mountains and rivers with his comrade. They finally reunited and were never separated again!","The green mountains and rivers faded, and the lively faces froze into black and white photos again. The heroes had left, and the heroes’ souls were left behind. The mountains and rivers were still there, and the country was safe.","The four guards saluted the hero who had already closed his eyes. Farewell to the hero. Take care!","Ye Jian was on the verge of breaking down. She kept rubbing Principal Chen’s hand and shouting heart-wrenchingly, “Uncle Chen, don’t sleep. Uncle Chen, don’t sleep! Don’t sleep! I’m begging you. Hurry up and open your eyes! Open your eyes and look at me!","“Please, don’t sleep! Don’t sleep! Doctor, hurry up! Doctor, hurry up! Hurry up and save my Uncle Chen! Please, hurry up and save my Uncle Chen!”","The sorrowful voice broke the hearts of everyone who heard it. Another hero had left."]},{"number":4035,"title":"Chapter 4035: Invisible Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4035: Invisible Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who couldn’t accept the truth, was facing another death. She had already faced it many times. From Grandpa Gen’s death to the death of an armed police soldier.","She once went on an overseas rescue mission. That was the time when Mr. Fu was kidnapped. The guard was locked up in a small wooden room, and she saw the guard die.","J5’s sacrifice allowed Ye Jian to accept death at a close distance. That time, she clearly felt that as a soldier, the responsibility she carried was as great as the danger.","It took her a long time to accept J5’s passing.","This was because Xia Jinyuan had once told Ye Jian, “When facing cruel things, you can only face them. You must face them seriously! If one day, you or I are sacrificed, those living will use their guns to fire a bullet. That’s the best tribute to the martyrs.”","...","It was this sentence that allowed her to endure it and make her harsher on herself for every training session.","She thought that this was enough. At first, she thought that this was enough.","In the end, it wasn’t like this.","There were too many invisible sins and dangers. She didn’t know when they would happen to herself, the people she was familiar with, or even her family.","She thought that as long as she worked hard enough, she would be able to resist danger and avoid it. However, that wasn’t the case. It really wasn’t the case.","There existed invisible dangers. She couldn’t choose to avoid them just because she couldn’t see them. She should take the initiative to eradicate them before they arrived.","If she had taken the initiative to attack, Uncle Chen wouldn’t have fallen and left her.","He wouldn’t be lying on the cold operating table with all kinds of tubes all over his body. She wouldn’t have let the Grim Reaper take away Uncle Chen, who was her teacher, her friend, and her father.","She should have taken the initiative to attack. How could she let the danger stay beside Uncle Chen?","It was like a time bomb. When it didn’t explode, he would be safe. But when it exploded... she lost Uncle Chen.","‘I’m sorry, Uncle Chen. I can’t promise you that I won’t investigate. I can’t promise you that I won’t care about your matters.’","She wanted to investigate to the end and find out who killed him.","It wasn’t just one murderer.","There was not only one murderer, and the person who planned this was definitely not acting alone. ‘Uncle Chen, I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I can’t agree to your request.","‘Why don’t you wake up and talk to me again?","‘As long as you live well, I won’t care about your matters, okay?’","“Uncle Chen, open your eyes and look at me. I’m already in my third year. I’ll be in my fourth year soon. I’ll enter the military unit soon. You’ll be able to send me to report to the military unit soon. Have you forgotten what you promised Grandpa Gen? How can you forget? How can you forget?","“Please, Uncle Chen... open your eyes and look at me again. Please... I beg you...”","Before rushing into the operating room, Commissar Yan heard Ye Jian’s cries. In an instant, he froze on the spot.","He left. Old Chen... really left.","This fellow... He really left!","The leader of the sniper base and the leader of the Southern Province Military District walked into the operating room. They saw Principal Chen who had left and Ye Jian, who was kneeling beside Principal Chen.","The two of them walked in and looked at the soldiers who were loyal to the country. They had solemn and sorrowful eyes. At that moment, their hands were so heavy that they couldn’t raise them."]},{"number":4036,"title":"Chapter 4036: From Warmth To Coldness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4036: From Warmth To Coldness","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Pull... Pull her up.” The leader of the provincial military district said softly and asked the guard standing beside Ye Jian to help her up.","Old Chen had already left. He would never come back.","There was no way to pull Ye Jian up. When the guard pulled her up, he wasn’t on guard against her. He didn’t even think that he would be sent flying by a female soldier. However, he was really thrown out over her shoulder.","When the second guard went to pull her up, he was targeted by the coldness in her eyes. He slowly retracted his hand and looked at the leader of the provincial military district.","It was too cruel to pull her away now.","...","The leader of the provincial military district closed his eyes when he saw this.","‘Old Chen, look at you. You left just like that. Look at the child beside you. You left her alone. Why didn’t you make it through?’","The leader of the base had seen Ye Jian before. Seeing that Ye Jian forbade anyone from approaching, he sighed and said, “Stop pulling her. Let her accompany Old Chen. Let’s... go and settle the relevant matters. We’ll come back later.”","Now, he would let Little Ye and Old Chen have some alone time. This was the only time they had left.","“Alright, let’s come back later.” The leader of the provincial military district bowed deeply to the operating table. The leader of the base also bowed deeply and turned to leave.","At the entrance of the operating room, Commissar Yan waited for them to come out. He stood rooted to the ground for a long time and swallowed softly. He took off his military cap and walked in step by step.","The operating room was very cold. It was bone-chilling. The sorrow in the operating room was too strong. It was so strong that before he could walk to Old Chen’s side, the tears that he was suppressing rushed out.","He bowed deeply and didn’t straighten his back for a long time. When he raised his head again, the tip of Commissar Yan’s nose was red. He raised his head and forced his tears back.","Then, he walked to Ye Jian’s side and raised his hand with difficulty. He slowly placed his hand on Ye Jian’s shoulder and patted it gently. “Girl, accompany your Uncle Chen well.","“He doted on you like his daughter. As his daughter, you’re definitely the one person he couldn’t bear to part with before he left. Accompany him well and talk to him for a while. I’ll accompany your Uncle Chen later.”","This place was too cold. Fortunately, Old Chen wasn’t afraid of the cold. It was just that Little Ye... She was kneeling on the cold ground. She was definitely cold.","After taking off his military uniform, Commissar Yan placed the jacket that was still warm on Ye Jian. This child was too lovable. She was even more lovable than his daughter.","Ye Jian was heartbroken. She didn’t know who came and left. She kept holding Uncle Chen’s hand tightly and kept rubbing it. She wanted to make Principal Chen’s hand warmer so that the family member she respected wouldn’t leave.","However, it was futile.","The warmth in Principal Chen’s palm got weaker and weaker. Even though Ye Jian rubbed her hands until they were red, she couldn’t warm Principal Chen’s palm.","The loss of life was going from warmth to coldness.","Officer Lu and the rest who were guarding the door couldn’t bear to watch anymore.","“Brother Lu, do you want to... pull her up? It’s been an hour.” Officer Ji Jie said softly. He couldn’t stand it anymore. She had been kneeling for more than an hour and rubbing her hands for more than an hour. Her voice was hoarse, but she was still kneeling there.","Officer Lu looked inside and sighed. “The two of you guard the place. I’ll go outside and ask for instructions.”","There were a few leaders in the military. If they didn’t say anything, he couldn’t make a decision."]},{"number":4037,"title":"Chapter 4037: A Life Of Song And Tears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4037: A Life Of Song And Tears","Editor: Henyee Translations","Outside, Commander Xia walked out of the elevator with a cold aura. Behind him, two guards followed closely. The faster Commander Xia walked, the faster they would walk.","His footsteps were as fast as thunder.","“Commander-in-chief!”","“Commander-in-chief!”","...","...","The soldiers standing in the corridor outside the operating room had already seen Commander Xia rushing over. They had just saluted when Commander Xia glanced at them with a dark expression. His gaze suddenly turned sharp. “He couldn’t be saved.”","There was no need to ask. He said it with certainty.","“Yes, one hour and eleven minutes ago... he passed away.” The leader of the Military District of Southern Province replied, “She’s still in the operating room. Old Chen’s relative, Little Ye, is accompanying him.”","Commander Xia felt a little relieved when he heard that Ye Jian was accompanying Old Chen inside. At the same time, his heart started burning with anxiety.","Little Six had just been stabbed in the chest. Now, Old Chen had passed away. Little Ye was... a person made of steel. But no matter how strong her heart was... she wouldn’t be able to withstand it!","“Is there anyone guarding inside?” Commander Xia’s voice turned sharp too. He shouted until his footsteps reached the door of the first level of the operating room. Officer Lu couldn’t help but take a step back.","His voice was too domineering. It was even more domineering than their director.","He took a deep breath and walked out. Coincidentally, he heard a leader of the military reply, “A few police officers from the Eastern District are guarding the place. We came out to discuss the follow-up matters. Old Chen has passed. His funeral needs to be settled. We can’t let a hero leave silently.”","Couldn’t let a hero leave silently... Commander Xia’s gaze turned dark.","“Commander Xia, if something really happens to me one day, don’t make a scene for me or get the soldiers to come over. I want to do my best to keep a low profile with my identity. I’m not like Uncle Gen. If something really happens, sprinkle my ashes in the Yellow River. I have a few comrades who are scattered in the Yellow River. I might be able to find them. If I do, I’ll have some companions.”","Old Chen was right. His identity was destined to be unknown.","Commander Xia didn’t reply immediately. Instead, he walked into the operating room.","He saw Ye Jian kneeling on the ground. Her head was resting on the side of the operating table. She was hugging Uncle Chen’s arm and shouting, “Uncle Chen... Uncle Chen...”","At that moment, even Commander Xia started crying.","Little Ye had experienced life and death many times. Now that even Old Chen had left, he was a little worried if she could survive.","At this moment, if Little Six were here to accompany her, how good would that be? He could face it with her and help her overcome most of her sorrow. He could comfort and encourage her.","Unfortunately, when she needed Little Six the most... he wasn’t around.","Sigh!","Commander Xia pulled Ye Jian up. He said to Ye Jian, “Girl, go and get a clean military uniform for Uncle Chen. We need to help him wear it.","“Your Uncle Chen’s life might’ve been short, but it was filled with songs and tears. He guarded the borders of our country and protected the dignity of our country. He sniped countless dangerous people who harmed our country and used the sniper rifles in his hands to win again and again.","“Now, he’s gone, and you’re the sniper he taught personally. You accepted his legacy and took over his sniper rifles. You’re carrying the responsibility he gave you.","“If he leaves, you’ll have to carry everything he gave you on your shoulders. You can’t forget it just because he has left.”"]},{"number":4038,"title":"Chapter 4038: Enemy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4038: Enemy","Editor: Henyee Translations","Commander Xia’s voice was very penetrating. Cracks appeared on the armor-like sorrow that enveloped Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who was immersed in sorrow, moved her eyes slightly. There was a faint light in her black eyes. This faint light allowed Commander Xia to know that he could continue to persuade her.","He touched Ye Jian’s head lightly. At this moment, Commander Xia wasn’t the commander-in-chief of the military. He was just concerned about this child as a kind elder.","“You’ve already taken over Uncle Chen’s gun and the responsibility he once carried. Now, the gun and the responsibility are in your hands. That’s why he had a faint smile on his face when he left.","“Because he knows that you’ll never disappoint him. Without him by your side, you’ll still be able to walk forward bravely and become a world-class sniper rifle king like him. Ye Jian, you must bear with it and not disappoint your Uncle Chen.”","...","Ye Jian didn’t sprawl over the side of the operating table like she had lost her soul. She raised her head and looked at Commander Xia. Before her lips could move, her tears started flowing again.","Commander Xia’s heart ached when he saw this.","“You still have to remember how your Uncle Chen passed away. Someone shot his heart with a bullet. Do you know that this is murder? Think about it. As a world-class sniper, your Uncle Chen’s observation and sharpness are not something ordinary people can reach. The moment danger appears, as a sniper, he should more or less sense it and react immediately, right?","“But why didn’t he avoid it at that time? He only sensed it when the bullet was very close to him. But it was already too late...","“The other party used a dirty bomb. Obviously, he knew how powerful your Uncle Chen was and specially changed his bullets to dirty bombs.","“If it had just been an ordinary bullet, your Uncle Chen would’ve only suffered and wouldn’t have died. However, dirty bombs are different. As a sniper, you know the power of dirty bombs best.","“With your intelligence, you should understand what I mean. The murderer came prepared and was unnoticed. Who killed your Uncle Chen? Who are the perpetrators behind this? You must find them all. Do you understand?","“You have to pull yourself together and pull yourself up again to comfort your Uncle Chen in heaven.”","This sentence woke Ye Jian up from her daze bit by bit. She regained her senses bit by bit and didn’t let her sorrow control her emotions anymore.","“Get up, child. I’ll help you up.” Commander Xia held Ye Jian’s arm and pulled her up. She had been kneeling on the cold ground for more than an hour. Ye Jian said softly, “Dad, I want to find the killer who killed Uncle Chen. I must kill my enemy personally.”","“I support you. However, Little Ye, there’s something you don’t understand. The other party was able to kill your Uncle Chen with one strike. How good do you think his sniping skills are? Have you thought about it?","“I won’t stop you from seeking revenge, but you have to recognize your own capabilities. Your Uncle Chen was already so powerful, but the other party still managed to hit him with one shot. I think that this sniper’s standard... is also world-class.","“Has your standard already reached the world-class level?”","This was the question Commander Xia left for Ye Jian. It was also the question that allowed Ye Jian to walk out of her sorrow as soon as possible and stand up again."]},{"number":4039,"title":"Chapter 4039: The Cliff Is Too High","paragraphs":["Chapter 4039: The Cliff Is Too High","Editor: Henyee Translations","He understood this child. She looked docile, but in reality, she was as stubborn as Little Six. After his provocation, not only would she not be defeated, but she would also recognize the truth.","He wanted her to realize the truth as soon as possible and not lose her willpower.","As long as she didn’t lose her willpower, she would be able to survive no matter how big the blow was. She might even turn the blow into motivation and grow from adversity again. She would rely on her strength to walk out of her predicament again.","To Little Ye, who was a soldier, this was a chance to improve.","Ye Jian listened to him, especially when he said, “Have you reached the world-class level?” It woke her up instantly.","...","That was right. She had to ask herself if her standard had reached the world-class level.","If not, how was she going to pay tribute to Uncle Chen? How was she going to take revenge? How could her family feel at ease letting her kill her enemies?","Uncle Chen said that he wanted her to take care of herself. His matter was too dangerous. She shouldn’t worry about it. Was it because... he knew that she wasn’t good enough to fight with the murderer? Was that why he didn’t allow her to care about it?","She wouldn’t give up. She didn’t have the ability to fight with the murderer now, but she would definitely have the ability in the future!","She was able to bear with Ye Zhifan’s family for many years. Even with the entire family under her nose, she still endured it.","Before she had the ability, the best weapon for protection was enduring.","Ye Jian was someone who would listen to other people’s suggestions, but she would make the judgment herself to see if the suggestions she received were good or bad. She would take the good ones to heart and just respond to the bad ones with a word of thanks.","Commander Xia’s suggestion was undoubtedly good. From her point of view, it was the most practical suggestion that could allow her to recognize the truth in the shortest time possible.","Naturally, she would listen to such advice.","She stood up and wiped the tears off her face. Although her face was pale, her gaze wasn’t as lost as just now. Her black eyes, which were like the night sky as she looked forward firmly. Even the corners of her lips, which were pursed tightly, could be seen.","The child that he had always admired had fallen from a high cliff. The cliff was too high, and the bottom of the valley was too deep. She was so injured that she couldn’t see the sunlight in the sky when she raised her head. However, she didn’t give up on chasing the sunlight. She climbed out of the abyss slowly with her injuries.","No matter how many wounds she had on her body, no matter how many bloody paths she had crawled out from behind her, she still stubbornly pulled herself out of the abyss.","This kind of woman was really admirable!","Commander Xia looked at the young female soldier and the woman who would become the daughter-in-law of the Xia family in the future. He reached out his hand and gently stroked Ye Jian’s head. His usually serious voice was gentle like a kind father. “Best of luck, child. I believe that you can kill the murderer personally. You can definitely do it.","“One day, you’ll be able to fight with that world-class sniper and kill him. Child, I believe that if your Uncle Chen were still alive, he’d be very relieved.”","This was the child that Old Chen groomed personally. Old Chen had taught her to be strong and realistic. ‘Old Chen, Old Chen, it’s my blessing that I have such an outstanding future daughter-in-law.’"]},{"number":4040,"title":"Chapter 4040: Storm","paragraphs":["Chapter 4040: Storm","Editor: Henyee Translations","‘I, Xia Xinhui, will bow and thank you. In the future, this child will be protected by the Xia family. Don’t worry, I won’t let her suffer in her life.’","If she suffered in her daily life, the Xia family and the Fu family would not let off the perpetrator easily. Even Little Six couldn’t bully her.","‘Don’t worry, Old Chen. With me and Old Fu around, you can leave at ease.","‘I know that you’re worried that this child will avenge you regardless of the consequences. I’ve persuaded her to stop, so you can leave in peace.’","Commander Xia thought to himself as he gently covered Uncle Chen’s face with the white surgical cloth.","...","‘Thank you, Old Chen.","‘Thank you for grooming an outstanding female special forces soldier for the country. You definitely didn’t know that because of Ye Jian’s appearance, the military has seen that a woman’s tenacity is stronger than a man’s. They’ve already ordered every military district to form a special forces team that’s full of female soldiers.","‘Thank you for letting my Xia family have such an outstanding daughter-in-law. You were the one who groomed, educated, and guided her. You contributed to her gains today.","‘Thank you, Old Chen.’","The white cloth was completely covered. At this moment, Ye Jian knew that her Uncle Chen had really gone to a faraway place. He would never come back.","Commander Xia bowed deeply and didn’t get up for a long time.","This was a farewell. They would never meet again. Ye Jian knelt down again and kowtowed three times. She stood up and said to Commander Xia, “Dad, let’s go out...”","She wanted to prepare a clean military uniform for Uncle Chen. She wanted to organize all the medals Uncle Chen had received in the past and let them stay with Uncle Chen.","All of Uncle Chen’s belongings were in the sniper base of the Southern Province. She had to go back to the Southern Province. She had to organize the things properly and leave mementos for herself, just like after Grandpa Gen left. She had to keep Uncle Chen’s belongings well.","After walking out of the operating room, she stood and bowed deeply to the leaders of the sniper base and the provincial military district to thank them. The two leaders patted Ye Jian’s shoulder lightly. A sigh was more comforting than countless words.","When it was Commissar Yan’s turn, Ye Jian’s eyes were filled with tears again.","Before she could bend down, Commissar Yan was already holding Ye Jian firmly with both hands. “It’s only been three years since we last met and you’ve grown taller. You’re really an adult now.”","The skinny and weak little girl from his memory was gone. The woman standing in front of him had become a tough female soldier who could face any storm.","Looking at the strong Ye Jian, Commissar Yan felt gratified and sad.","He still remembered the pain this child felt when she sent Grandpa Gen away. Now, she had to send Old Chen off... His heart ached as he held Ye Jian’s shoulders tightly and said in a serious voice, “Girl, you’re an adult now. You’ll have to walk your own path in the future. Whether it’s good or bad, it’s up to you. Hence, you have to take good care of yourself, understand?”","“Yes, I will take good care of myself. I won’t disappoint Uncle Chen.” Ye Jian nodded. Her eyes were filled with sorrow, but there was determination in them.","She wouldn’t be knocked down. If she fell, she wouldn’t be able to avenge Uncle Chen.","Hence, she must stand up!","Ye Jian’s reply didn’t make Commissar Yan question her. He knew that Ye Jian would do what she said.","There was no need to comfort her. He knew that the woman who had been kneeling in front of the operating room just now had already stood up from her sorrow."]},{"number":4041,"title":"Chapter 4041: Secret","paragraphs":["Chapter 4041: Secret","Editor: Henyee Translations","The child who was treated so harshly when she was young had survived. This time, Ye Jian would definitely survive.","If life gave her hardships, she would definitely be reborn again and again. Every time she was reborn, she would be pushed to a higher peak.","Officer Lu and his colleagues, who had been present all this while, couldn’t help but hold their breaths when they saw this scene. The commander-in-chief was here... Uncle Chen, the deceased party involved, had such a powerful background that they felt that they probably wouldn’t be able to investigate this case anymore.","Officer Lu’s cell phone vibrated. He looked at it. It was an unfamiliar cell phone number, but the ending number was the police number.","He took his phone and walked to the side to pick up the call. About two minutes later, he walked over and looked at the leaders. In the end, he walked in front of Commander Xia and said in a low voice, “Commander-in-chief, all the surveillance footage near the train station has been copied along with the motherboard. We’ll prepare a copy ourselves and hand the mother tape to the military.”","...","“There’s no need to make a copy. Leave everything to me.” Commander Xia, who had a cold expression on his face, had already decided not to let the police interfere. The police and the military were not in the same system. Old Chen’s matter could only be resolved by the military. The police would no longer interfere and not implicate the investigating police.","“I’ve already told your director about what happened today. It’s been hard on you and your colleagues today. The rest will be handled by the military. Everything you see today is military secrets. Please abide by the rules of military secrets.”","Officer Lu wasn’t surprised by Commander Xia’s words. He had already realized that the police might not be able to do anything. Now that it was confirmed, it was time for them to retreat.","“Commander, we’ll definitely abide by the rules of confidentiality. Once we walk out of the hospital, it’ll be equivalent to us never being here. My colleague is already sending the motherboard over. She should be in the elevator now. We’ll leave after you get the mother tape.”","If the military needed it, it was safer to hand it over to the commander-in-chief.","Zhou Niannian, who was taking the elevator up, stared at the changing numbers on the elevator door. When she reached the floor, she rushed out before the elevator doors could open completely.","As she jogged, she quickly saw Officer Lu from the old police station. Then, she saw countless soldiers in military uniforms. She stopped in her tracks and adjusted her breathing before striding over.","“Officer Lu, this is the original copy. The bureau hasn’t had the time to back it up.” Zhou Niannian handed over the briefcase with the original copy. From the corners of her eyes, she had already seen the soldiers around the company. There was also a lieutenant general present... Who was the person who was shot during the day?","It alerted the military, and even a lieutenant general was present.","Officer Lu took the mother tape and handed it to Commander Xia. “Commander, this is the mother tape. This is the only copy. All the footage from the surveillance cameras is inside. We’ve locked onto all the footage in the past few days according to the instructions. Besides the director, no one else had the right to look at it.”","“Thank you for your hard work.” Commander Xia took the briefcase and thanked Zhou Niannian. Zhou Niannian straightened her back instantly and replied, “It wasn’t hard. This is what we should do.”","Commander Xia nodded slightly. Then, he heard the young policewoman say to Officer Lu with a serious expression, “Brother Lu, when I pulled out the footage, I found a problem with the direction, time, and position of the person involved. Can I have a meeting with you after we return to the police station?”"]},{"number":4042,"title":"Chapter 4042: Similar","paragraphs":["Chapter 4042: Similar","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who wanted to look at the footage, couldn’t help but raise her head and look over. Officer Lu said they had download 15 days worth of surveillance footage. This young policewoman said that she found something suspicious... Did she watch the fast-forwarded footage while downloading it?","Officer Lu didn’t have Zhou Niannian’s phone number, but he knew that Zhou Niannian was a police officer who interned in the bureau last year. Her performance during her internship was quite impressive, making the people from the SWAT team very envious. They revealed their intention of recruiting her into the SWAT team.","This year, as expected, Zhou Niannian, who came to report for work, really became a special police officer. She was also the only female special officer in the SWAT team.","He was afraid that Commander Xia wouldn’t agree with Zhou Niannian’s words, so he said, “Commander, Zhou Niannian is a very capable special police officer. She might look young, but she’s very capable.”","The hidden meaning was, ‘It’s worth listening to the suspicious points she brings up.’","...","Commander Xia was a little surprised when he heard that. He didn’t expect to meet a policewoman who could find suspicious points after watching fast-forwarded footage. She was a little similar to Little Ye.","He said to Ye Jian, “Little Ye, communicate with Miss Zhou.”","Ye Jian was waiting for his instructions. Hearing that, she immediately walked over and introduced herself before asking Zhou Niannian for advice.","Zhou Niannian didn’t look down on Ye Jian because she was young. She quickly told her when and where she found the suspicious points. In the end, she probably felt that she had said it too quickly and asked in embarrassment, “Was I speaking too quickly? Why don’t I write it down for you?”","Ye Jian shook her head and thanked her sincerely. “No need. Thank you very much for your help.”","“You’re welcome, you’re welcome. This is what I should do. Also...” Zhou Niannian’s expression darkened. She pursed her lips and said, “I was on duty at the train station at that time, but I didn’t manage to catch the perpetrator in time. I’m responsible for this. I don’t know how the person involved is doing. I have to apologize to him after his surgery.”","Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly and said softly, “You don’t have to apologize. The responsibility isn’t yours. You don’t have to blame yourself.”","If a world-class sniper wanted to hide, how could he be discovered so easily? The responsibility didn’t lie with Zhou Niannian. It had nothing to do with her.","The military had already sent Principal Chen’s military uniform over. At the same time, there was a bright red flag. Ye Jian didn’t chat with Zhou Niannian anymore. She said, “Thank you for your hard work.” Then, she left.","When Zhou Niannian saw this, she seemed to understand something. She stood there motionlessly as if something had hit her head...","The four guards in casual clothes quickly put on their uniforms that were sent over by their comrades. Then, the four of them entered the ward with solemn facial expressions. Principal Chen had already been transferred to the ward. Commissar Yan and the leader of the sniper base wiped the blood off Principal Chen’s fingers before leaving.","Ye Jian saw Principal Chen, who had changed into his military uniform, lying quietly on the bed. He had a kind look on his face and a smile on his face as if he had fallen asleep.","The four guards had already spread out the four corners of the flag. In the snow-white ward, the flag of red hit Ye Jian’s heart violently. She walked to one of the guards and said softly, “Let me...”","Her Uncle Chen retired from the military and left the military camp he loved the most by ‘dying in battle’. For the sake of the country, he couldn’t even use his real name to stand under the sun. However, Uncle Chen never regretted it."]},{"number":4043,"title":"Chapter 4043: Farewell","paragraphs":["Chapter 4043: Farewell","Editor: Henyee Translations","Now that he was gone, this proved that he was a soldier—an upright soldier.","Ye Jian wanted to speak up for Uncle Chen and tell everyone that this principal of a middle school and the quiet librarian of the provincial senior high library... was not an ordinary person. He was a soldier who had made countless contributions.","Being covered with the flag was a recognition of Uncle Chen’s identity. Ye Jian must personally cover Principal Chen with the flag.","No one would know about his great achievements, but this flag was a recognition of his life. These were footprints in history that would never disappear.","The bright red flag covered Principal Chen’s body bit by bit.","...","“Salute!”","A deep and powerful voice sounded in the ward. Everyone, including Officer Lu and Zhou Niannian, saluted this soldier who was loyal to the country.","After this farewell, he would not be returning.","Ye Jian, who was standing in front, looked at Uncle Chen, who was covered by the flag. She had nowhere to vent her anger, but she wasn’t defeated.","In the face of the cruelest truth, she was like a blade of grass that grew from a crack in the rock. No matter how hard others tried to stop her, she would still hold her head high and rely on her own strength to survive.","They didn’t hold a memorial service for Principal Chen. In the end, he was cremated into ashes and was placed in a small box. Ye Jian, who hadn’t slept the entire night, hugged the box and said to Commander Xia, who hadn’t slept the entire night either, “Dad, I want to bring Uncle Chen back to the Southern Province. I want Principal Chen and Grandpa Gen to be buried together. I want to return to the Southern Province today...”","Uncle Chen had stayed in the Southern Province for the longest. The Southern Province was also Uncle Chen’s home. She wanted to bring Uncle Chen home.","Looking at Ye Jian, whose eyes were bloodshot, Commander Xia told Ye Jian what Principal Chen had said before. He told her that Principal Chen’s comrades were in the Yellow River and he wanted to be with them.","“This was his last wish. It wasn’t a casual mention. Little Ye, send your Uncle Chen to reunite with his comrades.”","Ye Jian’s heart trembled. She asked, “Can’t I bring Uncle Chen back to the sniper base where he was when he was alive? Can’t I?”","“Child, he just wants to depart alone. He doesn’t want too many people to send him off. I asked him before, and he told me that he has been through too many separations in his life. He knows that it’s not a good feeling. That’s why he doesn’t want others to know that he’s gone.","“I know you want to bring him back to the sniper base and let him see the military unit he was in when he was alive. However, child, let him leave quietly. He can leave cleanly without any worries.”","Ye Jian stood alone for a long time. Her lips were trembling. In the end, she nodded gently.","Commander Xia knew that Principal Chen had once scattered the ashes of his comrades in the Yellow River. There were a total of four martyrs. Principal Chen remained concerned about the company commander, squad leader, and his last two comrades before he retired. Principal Chen stood at the same place at different times to scatter his comrades’ ashes.","On the day Ye Jian departed, it was drizzling when the plane took off. Holding a small box in her hand, Ye Jian boarded the plane in the drizzle.","Accompanying her was the leader of the sniper base, the leader of the provincial military district, Commissar Yan, and four guards. Commander Xia didn’t go with them. As the commander-in-chief, he had many things to do. He also had a few urgent matters to deal with. After sending Ye Jian on the plane, he immediately took another plane to the border."]},{"number":4044,"title":"Chapter 4044: No Return Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 4044: No Return Time","Editor: Henyee Translations","After getting off the plane, the drizzle continued. After a while, Ye Jian finally arrived at the river where Principal Chen had personally scattered the ashes of his old company commander, squad leader, and two comrades. The drizzle turned into rain.","It was very cold here. The riverside and under the rocks were covered in thick ice. Only the water at the entrance of the waterfall was still powerful. It broke through the sound of ice that stopped it from surging and carried the broken ice down.","The cold wind messed up Ye Jian’s hair, and the cold rain drenched her face. Ye Jian walked step by step to the place where Principal Chen used to stand. There was already a metal fence here. She couldn’t any father.","Standing here, Ye Jian raised her head and looked upstream. She saw water, sand, and large ice cubes rushing down from the upstream. They surged over with a majestic aura. They stood on the grayish-brown rocks with a deafening sound and looked at the Yellow River that had been surging for thousands of years. Ye Jian held the box tightly in her hand and didn’t move for a long time.","There were not only the heroic souls of Uncle Chen’s comrades here. There were also many martyrs here. The surging water brought with it a bone-chilling wind. Ye Jian, who seemed to have heard a battle song, lowered her head and looked at the tightly held box. She said softly, “Uncle Chen, I’ve brought you here. You’ll be able to reunite with your comrades soon.","...","“You said that you didn’t want to have a memorial service and didn’t want too many people to know about your passing. Look at you. At this point, you still want to remain unknown.”","Ye Jian slowly opened the box. The wind carried the rain as it blew past. It wet the white ashes and blew them away. Ye Jian knelt on the cold and damp rock. Her hands trembled as she held the ashes...","The wind blew like a horn or a cry. The rain poured down. It was tears and sorrow. The strong wind blew away the ashes in her hand. Principal Chen, who had made countless contributions to the country, disappeared bit by bit. In the end, only a box that had previously contained his ashes was saved.","Looking at the empty box, Ye Jian blinked lightly. Water droplets fell into the box. She couldn’t tell if it was rainwater or tears.","He was gone. Uncle Chen was gone. From now on, she would never see Uncle Chen again. She would never hear Uncle Chen’s stern voice that made her feel awe.","He had really left...","Ye Jian closed the wooden box. Her eyes were red as she knelt toward the Yellow Rive without getting up.","After putting down the military salute to show that they were paying their respects when the ashes were being scattered, the group of people stood quietly and didn’t persuade Ye Jian to come down.","The wind and rain were still blowing. The person who had been kneeling for a long time was still kneeling. Her slender back was like a spear with a knife stuck in it. When she got up, the spear would be ruthless and the knife would be cold. It would cut through the darkness and destroy all sins with bullets.","Now, they were waiting for the female soldier to stand up.","“Goodbye, Uncle Chen. I’ll pay my respects to you again next time.” Ye Jian, whose forehead was injured from knocking it against the ground, stood up. The cold wind was too strong. The tip of her nose was red. Ye Jian was no longer standing in the eye of the storm. There were still long icicles on the rocks below. She held the box and retreated from the high ground. She retreated between the leader and the guard. This time, she completed the soldier’s salute alone.","There was another hero in the flowing Yellow River. Ye Jian turned around and looked back again. She seemed to see a kind back view walking in the rain..."]},{"number":4045,"title":"Chapter 4045: A Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 4045: A Life","Editor: Henyee Translations","When she turned around, he looked back too. What a familiar face. What a kind smile. Her Uncle Chen... was waving goodbye to her.","Ye Jian cried and smiled again. Ye Jian, who was crying and smiling, raised her hand and waved at the empty Yellow River.","Commissar Yan followed her gaze. Besides the rain and the sky, there was nothing else.","“Let’s go, girl. It’s time for us to return to the Southern Province,” he said softly. He held Ye Jian’s cold hand and left with her.","‘Old Chen, I’ll come and see you next time. If there’s a chance, I’ll bring Ye Jian along to see you.","...","‘I still have to meet... Old Liu. I have to tell him that you left. I don’t know what he did in prison. I’ll go over and visit him this time to see if I can understand the situation.","‘Now that you’ve left and Old Liu is in prison, our relationship will dissipate.’","Commissar Yan, who had become much haggard overnight, held Ye Jian’s hand and left the Yellow River. They still had to return to the Southern Province together and tidy up Principal Chen’s belongings at the sniper base. Commander Xia had said that Old Chen had left without a trace, but his deeds must not be unknown.","They had to sort it out. They had to find the murderer and the people behind the murderer. Old Chen’s deeds would become a military secret. They had to let the soldiers, who had become top snipers, see and know that their country once had a world-class sniper who had dedicated his entire life to the country.","Heroes should not be unknown. Heroes should live in their hearts forever and become faith!","The soldiers and instructors of the sniper base all knew that their Instructor Chen had been sacrificed. At 3:06 am, when the camp gate slowly opened and Ye Jian walked in with the wooden box, a sorrowful salute sounded like a thunderclap. As all the soldiers raised their arms. Instructor Chen returned had returned to the base.","It was just an empty box covered with the flag, but they still welcomed Principal Chen back to the military camp with the highest etiquette.","Instructor Chen had to leave without making a sound. He didn’t want to alarm the base. However, every soldier here had received Instructor Chen’s personal guidance before. If they couldn’t send him off, they would welcome him home. Even if... it was just an empty box, their Instructor Chen had slept in it before.","In the early morning, the sniper base was shrouded in sorrow. Ye Jian walked past the middle of the tunnel. She even heard the sound of soldiers sobbing.","They remembered Uncle Chen and would remember him for the rest of their lives. ‘Uncle Chen, look, you’ve never left. You’ll always live in the hearts of the soldiers. You’re destined to not be unknown forever. In the near future, your name will definitely be carved on a monument.’","The soldiers had already tidied up all of Uncle Chen’s belongings. They only needed to hand them to Ye Jian personally. The leader of the sniper base said to Ye Jian, “This room will always maintain its original appearance. The soldiers will take turns to clean Instructor Chen’s room. The cups on the table will be filled with water. There will be hot water in thermal bottles every day, and the bed will be tidied every day... The dust on the bookcase will be cleaned every day. As long as the sniper base is still around, this will always be Instructor Chen’s room.”","They were doing this because they would miss Instructor Chen, who had helped all the soldiers greatly in sniping. The leader wanted every sniper who entered the sniper base to know that there was once an instructor here who had taught countless outstanding snipers."]},{"number":4046,"title":"Chapter 4046: Back On The Journey","paragraphs":["Chapter 4046: Back On The Journey","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian’s gaze moved across the room. She memorized the decorations of the room bit by bit. She would never forget a single detail.","All the belongings had been tidied up. They would be sent to the military to be archived.","Ye Jian took Principal Chen’s hanger. When the time came, she would use this hanger for her military uniform in the military unit after she graduated. She would tell Uncle Chen that when she entered the military unit, she would really become an iron-blooded soldier.","If she could still come to the sniper base, she would definitely come and take a look again. That was because she still remembered Uncle Chen’s expression when he walked into the sniper base that day. He had never been so happy before. Even the smile lines at the corners of his eyes had appeared several times on that day.","As a sniper, Uncle Chen really liked this place. Hence, even when he knew that he shouldn’t leave the camp so easily, he felt that it wasn’t a problem.","...","Now that he had left this sniper base that he loved deeply, if Ye Jian could, she would definitely come and take a look again. Then, she would tell Uncle Chen what had been going on.","At this moment, Ye Jian was the only one in the room. This was Commissar Yan’s suggestion. He asked her to sit in Principal Chen’s room alone and release her sorrow for the last time. After walking out of this room, she would start a new journey.","Just like what Commissar Yan said, Ye Jian walked out of the room at dawn. The air of sorrow on her body was gone. Her journey had begun. She had to fight for her journey.","The soldiers from the sniper base buried the box that previously contained Uncle Chen’s ashes in the shooting range of the sniper base. Ye Jian stood in front of the small mound and took a cigarette from Commissar Yan. Then, she stuck it into the small mound. Today, she found out that a long time ago, Uncle Chen was a smoker—especially in the first two years after he came to township middle school. At his peak, he smoked two packets a day.","This was what Commissar Yan said just now. Ye Jian sat in her room and didn’t come out until dawn. Commissar Yan sat there and talked about the past until Ye Jian came out.","When they left the sniper base, Commissar Yan asked Ye Jian if Commander Liu was in prison. He wanted to go over and take a look. He asked Ye Jian if she wanted to come along. He smiled bitterly. He still didn’t know why his old partner was in prison.","Ye Jian knew, but she didn’t answer. She avoided the topic and said softly, “I’m sorry, I can’t accompany you to visit Commander Liu. When you see Commander Liu, please send my regards to him.”","“Sigh, you don’t have any extra time now. Come, let’s go to the airport first.” Commissar Yan didn’t ask further. He went to the airport with Ye Jian. Four guards from the capital city carried Principal Chen’s belongings and headed to the airport to prepare to fly to the capital city.","Ye Jian didn’t have any extra time to see Commander Liu. Also, she wasn’t prepared to face Commander Liu, who had shot her mother, again.","Now, she still needed to hurry up and look at the surveillance footage. She needed to find the suspect among the thousands of people.","The military had already arranged for technicians to watch the footage. They first observed the time period mentioned before further verification and investigation.","Ye Jian’s schedule was even tighter. The day after tomorrow, it would be time for all the students to report back to school. If she didn’t find anything suspicious before dawn the day after tomorrow, she could only return to school.","She didn’t alarm Old Master Fu when she returned to the capital city. She didn’t want Old Master Fu to worry about her, let alone bring danger to him. Before she found the murderer, she couldn’t implicate her grandpa and father.","This was what Commander Xia was thinking too."]},{"number":4047,"title":"Chapter 4047: Full Of Gratitude","paragraphs":["Chapter 4047: Full Of Gratitude","Editor: Henyee Translations","After returning to the capital city from the Southern Province, Commander Xia knew Ye Jian’s schedule very well. When he knew that she was going to watch the surveillance footage provided by the police, Commander Xia, who was still sitting in a car heading to a military unit in the bordering town, was silent for a while. He said to the guard beside him, “Let the guards bring her to the security center. At the same time, ask the guard over there to remind her to be careful. After she’s done, she’ll return to school immediately and not come out again.”","The guard immediately relayed Commander Xia’s order to the guard who was talking to him. That guard had been beside Ye Jian, so Ye Jian could find out immediately.","The four guards had been accompanying Ye Jian. Now, instead of accompanying her, they were protecting her.","After hearing Commander Xia’s order, Ye Jian nodded lightly. She actually knew that what she was doing was a little inappropriate. If Commander Xia hadn’t arranged it for her, it would have been difficult for her to come into contact with the mother tape that had been sent to the military. She also knew that even if she saw the mother tape, she might not be able to find any clues after watching the surveillance footage.","She knew it all... However, as long as she thought about how Uncle Chen was hit by the dirty bomb that was banned internationally, she couldn’t control her desire to find the murderer.","...","Whether she could find the murderer in the footage or not, she still wanted to take a look...","She also knew what Commander Xia was worried about. That was why there were still four guards around her.","Uncle Chen said that if he left, they shouldn’t alert anyone. He just wanted to leave silently. She knew that Uncle Chen had been silent for his entire life and didn’t want the world to know about him, but she also knew that he left silently because of her.","He said to inform Ye Jian as a last resort... It could be understood that he only wanted her to be informed if he really could not take it anymore. If he could, he would hide it.","Her Uncle Chen didn’t forget to remind her before he left, “Don’t go. It’s dangerous.”","Ye Jian knew that there was danger ahead. She wouldn’t take the risk easily. Just like what the Commander Xia said, before she became a world-class sniper and before she had the ability to fight against evil, she wouldn’t take the risk.","She promised Uncle Chen that she wouldn’t take any risks, so she wouldn’t be rash anymore. She would take good care of herself. She couldn’t let Grandpa Gen and Uncle Chen worry about her safety.","Soon, Commander Xia received a message from Ye Jian on his phone. After reading it, a gratified smile appeared in his eyes.","Little Ye was young, but she knew everything.","She understood his painstaking efforts. She knew that there was no progress on the murderer at this moment. She was worried that she would be in danger because of Old Chen. That was why she said that she would return to school immediately after watching the footage and not stay.","It was good that she knew everything clearly.","The smiling Commander Xia sent a message over. Ye Jian read it and was filled with gratitude.","[Old Fu isn’t in the capital city. Don’t worry.]","Looking at this message, Ye Jian’s vision couldn’t help but turn a little blurry. She had sent her two closest relatives away, but she had a close family member like Commander Xia beside her. She was so lucky in this life.","She was afraid of alerting her grandpa. The old man kept saying that he wanted to thank Uncle Chen in person for taking care of her for so many years. In the end, Uncle Chen left before the day arrived.","If her grandpa knew that Uncle Chen was murdered, he would definitely investigate. If her grandpa knew, he would definitely not be able to feel at ease. His health was not good to begin with, and he would be worried about her. Ye Jian was worried that his health would not be able to take it.","It would have been fine if Mr. Fu was here. She wasn’t afraid about Mr. Fu knowing about Uncle Chen’s passing. But she didn’t dare to let her grandpa know.","This was also why she didn’t tell her grandpa when she came back to the capital city twice in the past few days."]},{"number":4048,"title":"Chapter 4048: Smuggling","paragraphs":["Chapter 4048: Smuggling","Editor: Henyee Translations","Now that her grandpa wasn’t in the capital city, she heaved a sigh of relief.","Looking at the four guards beside her, Ye Jian thought for a moment and called Commander Xia. She didn’t text him anymore. It was easier to explain on the phone.","After she finished speaking, Commander Xia sighed and said, “When you reach the school, they’ll return to the company. You don’t have to feel pressured.”","“Dad, there’s really no need. When they send me to the security center later, you can order them to go back. It’s been hard on them to follow me around these few days. Nothing will happen to me. If the other party really has their eyes on me, I think they would’ve attacked me when I was still hospitalized at the Southern Province Armed Police Hospital.","“If it were me and I knew that there was an unexpected figure who might pose problems in the future, I would have dealt with it. However, they didn’t. That’s why I feel that they don’t know about my existence at all.","...","“Let them go back to the company to rest. I’m going to the security center. Are you still worried that something will happen to me there? That place is heavily guarded. How could something happen to me there?”","Commander Xia had actually thought of what Ye Jian was thinking. If the other party really knew about her existence, with the other party’s meticulous plan, they would’ve definitely killed Ye Jian. However, the other party didn’t.","Perhaps the other party didn’t know about Little Ye’s existence.","Either that or they didn’t manage to find out Little Ye’s whereabouts.","He preferred the latter.","She was right. How could someting happen to her in the security center?","Also, it was against the rules to send four guards to protect Ye Jian. Fortunately, she was going to the security center later. He would let the four guards send her there and then have them return to the company.","After the four guards received Commander Xia’s order, they sent Ye Jian to the security center and left a car behind. Then, they returned to the company.","However, Ye Jian didn’t gain anything from this trip. The people that Zhou Niannian pointed out didn’t directly contact Uncle Chen when he was shot. However, there was something wrong with these people. Two of them were fugitives from a serious case. When Ye Jian brought Principal Chen’s ashes to the Yellow River, the two fugitives were caught on a train heading south.","Ye Jian had already watched all the footage three times in the security center. She finally stopped persisting. Indeed... she didn’t gain anything.","Tomorrow, it was time for her to report back to the military school. She couldn’t stay in the capital city. She had to go back to school tomorrow.","Ye Jian rubbed her dry eyes as she watched the footage. She suppressed the bitterness in her heart and drank the coffee that had turned cold.","The coldness of the coffee made her chest feel cold. What made her heart turn cold was that... the other party, who came prepared, had hid too well and didn’t leave any traces.","“The National Defense is guessing that the murderer was smuggled into our country. The weapons used were all distributed and carried into our country. The entire murder plan wasn’t set up in a day or two. It took a long time and a very thorough arrangement before they started taking action.","“There’s no way to find any traces in the footage. We can only investigate why Principal Chen entered the capital city.”","However, Uncle Chen had already left. How could they investigate?","Ye Jian walked out of the security center and looked up at the cold moon hanging in the sky. The other party came prepared and used a dirty bomb. It was obvious that they had cut off Uncle Chen’s path of survival with one shot. They were well-prepared. How could they be easily found?"]},{"number":4049,"title":"Chapter 4049: A Tough Woman Too","paragraphs":["Chapter 4049: A Tough Woman Too","Editor: Henyee Translations","Even if there were any traces, they would have been erased.","Would they be able to find the murderer?","Unwilling to give up, Ye Jian stepped forward with bitter eyes. She didn’t know if she could find the murderer. If the National Defense couldn’t find him, she didn’t know who else could.","Ye Jian started the car and drove toward the entrance of the security center. When she reached the entrance, she was inspected by the sentinels before she was let out.","It was past eight o’clock. She should go to Dan Gui Garden to take a look. Grandpa wasn’t at home, but Uncle Fu should be.","...","She hadn’t come back for the new year. There was still some time. She might as well go over and take a look.","If Uncle Fu wanted to ask her questions, she could just find an excuse.","No, there was one more person she needed to look for.","Qin Xiu often went to Dan Gui Garden and had such a good relationship with her grandpa. If he said something in front of her grandpa one day, with her grandpa’s wisdom, he might really be able to guess.","No, she needed to remind Qin Xiu.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but frown when she thought about how she still needed to take the initiative to look for Qin Xiu.","Zhou Niannian, who knew earlier than Ye Jian that the suspects in the footage weren’t the murderers, had been in a bad mood for the past two days. She was a lively and cheerful person. Her colleagues couldn’t help but worry when she didn’t speak much for the past few days.","Although she was the only female SWAT officer in the SWAT team, she was still a female, after all. The male SWAT officers didn’t dare to underestimate Zhou Niannian’s viciousness during training, but they still cared more about her than the other male SWAT officers.","Realizing that she hadn’t been talking much for the past few days, the captain of the team asked after the training, “What happened? Did they bully you? Why do you look as though you’re a statue? Why are you so listless?”","Zhou Niannian was wiping the sweat off her face with a towel. When she heard this, she looked at the captain and smiled. “No, I’m just not in a good mood. As a woman, there are always a few days in a month when I’m not in a good mood.”","“That’s not right. Half a month ago was when you were in a bad mood, right? It hasn’t even been a month, right?” A special police officer happened to come over to take the towel hanging on the pole of the training room. He heard it and interrupted casually.","He could tell that Zhou Niannian was in a bad mood these few days. When he saw the captain going over to ask, he paid more attention to the two. In the end, when he heard what she said, he replied casually.","After he finished speaking, he didn’t feel that he had said anything wrong. He closed his eyes and took a towel to wipe the sweat on his face. Suddenly, he felt a strong wind coming toward his stomach. It was too late for him to react. His stomach was punched by Zhou Niannian. It was so painful that his facial features were distorted.","After Zhou Niannian finished punching, he said to her captain, “I’m fine. I’m just not in a good mood. I’ll be fine in a few days. I’m leaving, Captain. See you tomorrow.”","“Let’s have dinner together. It’s already nine o’clock. After dinner, we’ll send you back to the police station.” The captain still wanted to keep her. She hadn’t laughed for a few days. If they chatted at the dining table, everything might be fine.","Zhou Niannian stuffed her towel into her backpack and took her SWAT uniform from the closet. She put it on and replied, “No, I’m a little tired today. I want to go home early to rest. My brother is waiting for me at home too.”","After last night, all the SWAT colleagues knew where she lived.","Zhou Niannian had a cousin called Zhou Huainan. Everyone in the SWAT team knew who Zhou Huainan was. He was a legend in the SWAT team. Now, he had been transferred to the Great Hall!"]},{"number":4050,"title":"Chapter 4050: Followed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4050: Followed","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yesterday, he personally drove to the special police unit to see Zhou Niannian. The special police officers who were training at that time were shocked.","No wonder Zhou Niannian was so powerful. She was Zhou Huainan’s younger sister!","“Okay, see you tomorrow.” The captain didn’t invite her anymore. He glanced at the male SWAT officer who was in so much pain that he couldn’t speak for a long time. After Zhou Niannian walked away, he sighed and said, “You sure know a lot, huh? Don’t interrupt next time.”","He even remembered things about women so clearly.","The male SWAT officer felt very aggrieved. “I was just concerned about my colleague. Who knew that it was wrong to be concerned? I was even punched! She’s so strong. It hurts so much that I have to bite my tongue when I speak.”","...","...","The captain didn’t want to remind him at first, but when he saw that his brother still didn’t understand what mistake he had made, the captain knew he had to provide some guidance. “It’s right to be concerned, but your words don’t sound pleasant. That’s a woman’s privacy, understand? How could you say that?! Are you stupid?”","The male SWAT officer, who was enlightened, let out a long ‘oh’. However, he still felt wronged. “I don’t even treat her as a woman.”","“You don’t treat her like a woman, but you know that she was in a bad mood half a month ago?” The captain felt a little tired. He took his towel and wiped his sweat before leaving.","Zhou Niannian changed her clothes and left the boxing room of the brigade. She had been detained in the team for the past few days. No, it should be said that she and her two other colleagues who had rushed to the scene that day had been detained in the team.","She didn’t know how the investigation was going or whether the culprit was found. The lieutenant general was involved, so he should be able to solve the case as soon as possible. The military had been alerted.","A pair of black eyes that were as sharp as daggers flashed past her mind. Zhou Niannian, who was leaving the SWAT team, couldn’t help but miss it again.","That young lady’s eyes were beautiful and... filled with killing intent. It was as if she had really killed someone. Zhou Niannian didn’t dare to look at her directly.","She was the relative of the person involved. Officer Lu even specially reminded her not to tell anyone what had happened in the hospital after returning to the military unit, including her colleagues and the captain.","The lieutenant general also personally issued a message, saying that this matter was a top military secret and could only be known to the people involved. Although she was a police officer, she knew what top military secrets were. However, she still wanted to know... if the murderer had been caught.","Alas, if she knew this would’ve happened, she would’ve gotten the young lady’s number. That way, Zhou Niannian could have asked her.","At around nine o’clock, there were many cars on the road in the capital city. Fortunately, the SWAT team’s base wasn’t in the center. It was on the third ring. Zhou Niannian turned on the traffic channel and listened to where the traffic was smooth. About ten minutes after she drove out, she heard from the channel that there was a car accident on a certain road. The drivers on that road were taking a detour. When Zhou Niannian heard that and realized that was the closest route back home, she took another route after getting on the viaduct.","After driving out of the viaduct and heading south, Zhou Niannian felt that something was wrong.","From the rearview mirror in the middle of the car, she saw a car following her from a distance. She couldn’t see how many people were in the car. Due to her professional sharpness, she felt that the car had been following her.","She slowly reached for the SWAT backpack on the passenger seat. She opened the zipper at the side and pulled out the two-sectioned stick that she usually used for training."]},{"number":4051,"title":"Chapter 4051: Contest","paragraphs":["Chapter 4051: Contest","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Niannian first called her brother, Zhou Huainan. Zhou Huainan was a special police officer who was in charge of the safety of the leaders at the Great Hall. When he received his sister’s call, he didn’t alarm his parents or even his wife and daughter. He returned to his study quietly.","He turned on the phone and entered the satellite system. He locked onto the capital city and entered the street number. Soon, he knew where his sister was.","She could go home through this route, but it was quite far. How was Zhou Niannian going to take a detour home?","Zhou Niannian seemed to have guessed what her brother would ask. She held the steering wheel firmly with both hands and occasionally looked at the car behind her through the rearview mirror. She pretended that nothing was going on and continued driving.","She said, “There was a car accident on the shortcut. I chose to take a detour. Brother, find me a place that’s more convenient for me to shake them off. It’s best if there are not many cars nearby. I shouldn’t implicate innocent people.”","...","There were many people who hated the Zhou family, especially those from the underworld. A few years ago, the underworld even issued a ‘hunting order’ and offered a reward of 500,000 yuan to kill Mr. Zhou. In the end, Mr. Zhou was fine. The person who issued the reward had grown bolder.","The Zhou family had many enemies. Zhou Niannian wasn’t surprised to see a car following her. Zhou Huainian wasn’t surprised either. Almost everyone in the Zhou family had encountered this before. It was up to them to shake the other party off.","His ten fingers typed on the keyboard quickly. Soon, through the satellite map, Zhou Huainian started to tell Zhou Niannian which path was the safest.","“Enter Tongling Bridge, turn left, go down the slope, turn left on Nanding Road...”","On the phone, Zhou Huainan’s calm voice was transmitted to Zhou Niannian’s ears through the earpiece. With his command, Zhou Niannian looked at the car that was still following closely behind her and smiled.","She had small dimples. If she smiled, her small dimples would appear. She looked even more mischievous and cute.","After crossing the Tongling Bridge, she stepped on the accelerator when she turned left. The car disappeared at an extremely fast speed.","The man driving behind looked forward with a sinister gaze. At the same time, he stepped on the accelerator and accelerated.","“She has already discovered me. Now, it’s your turn to appear. Force her out of all the main roads and force her to the bridge. Her driving skills should be not bad. Be careful.”","In the car, the masked man revealed a pair of eyes that were much deeper than any Chinese. The street lamps in the car window flashed past, and the beams of light could be seen clearly. It was a Western man, and his words were in English.","He, who was also wearing headphones, informed his friend. Soon, a truck drove out from an auxiliary road. Two other sedans sped toward the slope where Zhou Niannian was.","Zhou Niannian turned left and went down the Tongling Bridge. Then, she turned left and rushed into the slope road. Zhou Huainian could see the satellite map, but he couldn’t see the dynamic map. He couldn’t keep an eye on where Zhou Niannian’s car was and could only find out from his phone.","Zhou Niannian, who was still on the slope, saw that the cars behind her were already following closely. At the same time, two more cars rushed over.","“Brother, it’s a little troublesome. Two more cars are coming. They’re pincering me now.” Zhou Niannian frowned slightly. The three cars didn’t do anything. It seemed like they were planning to force her somewhere."]},{"number":4052,"title":"Chapter 4052: Approaching","paragraphs":["Chapter 4052: Approaching","Editor: Henyee Translations","After thinking for a while, Zhou Niannian said calmly, “They probably want to force me into a corner. They either want to kidnap me or create a car accident to have me killed. Brother, help me contact the SWAT team. I need them to handle it.”","Zhou Niannian didn’t panic. She suddenly accelerated. The car sped dozens of meters away and successfully turned into Nanding Road.","“I’ve already entered the Nanding Road. I’m starting to turn right from the Nanding Road onto the main road. See if there are any traffic police on the main road.”","If he wanted to know if the traffic police were on the main road, Zhou Huainan could do it with a phone call. He first called the SWAT team and reported Zhou Niannian’s current situation to the SWAT team on duty. Then, he called the traffic police detachment in charge of this area of the Nanding Road. Unfortunately, there were no traffic police investigating the main road at night today.","“There’s no night inspection. Go straight out of the Third Ring Road from the Dongling Road on the Nanding Road. Also, see how much gas the car has left. You might run out of gas before your colleagues arrive.”","...","Zhou Huainan’s reminder made Zhou Niannian smile. “Don’t worry, it’s full of gas. I’ll go to Dongling Road, so get my colleagues to take the main road. I’m now going to Tongping Avenue beside Dongling Road. Get my colleagues to go to Tongping Avenue.”","“Okay, be careful.” Although Zhou Huainan was worried about his sister, he knew how capable she was. She just had to find a way to break out of this encirclement. She could handle it.","Tongping Avenue was a main road with four lanes on both sides. Zhou Niannian was 3.7 kilometers away from Nanding Road to Tongping Avenue. After Zhou Huainan told her which auxiliary road was the closest, Zhou Niannian had already stepped on the accelerator much harder.","At this moment, she didn’t care if she would exceed the speed limit.","The police cars of the SWAT team moved out. A total of four police cars blared their sirens and rushed toward Tongping Avenue.","The police siren sounded. The entire night sky was filled with nervous tension. When the passing cars heard the urgent sirens, they made way for the four police cars.","They couldn’t contact Zhou Niannian. Zhou Niannian was still on the phone with Zhou Huainan. She had already arrived at Tongping Avenue. Her speed was very fast. It was so fast because she had raced over. The driver of the car that was not far away from her couldn’t help but curse.","She had already exceeded 120 miles per hour, which was equivalent to driving at high speed. How could he not cuss?","However, very soon, three more cars sped over at the same speed. Some drivers thought that the young sirs in the capital city were probably racing. Damn it, how could they race in cars that cost more 100,000 yuan race? They must be crazy!","After cursing, the drivers who felt much better continued driving their own cars obediently. They didn’t dare to race like the four cars just now. That wasn’t racing; that was seeking death!","Zhou Niannian’s driving skills were not bad, so the three cars behind her couldn’t help but be on guard. They wanted to force this Chinese SWAT officer who seemed to know something onto the viaduct. Then, they would let the truck hit her and knock her car off the viaduct. This way, they would be able to take care of this Chinese SWAT officer.","However, what made them angry was that they didn’t know that the Chinese SWAT officer was so good at driving. Now that there was trouble, it was very likely that their plan would fail."]},{"number":4053,"title":"Chapter 4053: Collision","paragraphs":["Chapter 4053: Collision","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Don’t try to force her onto the viaduct anymore. This is a Chinese police officer who knows how to drive. Shooting will solve the problem faster than driving. She might have already informed her colleagues. If we blow up her wheels now, she might be able to see God faster.”","The first Western man who followed Zhou Niannian’s car said coldly. He picked up the pistol on the passenger seat and prepared to shoot at the wheels of Zhou Niannian’s car.","The drivers of the other two cars also took out the pistols they hid in their arms. Whoever approached the target car first would shoot immediately.","Zhou Niannian didn’t expect the other party to be carrying guns. She also didn’t expect the people following her to not be Chinese at all. She just thought they were from the underworld seeking revenge.","In reality, these people appeared because she had discovered something.","...","If Zhou Niannian was asked what she had discovered, she wouldn’t be able to answer. She didn’t even know what she had discovered.","When the tires exploded with a bang due to the bullets, Zhou Niannian knew that these people had guns in their hands. The moment her tires exploded, the car was heavily impacted. She had been driving on the leftmost side, and there was an iron railing separating the car from the road. The side mirror on the driver’s side was scraped off by the iron railing. The entire left side of the car ground against the iron railing, causing sparks to fly.","Ye Jian entered the Third Ring Road from the security center. Tongping Avenue was the fastest way to enter the Third Ring Road. She opened the window all the way and drove at 50 miles per hour. Suddenly, she heard the most familiar sounds. In an instant, her mind was tense.","Gunshots. She heard them.","Across the front passenger seat, she saw a car opposite scraping against the iron guardrail. Sparks flew from the friction between the car and the guardrail. Ye Jian quickly lowered down the glass window on the front passenger seat. After taking a look, she accelerated to the traffic light in front without hesitation. Then, she turned left and turned into the other side of Tongping Avenue.","She stepped on the accelerator and rushed toward the white car in front of her. However, the white car was driving forward once more.","This was the capital city, the heart of the country. As a military school student, it was impossible for Ye Jian to turn a blind eye to the gunshots.","She was driving at the same speed as the other drivers. The drivers, who didn’t know anything, cursed again when they saw this.","The drivers couldn’t understand why Zhou Niannian’s car suddenly had flat tires.","Was there something wrong with this person? The car had flat tires and the guardrail had been knocked away. Sparks flew all over the left side of the car, yet the driver didn’t stop. Did they not want the car anymore? Were they planning to scrap it?","Zhou Niannian knew that she had met a ruthless opponent. She asked Zhou Huainan, “They have guns in their hands. My tires were blown up by them. I can’t drive on Tongping Avenue anymore. Where’s the secondary road? I want to go to the secondary road with the least cars.”","Zhou Huainan heard the collision and locked onto the best route through the satellite map.","Soon, Zhou Niannian’s car came down from Tongping Avenue and drove to the auxiliary road at the side. The wheels were broken, but the car was still moving at a fast speed. It was as if the entire car was driving on an uneven road.","Ye Jian, who almost lost track of the group of cars, had already caught up with them. At the same time, she locked onto three cars. This was because these three cars had been attacking the small white sedan. Also..."]},{"number":4054,"title":"Chapter 4054: Join Forces","paragraphs":["Chapter 4054: Join Forces","Editor: Henyee Translations","With a sharp look in her eyes, Ye Jian suddenly turned the steering wheel. The car was like an arrow that had left the bow, crashing into a black sedan.","Clang!","Swoosh!","The first loud clang was when Ye Jian used the side of the front passenger seat to hit the driver’s side of the car where a pistol was sticking out. The second swoosh was the sound of a bullet leaving the barrel. The pistol had been equipped with a silencer, and the sound was very soft. The bullet that missed flew somewhere.","The first loud clang was when Ye Jian used the passenger seat to hit the driver’s seat of a car with a pistol sticking out. The second swoosh was the sound of a pistol bullet leaving the barrel. It was equipped with a silencer and the sound was very soft. The bullet that missed flew somewhere.","...","The driver in the car cursed. A loud clang was heard. The car slammed into a green tree, and the entire front of the car was dented in.","Ye Jian didn’t stop because two more cars had disappeared from her vision.","“Brother, someone is helping me. They helped me get a car. It’s probably a colleague who’s just gotten off work.” Zhou Niannian looked at the two cars behind her. Her voice was a little tense. “Get the dispatched traffic police to be careful. The people in the car might be carrying guns.”","Zhou Huainan heaved a sigh of relief when he heard that a colleague had helped his sister. He sat in front of the computer and said calmly, “Let’s see if the other colleagues will be able to catch up. If they do, you have a chance of winning.","“Your colleagues are still on their way. Calm down and don’t panic.”","“Yes, tell them that I’ve already seen such scenes from when I was ten years old. I won’t panic.” Although Zhou Niannian was sweating, she was still very relaxed. She was driving a car with its back wheels blown up. Her stomach was heaving, but she was still able to speed up the car.","However, even if the car wasn’t scrapped after this, it would have to be overhauled.","The two cars knew that something had happened to their companion, but they didn’t stop to watch. Now, they needed to deal with the target in front of them as soon as possible.","This was the Chinese police officer they had to deal with.","They drove into an industrial park. It was almost 10:00 pm. Besides the street lamps on the road, it was pitch-black everywhere. There was no one around. Only a few lights in the buildings in the industrial park were on. Zhou Niannian felt more relaxed when she saw this.","This way, at least she didn’t have to worry about endangering the people at any time.","However, she was also in danger. The two cars behind her started chasing crazily. Their speed was at its highest. At the same time, they reached out their hands and raised their pistols to shoot at the car in front.","Swish... Swish...","They fired randomly at the car. The ordinary glass windows of the car couldn’t block the bullets. Soon, the windshield at the back of the car was broken, and so was the glass window of the door behind.","When Ye Jian caught up with them, she saw two cars shooting at the white car. When she saw the S-shaped route of the white car, her heart sank. She stepped down on the accelerator to the max.","The speed of the car went from 140 miles per hour to 180 miles per hour. It was still accelerating.","The motor of the car was very loud. The entire industrial park was very quiet, so the loud motor was heard by the people chasing after Zhou Niannian’s car. When they saw a car chasing after them at such a fast speed, one of the cars suddenly turned sideways. The driver aimed the gun in his hand at Ye Jian’s car.","Ye Jian also drove the car in an ‘S’ trajectory. This way, the other party wouldn’t be able to shoot accurately."]},{"number":4055,"title":"Chapter 4055: Bulletproof Car","paragraphs":["Chapter 4055: Bulletproof Car","Editor: Henyee Translations","Being shot while driving was an indispensable training for a special forces soldier. However, when Ye Jian was at the automobile soldier training base, she still had a pistol with blank cartridges to shoot back.","Now, besides the silver wire on her wrist, she didn’t have any other weapons. It was impossible to stop the other party from shooting from afar. She could only force the other party to stop shooting if she accepted the challenge directly.","After a few ‘S’ turns, Ye Jian’s speed didn’t decrease at all. She was like a cannonball that had been fired, crashing toward the sedan that was parked horizontally.","“Damn it!”","When the man with the gun saw this, he cursed and quickly released the brake. He no longer tried to stop this person who came out of nowhere.","...","At first, the the driver thought that the gun in his hand was enough to force this person who was obstructing his mission to stop. Who knew that the situation would exceed his expectations?","Who said that the Chinese police were as weak as chicks on a farm? Who said that the Chinese police didn’t have the habit of carrying guns and could be killed easily?","Who the hell said that?","These Chinese police were not easy to deal with. At least, the Chinese police they met tonight had already made them feel troubled.","“Fred, I’m in some trouble here. I’ll take care of the Chinese policewoman and then take care of this damned fellow who came out of nowhere. Their car is bulletproof. I can’t take care of them now. I need to shake them off first.”","The man who was driving quickly said in a low voice. He saw the gray car driving toward him desperately in the rearview mirror. That fellow planned to hit his car until he was stopped.","This was Ye Jian’s plan. She was even prepared to destroy this car. However, she didn’t expect that the car was actually a bulletproof car!","When the Western man heard his companion say that a car had appeared out of nowhere, he frowned and reminded his companion, “In China, if you can drive a bulletproof car, I heard that you have a high social status. Get rid of that person and don’t let them pester us anymore.”","They knew about China and even investigated how things worked in the society here. Hence, they knew that the Chinese police wouldn’t carry guns every day, let alone after work.","They chose the time when Zhou Niannian got off work and took action at night. They only started taking action after investigating in advance.","However, they didn’t expect Zhou Niannian to turn her sedan into a racing car.","Racing was Zhou Niannian’s hobby. When she was in junior high, she had raced with Zhou Huainan. Of course, she could only watch from the side.","When she reached senior high, Zhou Huainan brought her to a racing club in the capital city. In the first year of senior high, she started learning how to race systematically.","Now, there was a car that Zhou Huainan bought for her at the Formula F1 racing track in the capital city. When she had the time or when she was under a lot of pressure, she would either race a few rounds outside the capital city alone or go over with Zhou Huainan to compete with the friends in the club.","With her standards, she could participate in large-scale competitions.","At this moment, she was driving a sedan with broken wheels. After driving around the outermost auxiliary road of the industrial park, she suddenly reversed the car. The wheels rolled over the asphalt road at high speed, and the air smelled of rubber and asphalt..."]},{"number":4056,"title":"Chapter 4056: Tough","paragraphs":["Chapter 4056: Tough","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the car, Zhou Niannian, who had delicate facial features, pursed her lips tightly. She looked behind her calmly. Under the other party’s high beams, the car was driven like a snake that was dancing crazily. At the speed of light, the back of the car bumped into the other party’s car suicidally.","She had to drive back because she didn’t know what had happened to her colleague who had saved her earlier. Her brother had reminded her that working together was a better deterrent than fighting separately. They also had a higher chance of winning.","Most importantly, she couldn’t let anything happen to her colleague.","Zhou Niannian, who was worried that something would happen to her peers, had now engaged in a rescue mission. Her mentality had changed. At first, she only wanted to shake off the other party, but now, she was forcing him to stop.","She wasn’t afraid, but the other party didn’t dare to fight her like this.","...","He was just here to take care of a Chinese police officer. After taking care of her, he would immediately return to his country. He didn’t want to risk his life to fight with the Chinese police officer who seemed crazy.","Zhou Niannian smiled when she saw this.","It turned out that she cherished her life!","Zhou Niannian chased after the car in front and reversing while Ye Jian was attacking directly from behind. The four cars in the middle drove forward and backward. The sound of the motor startled the security officers in the industrial park. They ran over.","“What are you doing? Go elsewhere and race. This is an industrial park, not a place for racing. There are still workers getting off work. You’ll crash into them!”","The security officers didn’t run over. They knew that they couldn’t run over rashly, so they stood by the side of the road and shouted.","Who could hear them?","Ye Jian saw a car coming back from the front. Then, she saw the white sedan that was hit earlier coming back at the speed of light. A glint flashed past her eyes. The car drifted so much that the four wheels made a sharp and ear-piercing grinding sound.","On her side, she was moving forward in reverse. The wheels kept rubbing against the asphalt road. It was stable and agile, making the driver’s face turn darker and darker.","“Fred, I don’t think we can compete with the Chinese police anymore. We underestimated them! Damn it! What happened on your side? Why did you come back?”","The Western man in the car saw the front of the straight road. The taillights of the two cars were approaching from afar at an astonishing speed.","Fred, who was forced to reverse his car, replied to his companion, “Don’t be afraid of them. If they want to stop us, we can also hit them directly. I don’t believe that they’ll really dare to hit us unless they don’t want their lives anymore.”","The security officers, who were standing by the roadside and shouting, jumped in fright. They were so shocked that they hurriedly jumped a few steps behind the green belt with trees. These people were playing with their lives!","The flabbergasted security officers looked at the scene for a few seconds and felt that this was not something they could handle. One of them immediately ran back to the sentry box to call the police.","The skilled Zhou Niannian didn’t look like she was driving backward at all. Fred, who was forced to retreat, narrowed his eyes in anger. He said to his companion in a low voice, “We need to jump out of the car. The Chinese policewoman’s driving skills are very good. She looks like a professional racing driver!”","“F*ck! The person chasing me seems to be a professional racer too. Are all the Chinese police officers racers?” The Western man behind saw Fred’s car getting closer and closer to the car in front. He knew that it was time for them to abandon their cars.","The hand that was holding the gun reached out of the car window and shot at the street lamps in front.","Two low and muffled sounds were heard. It sounded like a thick piece of aluminum that was dented by the bullets and bounced back. Two street lamps were destroyed by him. Instantly, the side of the road in front fell into darkness."]},{"number":4057,"title":"Chapter 4057: Tactics","paragraphs":["Chapter 4057: Tactics","Editor: Henyee Translations","He planned to abandon the car and leave immediately. As for where the car would go, he didn’t care.","While Ye Jian and Zhou Niannian didn’t know who the other party was, they used the back of their cars to hit the front of the other party’s car to force the other party to stop.","Of course, it wasn’t a head-on collision. The impact of that would be too great, and both sides would suffer.","It was best to use a side wipe to make the other party’s car lose its balance.","Zhou Niannian had raced before and was bold. As for Ye Jian, she had undergone systematic training and had some background. This was the first time the two of them cooperated. They made the enemy who came to look for trouble attempt to break out of their encirclement.","...","Although the enemy knew that they had underestimated the Chinese police, they weren’t afraid. They had killed people before. If they were afraid, they wouldn’t have dared to attack the Chinese police.","Next, the two drivers would jump out of their cars and leave. Soon, they would leave this place. The Chinese police would not be able to find them at all.","Of course, it didn’t matter even if they were found. They were foreigners and weren’t restricted by the Chinese law. They would have a way to escape.","“All right, Fred! We’re ready to abandon the cars!”","The Western man, who was chased by Ye Jian until the end, opened the car door. After shouting, he pushed the steering wheel to the side with both hands. He released the seatbelt that was protecting him. Just as the car was about to rush into the darkness and jump out, Ye Jian stepped on the accelerator again and rushed over from the side. She used the back of the car to hit the front of his car.","Bang... Bang... Bang...","The collision between the two cars made a huge collision sound. After spinning a few times, the car hit the stone barrier between the road and the green belt. The entire car was upside down.","Zhou Niannian didn’t know that the car that was helping her would suddenly play such a powerful trick. When she saw that, she got excited and said to Zhou Huainan, “Brother, the person who came to help me is an expert. Before I could flip the car I’m targeting, they’ve already helped me take care of two cars.”","“Zhou Niannian, don’t embarrass our Zhou family.” After Zhou Huainan finished speaking, he said to the SWAT team that he had been on call with through the landline, “More than half of the danger on Zhou Niannian’s side has been lifted. The person who came to help her is an expert. They helped her overturn two cars.”","It had been half an hour since Zhou Niannian was targeted. The SWAT team that sent the police out had also been out for half an hour. Zhou Niannian was targeted half an hour after she drove out of the SWAT team’s base. It had been an hour. The colleagues from the SWAT team who had just turned from Nanning Road to Tongping Avenue would take around 15 minutes to rush over at their fastest speed.","Zhou Niannian still needed to persevere for 15 minutes.","Ye Jian, who knocked down another car, didn’t stop. Instead, she continued moving forward and approached the other car that was getting closer and closer to her.","Fred, who was in the car, had already seen his comrade’s car being overturned. Seeing this, a vicious look flashed past his eyes. He moved the steering wheel agilely and avoided the first collision. He was about to turn around and hit the car chasing from behind. He thought that he could do it. Unexpectedly, the car behind suddenly swung its tail and turned its head. The back of the car reversed toward him...","Now, it was Zhou Niannian’s turn to reverse the car. Ye Jian was the one behind.","Zhou Niannian, who knew how to race, was good at driving, but she didn’t have Ye Jian’s ruthlessness. She just wanted to force the car into a tree so that the other party wouldn’t be able to drive it out. Even without a car, the other party still had a gun."]},{"number":4058,"title":"Chapter 4058: Hit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4058: Hit","Editor: Henyee Translations","Fred could tell who was weaker. He, who was about to be forced by the two cars, reached out his hand and fired two shots at the back of Zhou Niannian’s car.","Swish... Swish...","The first shot shattered the windshield at the back of Zhou Niannian’s car. Some of the glass shards fell to the back seat while others rolled down the back of the car and onto the road.","Zhou Niannian, who reacted quickly, immediately bent her back, but there was a bloody wound on the back of her head caused by the slag of the glass.","When the second bullet was fired, Zhou Niannian’s expression darkened slightly. She immediately tightened her grasp on the steering wheel and avoided the second bullet. However, the speed of the car didn’t decrease. When the two cars collided, Zhou Niannian swung the back of the car again. As her car was thrown out, the other car was also thrown out.","...","She braked, opened the car door, and squatted down. Zhou Niannian’s entire set of actions was completed very smoothly.","Seeing this, Ye Jian didn’t go over anymore. Instead, she immediately reversed the car and retreated. She was worried that the criminal in the car that she knocked over would escape.","After the car was parked, Ye Jian opened the car door and was about to go over when she seemed to have discovered something. She instinctively knelt on one knee beside the front wheel.","A pair of legs flashed past the window of the overturned car.","The car had been turned upside down, but it didn’t trap the driver. The driver who had shot bullets with his gun climbed out of the car.","The other party had a gun, but she didn’t have a gun...","Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly. Then, she climbed back into the car and picked up the soldier’s cap that she had placed on the passenger seat. Now, she needed to lure the enemy to shoot and determine their current location.","She took out her belt and tied it into a knot with the number ‘8’. Then, she placed her military cap on it. It would slowly stick out from the front of the car before quickly retracting.","The distance between her and the crashed car was too close. The distance between the two cars was at most two meters. If she hadn’t noticed the pair of feet going past the car window just now, she would have been plotted against.","Taking a deep breath, Ye Jian slowly stuck out her military cap again... In an instant, she heard the sound of bullets shooting out of the silencer. The bullets cut through the air and hit the soldier’s cap.","Ye Jian had already thrown her soldier’s cap to the side. She determined that the other party was also hiding at the front of the car. She rushed past the back of the car. When the other party finished shooting, she retracted her pistol and adjusted it. Then, she rushed toward the back of the other party’s car at an astonishing speed.","She ran first and then rolled continuously. As she rolled, she heard the sound of fighting in front of her, accompanied by a woman’s low and cold shout.","After a few rolls, Ye Jian finally reached the back of the car. She looked up and saw the back of a man. A cold glint flashed past Ye Jian’s black eyes. She needed to get close to him now.","However, she didn’t know how many bullets he had left. If she approached the other party from the back, she needed to be wary of him suddenly turning around and shooting at her.","She had to get close to the other party. Now that she was here, she had to get close and restrain him.","Ye Jian turned her back to the back of the car and exhaled softly. She touched the ground with her hands and grabbed a handful of broken glass fragments.","Slowly, she chose to approach the man from behind. Before the man could turn around, Ye Jian threw the glass fragments in her hand at his back...","Instead of worrying that he would suddenly turn around, it was better that she knew when he would turn around.","The man who was suddenly attacked from behind suddenly turned around and fired without stopping."]},{"number":4059,"title":"Chapter 4059: Barehanded","paragraphs":["Chapter 4059: Barehanded","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian had already rushed over. Her entire action was like a tiger coming down the mountain. She restrained the other party’s hand that was holding the gun.","Swoosh!","The bullets shot into the sky, completely deviating from the trajectory that the man with the gun wanted to shoot out.","The Western man’s expression turned especially fierce when he didn’t succeed. He realized that... the person fighting with him was another woman.","Another Chinese policewoman?","...","Were the Chinese policewomen better than the Chinese male police?","“F*ck!” The Western man was embarrassed and angry as he cursed. This was not an easy Western man to deal with. His hand was restrained by Ye Jian, but he had already raised one leg to kick Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t dodge. She didn’t release her grip on the other party’s wrist either. Instead, she twisted his wrist and raised her leg to kick him.","Now that it was a close combat, she was even more confident.","The man whose wrist was twisted by Ye Jian couldn’t help but feel pain. He wanted to hold the gun tightly, but Ye Jian wouldn’t give him a chance to hold the gun again. She loosened her grip on his wrist. After a clicking sound, the magazine on the pistol was unloaded by Ye Jian.","Since the company magazine was unloaded, the pistol lost its power.","When the Western man who participated in Zhou Niannian’s attempted murder saw this, he simply threw the pistol to the side. He clenched his fists and jumped slightly on the spot. He arched his back slightly and started kicking.","The momentum was turbulent. He kicked continuously and punched with both fists. Ye Jian had no choice but to dodge continuously.","This was a Western man who had learned close combat and had good skills.","Although she didn’t see the other party’s face clearly, Ye Jian could tell that he was a Western man from his size.","This foreigner arrived in China but didn’t abide by the Chinese laws on gun and ammunition management. He even opened fire on the road and attempted murder. He ignored the laws of China so blatantly. If they let him escape today, it would only fuel his arrogance.","Ye Jian couldn’t let him escape. She had to teach him a lesson!","After using her arms to block the other party’s kicks and fists, Ye Jian took a few steps back and shook her arms that were in pain. It was her turn next!","He was bare-handed, but Ye Jian had no intention of being his equal.","The most effective killing move was to kill the enemy as soon as possible. Every special forces soldier in the Xueyu unit knew this. She did not have the luxury of time to keep punching him. As long as she could kill him immediately, she would.","She moved her right hand slightly and removed the silver wire that she had been wearing on her left wrist for the past few days.","The Western man didn’t notice Ye Jian’s actions. He only knew that his failure to kill the other Chinese policewoman had a lot to do with this... Chinese policewoman in front of him.","He also knew that his continuous combat attacks just now had forced this Chinese policewoman to the point where she couldn’t retaliate.","Killing this Chinese policewoman was the same as killing both Chinese policewomen. Killing intent flashed across the eyes of the Western man who came to China to kill.","Two of the street lamps were broken, and they were in the dark. Only the street lamps on the other side of the road shone faintly. Ye Jian, who was wearing a student’s military uniform, stood in the dark. Her olive military uniform had turned black too. This Western man mistook her for a policewoman."]},{"number":4060,"title":"Chapter 4060: Suffer","paragraphs":["Chapter 4060: Suffer","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian didn’t see the enemy’s face clearly, but she could clearly feel the killing intent from the other party.","He wanted to kill her?","That would depend on whether he had the ability or not!","Ye Jian, who had retreated, shrugged her shoulders. At the same time, she unbuttoned her military uniform. The military uniform was a slim fit. It wasn’t convenient for her to make large movements. Also, she didn’t want her military uniform to get dirty during a fight. It was best to take it off.","The man took off his jacket and placed it on the green belt. He could vaguely see her actions and sneered. He deliberately humiliated her, saying, “Take off all your clothes and I think you might still have a chance to beat me.”","...","Ye Jian shook her hand. There was killing intent in her eyes too. She didn’t waste her breath on such a person. ‘Stop talking nonsense! Don’t you know that the more you talk, the faster you’ll die?’","The man, who was around 1.84 meters tall, attacked again. His legs were very long. He raised his leg and kicked over like before. Ye Jian could feel that he was very strong. After Ye Jian used her arm to block him, the silver wire in her hand had already wrapped around his ankle.","When the other party kicked with one leg continuously, Ye Jian wrapped her arms around him twice and stopped blocking with her arms. Instead, she instantly changed from the passive side to the main attacker.","She had never been afraid of close combat. She would always fight until the other party lay on the ground.","She instantly grabbed the other party’s ankle with both hands. At the same time, she raised her right leg and kicked the other party’s knee. Knees and calf bones were places where the pain was concentrated. As long as she kicked these spots, it would hurt.","If she kicked his knee, she could break his calf.","The man, who thought that he would win, was caught off guard by Ye Jian’s kick. The pain felt like a car had run over his right leg. He couldn’t stand on two feet at all. He gasped in pain and jumped back on one leg.","This pain was the pain of having one’s leg broken.","He wanted to jump back on one leg, but just as he took a step back, his left ankle seemed to be strangled by something invisible. In pain, he lost his balance and retreated in a flurry. His right leg couldn’t stand properly either. In addition, Ye Jian pulled the silver wire around his leg tightly. The Western man, who thought that he could kill another Chinese policewoman a second ago, fell heavily.","He was too tall. If he fell, it would hurt so much that he wouldn’t be able to get up for a long time.","Ye Jian didn’t give the person who wanted to kill her a chance to get up. She jumped up and used her right leg to hit the person’s chest.","This strike made the man, who had yet to get up, feel as if a huge rock had hit his chest. His head and legs were raised, and his chest was pressed down. At that moment, the man, who had been very confident in killing the Chinese policewoman, felt his vision turn black.","The Western man, whose vision was turning black, had already been subdued by Ye Jian. The silver wire wrapped around his ankle was pulled inward forcefully. The man, who was in so much pain but had been enduring it, was forced to press the heel of his right leg against the base of his inner thigh. He couldn’t help but scream.","“Ah... F*ck! F*ck! Son of a b*tch, let go of me!”","His scream was accompanied by insulting curses. When Ye Jian heard this, her expression turned dark. She exerted more force with the silver wire and buckled his right leg even tighter. Then, she wrapped the silver wire around the other party’s neck and tied it from his armpits to his back... She tied the other party into an extremely strange position.","Trying to escape? Ha, give it a try!"]},{"number":4061,"title":"Chapter 4061: Double Stick","paragraphs":["Chapter 4061: Double Stick","Editor: Henyee Translations","The man’s insults didn’t anger Ye Jian. She just grabbed a few handfuls of grass and stuffed them into the man’s mouth.","Since he didn’t know how to speak, he must have grown up eating grass. He should eat more grass. Ye Jian wanted to see if that could shut his mouth.","As expected, his mouth was blocked. The other party’s eyes were burning with anger as if he had suffered a huge humiliation.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but say coldly, “Even if I kill you now, no one will say that I shouldn’t kill people. On the contrary, everyone will think that I did the right thing.","“If you don’t want to die in my hands, you’d better shut up.”","...","She spoke coldly. One could tell that she was not lying.","Based on what this person had done, she had enough reason to kill him. Moreover, she would definitely not be restricted by the law!","In China, there was only one kind of person who could be killed by the Chinese police, the SWAT team, and armed police—those who hurt others with weapons. This man belonged to the category of people who hurt people with weapons, and it was the most serious category.","Ye Jian’s words didn’t scare the man. He wasn’t easy to scare. The man, who was still spitting out the grass in his mouth angrily, heard that and wanted to curse loudly again. Ye Jian, who was already prepared, stuffed another mouthful of grass into his mouth.","Since he didn’t know how to speak, he should just eat the grass obediently.","The fight in front hadn’t ended. Ye Jian stood up with a cold look in her eyes. She didn’t look at the Western man who couldn’t escape. She ran forward.","The distance wasn’t far. It was only about 30 meters. After running closer, Ye Jian recognized the woman who was fighting with another Western man. It was Zhou Niannian, the SWAT officer officer she met in the hospital a few days ago.","Her skills were not bad. She kicked the Western man’s chest hard, causing him to take a few steps back.","However, the dagger in the other party’s hand also slashed across Zhou Niannian’s leg. The sharp tip of the dagger cut through her pants, leaving a bloody wound on Zhou Niannian’s calf.","Zhou Niannian wasn’t afraid of the dagger in the other party’s hand. When she heard the footsteps behind her, she raised her voice and said, “Colleague, do me a favor. I have nunchucks in my car. Please help me get it. Thank you.","“Leave this to me. Please help me look after the other criminal.”","Nunchucks? Zhou Niannian?","Ye Jian naturally knew about nunchucks, but she had never seen anyone using it. She wanted to rush over and kill the Western man with Zhou Niannian, but she stopped in her tracks. Ye Jian changed her mind and went to the car to get the nunchucks for Zhou Niannian.","She hadn’t seen anyone using nunchucks in real life. She might as well take this opportunity to take a look.","Also...","Just now, she suddenly remembered where she had heard the name ‘Zhou Niannian’. That night, she had been too sad when she heard Zhou Niannian’s name due to Uncle Chen’s passing. She didn’t think too much about it and didn’t realize that she had heard it before.","Zhou Niannian now asked her to help her get the nunchucks. In an instant, Ye Jian remembered the nunchucks her grandpa once mentioned!","“Your brother is really a block of wood. Your Uncle Fu and I tried our best to keep Zhou Niannian around for longer. I even asked her to bring the nunchucks next time and let me take a look, but your brother didn’t give a reaction. My little princess, I’m so angry that I can’t sleep!”"]},{"number":4062,"title":"Chapter 4062: Amazing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4062: Amazing","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Niannian, nunchucks... The first woman who Ye Jian’s cousin brought back home was the SWAT officer who knew how to use nunchucks, Zhou Niannian. The two of them even had a small misunderstanding. Zhou Niannian had mistaken her cousin for a dangerous person and followed him to Dan Gui Garden. Then, Ye Jian’s grandpa felt that Zhou Niannian was not bad and wanted Li Jinnian to woo her.","Unexpectedly, Cousin didn’t take it to heart. He didn’t even get Zhou Niannian’s number. That was why Grandpa was so angry that he couldn’t sleep.","At that time, Ye Jian even told her grandpa that she would definitely meet the female SWAT officer that her grandpa praised so much. She didn’t expect to meet her so soon.","She didn’t recognize her the first time they met. Fortunately, she recognized her the second time.","Due to Old Master Fu’s satisfaction, Ye Jian had been curious about Zhou Niannian.","...","Regardless of whether her cousin had a good impression of Zhou Niannian or not, she was curious about her.","Opening the car door, Ye Jian found the nunchucks on the cushion under the passenger seat. It was very heavy and made of steel. Ye Jian didn’t know how to use it. She couldn’t help but swing it twice in her hand. She realized that it was quite practical. It should hurt for a long time if someone was hit by this weapon.","She ran over with the nunchucks. Zhou Niannian and the Western man with the dagger in his hand were still fighting.","The Western man with the dagger stabbed horizontally, side-stabbed, and slashed... The dagger was very agile in his hand. Zhou Niannian dodged left and right, blocking with her palms. She avoided the other party’s dagger a few times.","She couldn’t tell that her calf was injured. Ye Jian couldn’t tell either. She only noticed that as a SWAT officer, Zhou Niannian’s combat skills were indeed not bad.","She had come into contact with female soldiers and female police officers. However, Zhou Niannian was the first female officer she came into contact with who was quite skilled. It was so exciting that she wanted to clap and cheer.","The SWAT team was mainly focused on counter-terrorism, capturing criminals with powerful firepower, hostage interpretation, drug control, and domestic clean-up operations. They were the special forces armed system of the non-military department and mainly focused on domestic combat.","Attack, support, sniping, destruction, blockade, combat... As a SWAT officer, Zhou Niannian had to master all kinds of tactics. As a SWAT officer, Zhou Niannian knew what the male SWAT officers knew too. She was not bad either. If not, she wouldn’t have become the only female SWAT officer in the SWAT team.","Perhaps it was because they were both women, but Ye Jian felt that she could connect with Zhou Niannian after seeing her tough combat. Especially when Zhou Niannian shouted coldly, “Give me the nunchucks.” Her voice was so cold that it was like ice shattering. Ye Jian’s curiosity exploded.","She also understood why her grandpa said that if Ye Jian saw Zhou Niannian, the two of them would definitely become good friends.","Her grandpa was wise and mighty!","She wanted to befriend Zhou Niannian now. However, she didn’t know if Zhou Niannian would want to befriend her.","“Catch!”","Ye Jian threw the nunchucks out. After completing a roundhouse kick, Zhou Niannian reached into the air with one hand and caught it firmly.","With the nunchucks, she was like a tiger that had grown wings. She could use both the gun and the nunchucks!","Nunchucks were liked by people. It was mostly because of this weapon’s agility that people could turn nunchucks into the most advantageous weapons in their hands. The nunchucks would only hit the enemy and not hurt them.","Zhou Niannian was a SWAT officer who knew how to use nunchucks. At this moment, she had already disregarded the dagger in the other party’s hand. She shouted in a low voice, “I’ve been tolerating you for a long time.” The nunchucks in her hand turned into afterimages as she hit the Western man’s arm again and again."]},{"number":4063,"title":"Chapter 4063: Dare To Try Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4063: Dare To Try Again","Editor: Henyee Translations","The first thing Zhou Niannian did when she had an offensive weapon in her hand was to twist the dagger in the other party’s hand and send it flying. From dodging passively just now, she took the initiative to attack. The chain in the middle of the nunchucks instantly locked the other party’s dagger. Then, she twisted the two parts of the nunchucks together and sent the extremely sharp dagger flying.","The dagger slashed across the cold light under the street lamp. It drew an arc in the air and finally fell to the side of the road with a clang.","Ye Jian glanced at it and walked over to pick up the dagger.","The self-defense weapon she had on her now was the silver string. She would use this dagger as her self-defense weapon for the time being.","She wasn’t afraid of leaving her fingerprints. She just held it in her hand for the time being.","...","Zhou Niannian’s power exploded. She kept hitting her opponent’s arms. Ye Jian could hear the muffled sound of bones being hit. She felt her arms hurting too.","Although the other party didn’t scream because of the pain, Ye Jian knew that he was in pain.","How could it not hurt?","Zhou Niannian, who was filled with anger, wanted to beat him up badly. Besides not hitting the other party’s head, there was no other body part that she didn’t hit.","“Grandpa, you have a good eye for heroes. Zhou Niannian is quite impressive... Even if she can’t be Cousin’s girlfriend, I want to be friends with her. She’s amazing!”","Ye Jian was amazed when she saw Zhou Niannian hitting the Western man who had attacked with all his might just now when he still had a dagger in his hand.","She had met and fought women who knew how to fight, but... she had never met them in the country. It should be said that Ye Jian had never met one around her.","Now that she had met someone, Ye Jian wanted to befriend her even more.","Zhou Niannian only knew that the person helping her was a woman, but she didn’t recognize that it was Ye Jian. Now, she only knew that she had to beat up this fellow who dared to hurt people with guns in China until his arrogance disappeared!","Gosh!","Did he think the Chinese police were here just for show?","The Western man, Fred, had already been beaten until his legs and arms were in pain. When he raised his leg again and swept it over, Zhou Niannian dodged sideways and hit his calf again. When he retracted his leg, his entire leg was numb.","“Arrogant, huh? Come, try again!”","Zhou Niannian pulled the nunchucks tightly with both hands. Under the street lamp, the nunchucks emitted a terrifying cold light. The cold light flashed past Zhou Niannian’s eyes, making this lively and cheerful female SWAT officer have a vicious aura that would scare criminals.","She didn’t speak English and spoke in the capital city dialect. Her cold tone was a little lazy. Ye Jian’s smile got deeper.","She really looked forward to becoming friends with Zhou Niannian.","Fred, whose hands and legs were in pain from the beating, wanted to withdraw. He gently shook his right leg that had been hit hard just now and looked around.","From the corner of his eyes, he saw his companion lying motionless in the middle of the road, shrouded by the street lamps. Fred’s heart sank.","He wasn’t even moving. Had that Chinese policewoman taken care of him?","In fact, that guy wasn’t going to be finished off. He just couldn’t move. If he moved, the silver wire would tighten around his neck. The more he moved, the tighter it would be. The Western man who was subdued by Ye Jian didn’t dare to move at all.","He only hoped that everything would end quickly!","Fred didn’t know if his companion was dead or alive, but he knew that he had to retreat."]},{"number":4064,"title":"Chapter 4064: Must Be Handsome","paragraphs":["Chapter 4064: Must Be Handsome","Editor: Henyee Translations","Fred didn’t do anything. He just glanced at the Chinese policewoman beside him. Then, he looked at the left side where no one was guarding. Fred was about to retreat to the left when he heard the Chinese policewoman say to him coldly, “Do you want to escape from the left? You won’t be able to escape tonight.”","Ye Jian saw through his intention and said in English with a faint smile, “You threatened the lives of our people with a gun and broke the laws of our country. Do you think we’ll let you escape from the event location?","“Do you think that the law enforcement officers in our country are all rag dolls that can be trampled on?”","When Ye Jian opened her mouth, Zhou Niannian blinked. Huh?","This voice, this person... Zhou Niannian blinked and widened her eyes. Wasn’t this the Ye Jian? She had forgotten to get Ye Jian’s phone number and regretted it!","...","In other words, Ye Jian was the one who had been helping her all along!","There was a smile in Zhou Niannian’s eyes. However, before the smile could reach her eyes, it dimmed a little. It was all because of her that Ye Jian lost a relative.","Although Ye Jian said that the responsibility wasn’t hers, she was in charge of the safety of the train station. Officer Lu had also said that the responsibility wasn’t hers, but she couldn’t get over it.","Ye Jian helped her escape danger tonight. Alas, she didn’t know how to thank Ye Jian.","Zhou Niannian pursed her lips. Soon, she restrained all the complicated emotions in her heart. Now, she wasn’t thinking about anything else. She just needed to capture this fellow in front of her who had nowhere to run and bring him back to the police station for interrogation.","There was no way he could escape!","Fred, who wanted to run away, was furious. The moment he thought about it, it seemed that everything was exposed before he could do anything. It looked like the two policewomen were insisting on catching him.","Fred knew that their plan had failed completely!","Since he couldn’t escape, he would...","Fred, who wanted to retreat, changed his target and targeted Ye Jian. If he couldn’t escape, he could only take a hostage and leave this place!","Yes, he wanted to kidnap the special forces female soldier, Ye Jian. She was even more powerful than Zhou Niannian.","Ye Jian wanted to laugh when she saw this.","Did he really think that she was easy to bully?","He couldn’t beat Zhou Niannian, so he targeted her?","Then she wouldn’t be polite!","When Zhou Niannian saw this, she shouted, “Be careful!” She immediately pounced over. She was afraid that the other party would hurt Ye Jian.","However, soon, her eyes widened.","Because...","The tall and big fellow rushed over. Then, he saw Ye Jian running and stepping on the wheels of the overturned car. He saw Ye Jian flying into the air and swinging her straight leg horizontally with extreme sharpness and ruthlessness. She used the back of her foot to sweep the man’s face.","Bang!","Fred, whose head was swept away, fell to the ground instantly. He didn’t even have time to slow down before he was kicked down by Ye Jian.","Ye Jian landed on the ground with her legs slightly spread apart. She shook hands one after another. Her sharp gaze swept past the Western man who would definitely have a concussion.","If she was not wrong, this fellow probably wanted to take her as a hostage and force Zhou Niannian to let him go.","Unfortunately, he miscalculated!","Zhou Niannian was shocked. She was shocked by Ye Jian’s awesome sideways strike.","Ye Jian... Ye Jian!","How powerful!","She was simply too cook! She was so cool that Zhou Niannian instantly forgot about Zhou Huainian, who used to occupy the number one spot in her heart. Ye Jian became the number one in her heart!"]},{"number":4065,"title":"Chapter 4065: Amazing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4065: Amazing","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Niannian, who was standing at the side, focused all her attention on Ye Jian. The light in her eyes was like the stars in the sky. She stared at Ye Jian without blinking. When she saw Ye Jian retract her leg and walk toward her, she still hadn’t come back to her senses.","Ye Jian stood in front of Zhou Niannian and saw the bright and clear eyes of the young and beautiful woman. She saw her reflection in her eyes and the shock in them.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but purse her lips and smile. She waved her hand in front of Zhou Niannian and smiled. “Are you okay? I called the police just now. Your colleagues should be here soon. Do you have handcuffs?","“Cuff him so that he won’t escape. He wanted to escape just now, but he overestimated himself.”","Ye Jian’s clear voice brought Zhou Niannian back to her senses. She looked at the man who was lying on the ground and couldn’t get up at all. Then, she looked at Ye Jian and stretched out her hand to give her a thumbs-up. She didn’t retract the shock on her face as she praised, “Amazing, amazing, amazing! What I saw just now has completely shocked me for life.”","...","Zhou Niannian was a straightforward woman from the capital city. She was neither shy nor pretentious. Now that she had kicked her brother out of her heart, she was full of admiration for Ye Jian.","She was impressed. She was really impressed.","It couldn’t be helped. This was the first time she saw a woman who could fight so well. She thought that she was one of the best, but compared to Ye Jian, she was too weak.","Even laymen could tell that she was an expert. Moreover, Zhou Niannian was not a layman.","Ye Jian’s skills were all killing moves that would definitely take other people’s lives. She didn’t put on airs and didn’t have any intention of scaring people. Every move she made was filled with killing intent. Even now, Zhou Niannian could still feel a trace of killing intent from her.","Her brother always said that she didn’t have much experience. Even though she was a SWAT officer now, she was still just an entry-level SWAT officer. She hadn’t done many big cases and had only escaped death a few times. If she hadn’t stepped on a few hot bloods, she wouldn’t be a real SWAT officer.","Now, she vaguely understood what her brother meant.","Ye Jian, who was in front of her, should be a female soldier who had experienced a lot of bloodlust. Although she was just a student, the killing intent on her body told Zhou Niannian that she was a female student who had experienced big things.","Ye Jian liked the pureness in Zhou Niannian’s eyes. It was a pureness that could be seen clearly.","Hearing that, she smiled and gave Zhou Niannian a thumbs-up as well. She praised, “You’re also the best female SWAT officer I’ve ever seen. Impressive, impressive, impressive.”","“Do we need to compliment each other?” Zhou Niannian smiled, showing her white teeth. When she smiled, her delicate face looked brighter. Her smile was so bright, and her eyes were bright as well. Zhou Niannian made Ye Jian have a deeper impression of her.","With some people, you didn’t need to interact with them for long to become friends. A few minutes of eye contact, a few minutes of working together, and a few minutes of conversation, Ye Jian knew in her heart that this was a friend worth making.","Zhou Niannian was a friend worth making to Ye Jian.","Zhou Niannian thought the same way about Ye Jian."]},{"number":4066,"title":"Chapter 4066: Tough","paragraphs":["Chapter 4066: Tough","Editor: Henyee Translations","The two young and capable women stood under the dim street lamp that wasn’t very bright, but they could see the sincerity in each other’s eyes. They looked at each other and smiled. Their eyes were bright, their teeth were white, and their smiles were clear. In the future, their friendship would be like wine. The more time passed, the more mellow it would become.","Zhou Niannian’s personality was completely different from Ye Jian’s. The former had a lively personality. Even when handling matters, she was energetic. She was like a shining object that would never lose its source of light.","You would never have to worry that she would lose her source of light one day. You would only worry what if the source of light were to leave one day. In that case, there would only be endless darkness.","As for Ye Jian, her personality was as gentle as the mountains and rivers. She looked gentle and reserved, but in fact, she was secretly stubborn and would not give in easily.","She wasn’t a glowing person, but she could make people feel the power coming from her. It was a power that contained her ‘hope’.","...","Zhou Niannian half-squatted down and looked at the Western man who was kicked to the ground by Ye Jian. He hadn’t stood up yet. She wondered if he had seen God because of Ye Jian’s kick. She was afraid that the Western man had really seen God. She hurriedly rolled back his eyelids...","Fortunately, his pupils hadn’t rolled back. Then, she checked the aorta on his neck. There was a pulse too. It looked like he had just fainted.","Well, it couldn’t be said that he fainted very commonly. He definitely had a concussion.","“Don’t worry, he won’t die. I only used 30% of my strength. I was afraid that if I really kicked him until he saw God, you wouldn’t be able to interrogate him.”","Ye Jian half-squatted down and smiled at Zhou Niannian as she finished speaking. She started checking the man’s body familiarly...","There was nothing in his clothes. He didn’t even have a passport to prove his identity.","“These people were basically smuggled here. They wouldn’t bring their passports.” Zhou Niannian saw that Ye Jian was about to rummage through the pockets of the Western men. She smiled and said, “We won’t be able to find anything on them. We can only take their photos and enter the database to look for traces.”","After she finished speaking, her expression became a little serious. “What I don’t understand is that although our Zhou family has many enemies and those enemies who want to kill us aren’t from your average families, it’s a little strange this time. Why did they send a few foreigners to kill me?","“The starting point is also very strange. I can understand if they had shot and attempted to kill my father. After all, my father has fought against too many bad people. I can understand if they had wanted to kill my mother too. After all, the lawyers hired by bad people would all lose to my mother in the end.","“I can understand if they wanted to kill my cousin. He’s the same as my father. Too many bad people have fallen into his hands. Hence, I can understand if they wanted to kill my father, mother, and my cousin... But I can’t understand why they wanted to kill me.","“Don’t tell me they just want to mess with the easiest target? That can’t be. Killing me is meaningless to those bad people who do bad things in the underworld. I’ve just entered the industry not long ago and haven’t even encountered a big case. Why would anyone want to kill me?”","Ye Jian could already sense sweat forming on her back.","The Zhou family’s enemies weren’t from average families. There were many bad people who wanted to kill the Zhou family. If... they wanted to kill Zhou Niannian’s father, mother, and brother, that would be understandable. However, why did they want to kill... Zhou Niannian.","‘Grandpa, the woman you like is very tough!’"]},{"number":4067,"title":"Chapter 4067: Just Right","paragraphs":["Chapter 4067: Just Right","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Niannian didn’t see Ye Jian silently wiping her forehead. Squatting down, she racked her brain until the police siren, which aroused respect in the hearts of the people, rang out. Yet, she couldn’t figure out the reason for the car accident.","As the siren sounded, Zhou Niannian stood up and reached out to help up Ye Jian, who was squatting next to her. Little did she know that Ye Jian also got up, simultaneously extending her arm, meaning to pull Zhou Niannian up. Both girls reached out at the same time, and upon seeing this, couldn’t help but laugh.","It seemed they both had a habit of taking care of others in their lives.","The Western male suspect, bound by Ye Jian in such a way he couldn’t move, didn’t show panic at the sound of the siren but rather a sense of relief.","Finally, he wouldn’t have to be tied up like this anymore!","...","The SWAT team officers arrived in their vehicles, one stopping behind to block off, another continuing forward to stop in front of the car flipped over by Ye Jian, and one parked at the side between the two patrol cars, forming a triangular alert position.","Fully armed military police descended from the car, guns in hand. The first officer out approached the motionless man, glanced at his leg twisted out of shape from the bindings, and frowned instantly, “A foreigner? Why is Zhou Niannian being chased down by a foreigner?”","Mrs. Qin’s heart tightened. This was the first time she saw her son, who had always been gentle and elegant, reveal a cold side to her. Although she was a little flustered, her domineering personality didn’t let her take a step back because of her panic.","Hearing this, she smiled coldly, and her gaze turned sharper. “I’m just concerned about you. I didn’t expect you to lie to me.”","At this moment, Qin Xiu felt extremely tired.","He said in a very calm voice, “Mom, you’ve already forced my sister away. Are you trying to force me away now? Fine. I’ll do as you wish. I’ll disappear from your sight within a week. This way, you don’t have to worry about us anymore. You don’t have to be angry at us anymore. You won’t have a headache either.","“If you force your two unfilial children away, you’ll live a better and happier life!”","His calm voice made people’s hearts tremble. Mrs. Qin panicked, but more than that, she was angry.","If she weren’t in the hospital, Mrs. Qin would have reprimanded him furiously. She wouldn’t be like this now. She was clearly furious, but in order to maintain her elegant image, she had to endure her trembling. “Qin Xiu, what’s with your attitude?”","“My attitude is to tell you that you don’t have to worry about me in the future. It’s late. Go back early. I still have things to settle.”","“You have something to deal with? You want to buy an expensive dress for that woman? Qin Xiu, when did you become a man who only looks at appearance and not inner qualities? You’ve disappointed me!”","Qin Xiu’s handsome face, which was so elegant that it looked like it was carved from fine white jade, became fierce when he heard this. He stopped in his tracks and turned around. He looked at Mrs. Qin calmly like before. “Mom, you like Madam Li’s daughter very much. You think that she’s virtuous and capable and can manage the family well, right?","“Mom, why don’t you ask the friends around Madam Li’s daughter if Miss Du is a virtuous and capable person?”","“They’re all young ladies. Young ladies are narrow-minded and don’t know how to speak properly. What’s there to ask? Madam Li gave birth to two children. Both of them are promising, and their characters are naturally good...”","Qin Xiu didn’t want to listen anymore. He smiled lightly. “Why don’t you acknowledge a godson and marry the good Miss Du to him?”","When he smiled, pain and resignation appeared on his face.","He finally understood why his sister didn’t come home for so many years. She didn’t even want to talk to Mrs. Qin on the phone. He finally understood. It was time for him to escape.","“Mom, I’ve disappointed you, and you’ve made me very tired. Goodbye, Mom.” Qin Xiu smiled. It was a tired smile. He turned around and left after seeing Mrs. Qin’s dumbfounded expression.","“Qin Xiu! Qin Xiu! Stop right there!”","Zhou Niannian glanced at the two figures coming toward them and said to Ye Jian, “The one on the left is my Captain, and the one on the right is my colleague.”","Ye Jian looked around at the suddenly heavily guarded area and said to Zhou Niannian, “I need to catch the early flight tomorrow. I’ll leave in a moment; I can’t go back with you guys to the SWAT team to file a report.”","“Your car is wrecked like that, if you don’t go back with us, how are we supposed to get it fixed for you?” The main concern for Zhou Niannian was... how to get Ye Jian’s car repaired.","Ye Jian glanced at the sedan she had crashed into, becoming distorted in the front, and also felt troubled.","The car belonged to the guard platoon, and she had smashed it into this condition, which was indeed difficult to explain to the guard platoon.","But with the car’s special modifications, handing it over to the SWAT team for repairs... didn’t seem quite right either. She had to ask somebody first.","Who to ask?","After thinking for a bit, Ye Jian said to Zhou Niannian, “I’ll make a call and ask. This car, probably has another place for repairs, and won’t be going to the SWAT team.”"]},{"number":4068,"title":"Chapter 4068: Better Than You?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4068: Better Than You?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing that Zhou Niannian’s captain and her colleague were approaching, Ye Jian pointed to the other side of the road. “I’ll go over there and make a call. You can talk to them first.”","She needed to contact Major General Yang and see if he had any good suggestions.","Ye Jian went to the other side of the road to contact Major General Yang. The captain of the SWAT team glanced at the slender figure walking past him. He glanced at the pants that the figure was wearing and narrowed his sharp eyes.","Zhou Huainan had told him that Zhou Niannian had a colleague helping her, but he didn’t say that it was a female. Now that he looked at her, it wasn’t a colleague at all. Her pants were part of a military uniform.","The people in the military unit were not from the police force.","...","The SWAT colleague who came with an assault rifle looked at the Westerner who had his eyes closed. He teased Zhou Niannian, “You’re capable. Even the foreigners took action against you.”","“If I was capable, I would’ve shot them in the head long ago,” Zhou Niannian replied to her colleague regretfully.","“You’re quite capable. We haven’t been chased by foreigners with guns. You’ve only been in the team for less than a month, but you’re already being chased by foreigners with guns. You’ve broken our team’s record,” the captain teased her too. “Look at you standing so well. One look and I can tell that you’re not injured. Not bad, you did a good job.”","The captain didn’t show any concern. They had encountered too many things like this. It was all normal. There was no need to specially show concern to Zhou Niannian. It was fine as long as she could stand properly without holes in their bodies.","“Now that you mention it, I do feel that I’m quite capable.” Zhou Niannian smiled. “I was surrounded by three cars and almost died. Fortunately...”","She pointed at Ye Jian and praised her, “It’s all thanks to her. I feel that even if she was attacked by three cars alone, she’d be able to take down everyone without anyone’s help.","“Look, this fellow was kicked in the head by her. He fainted before he could make a sound. When I saw it, my jaw fell to the ground.”","“Better than you?” The captain squatted down and grabbed the criminal’s chin with one hand. He tilted his head and looked up at Zhou Niannian. “He fainted from a kick and has a concussion.”","“So what if he has a concussion? We’re already showing mercy by not killing the two of them.”","Zhou Niannian wasn’t worried about taking any responsibility. She frowned and said to her captain, “These two people are foreigners. I don’t understand why they want to kill me.”","“It’s normal that they want to kill you. Your brother told me that you’re the weakest in your family. If they don’t target you, who should they target?”","The captain smiled. It was a dangerous matter, but to them, it was a small problem.","As long as Zhou Niannian was alive, everything else was a small matter to them.","Zhou Huainian had insulted Zhou Niannian with just one sentence. Her delicate eyebrows furrowed even tighter. “I feel that this isn’t simple. We need to pry open their mouths.”","“As long as they’re alive, it’s only a matter of time before we pry their mouths open. Ask that female comrade to come over. We’ll ask a few questions as usual.”","When Zhou Niannian heard this, she immediately waved her hand. “Let’s not do that, Captain...” She gestured for the captain to speak at the side and walked over. Then, she whispered, “She’s a military school student. Her family background is quite big. There’s definitely no problem with her. Let’s not ask her anything. If she hadn’t intervened tonight, I’m not sure if I could’ve even survived.","“Also, she needs to catch a flight back to her school tomorrow morning. After she finishes her call, you can let her go.”"]},{"number":4069,"title":"Chapter 4069: Fate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4069: Fate","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Niannian felt that since Ye Jian had specially told her that it was inconvenient for her, she had to fight for Ye Jian.","Most importantly... when the snow-white headlights of the police car shone on them earlier, she saw that Ye Jian’s eyes were bloodshot. There was a faint look of sorrow in her eyes as well. No one else had noticed it. Zhou Niannian lowered her head and pursed her lips.","Ye Jian’s family member passed away a few days ago. Her eyes were so bloodshot. She probably wouldn’t be able to sleep well later. Zhou Niannian didn’t want to delay her too much. It was good for Ye Jian to go home and rest early.","She couldn’t tell the captain about this. She couldn’t even mention what had happened in the hospital that night. Hence, she couldn’t be too direct with the captain. She could only remind him about Ye Jian’s family background.","She hoped it would work.","...","When the captain heard that Ye Jian was a military school student, he sized up Zhou Niannian a few times. Then, he looked at the military school student who was still on the phone and asked, “Are all the military schools and police schools now filled with females? You’re from a police school, and she’s from the military school.”","“Why? Are you looking down on us females?” Zhou Niannian frowned. She glanced at Ye Jian and continued discussing with her captain, “She has nothing to do with this tonight. She could have stood by and watched, but she didn’t. She helped me so much. Captain, she saved my life.","“She already said that she has to catch a plane back to school tomorrow morning. Let’s not make her go through the routine here. If you want, just ask a few questions here. Don’t make her specially go to the brigade.","“Her family is powerful. I’m afraid that if someone from her family comes, our SWAT team will end up alerting the higher-ups. Captain, listen to me this time. I’m not wrong.”","The captain saw that Zhou Niannian was protecting Ye Jian and was afraid that he would make things difficult for her savior. He couldn’t help but smile. “if she doesn’t have a big background, how can she afford a bulletproof car?” He held the rifle in his hand and turned around. He saw the female military school student from a powerful family walking over from the other side of the road. “I’ll just ask her a few questions as usual. It’ll only take three to five minutes.”","Zhou Niannian heaved a sigh of relief when she heard that. She smiled brightly and said, “Okay, thank you, Captain.”","She was still young. The captain couldn’t help but shake his head and laugh when he recalled that she had just been chased by foreigners with guns.","No one from the Zhou family was a coward. Apart from Zhou Huainan or Zhou Niannian, there were also a few other elites from the Zhou family. All of them were powerful.","They were powerful, but the risks they took were also huge.","This time, foreigners had even taken out their guns and aimed them at Zhou Niannian. Zhou Huainan would definitely interfere in this matter. There was no need to mention Commissioner Zhou. He would surely investigate.","It was time to investigate clearly. If they left it at that, it would only secretly encourage the enemy’s arrogance!","Zhou Niannian saw that the captain had relented and smiled as she got up. “Captain, let our team repair her car. We can’t let her pay for it, right?”","“Her car is of high quality. I’m afraid our team won’t be able to repair it. We need to repair it somewhere else. You’ll have to bear the cost yourself. Prepare more money. I don’t want you running out of money when the time comes.”","The captain saw that Zhou Niannian was scheming and deliberately tried to scare her. “Don’t try to bring up the team. One look and you can tell that this is a personal feud. It has nothing to do with work. It has nothing to do with the team.”"]},{"number":4070,"title":"Chapter 4070: Protect","paragraphs":["Chapter 4070: Protect","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Zhou Niannian heard that the team wouldn’t be in charge of repairing the car, she didn’t care about her own car. She could just make some sacrifices to repair it. However, Ye Jian’s car had to be repaired as well. That was a bulletproof car. It had to be sent to a specialized place to be fixed.","Although Ye Jian said that her car might not be repaired by the SWAT team, Zhou Niannian had to make preparations. What if it needed to be repaired by the team?","“Captain, that’s not right. Although I’ve gotten off work, it’s hard to say that this is a personal grudge. When I heard the gunshots, I thought that I would rather sacrifice myself than let them hurt innocent people. Look at my awareness. I’ll always prioritize the safety of the people. Just based on this, our team has to praise me.","The menu was arranged by price from low to high, with only a few signature dishes placed on the front page.","Emily couldn’t help but gasp inwardly, these dishes were way too expensive, simply several times the price of her family’s restaurant...","...","Although the Avie Hotel wasn’t considered a top restaurant, it still had some fame in E City, and ordinary people wouldn’t go there to dine.","But now, looking at this place, there was really no comparison.","“One 70% cooked French-style steak.” At this time, Baron Stuart had already ordered and handed the menu back to the waiter.","Emily raised her head to look at him and then lowered it to find the French-style steak on the price list.","Well, although it was a bit expensive, compared to the ones at the back, this was still acceptable.","She might as well order this one too.","“The same, thank you.” She looked up and smiled at the waiter, also handing back the menu.","Just as the waiter left, Emily glanced over and saw Elia Parker and her daughter slowly approaching, looking as if they were searching for someone.","Could it be that they would come to them?","Thinking of Iris Carter’s gaze at Baron Stuart just now – how she was almost about to pounce on him – would she be coming in here specifically for him?","But that didn’t seem right either, she remembered them talking about looking for a ‘Golden Son-in-law’ when they alighted from their car.","As soon as Elia Parker and her daughter entered, they started looking around, searching for the so-called ‘Boss Beckham’ as they glanced at the seats.","“Over there!” Elia Parker’s sharp eyes spotted the elegant seat next to Baron Stuart’s.","Emily looked over accordingly and saw a young man sitting next to their neighboring seat.","His appearance was quite good; he looked like a business owner and had a decent temperament.","“What are you looking at?” Seeing her gaze fixed on another place, Baron Stuart couldn’t help but also follow her line of sight and noticed that she was actually looking at another man.","When he turned back, Baron Stuart’s expression was slightly gloomy.","Really, was that man more handsome than him? She ignored his world-class good looks to look at other men.","Seeing his sudden darkening face, Emily was startled, “What’s wrong?”","The seating for Iris and her party was only separated from Baron Stuart and Emily by a single aisle. As they were talking, Iris immediately turned her head and caught sight of that handsome face she was fascinated with.","Just now, it was under the dim street lamp, but now, this face was even more captivating. She really wanted to know if this man’s face was naturally beautiful or photoshopped!","“Iris!” Seeing her daughter distracted, Elia Parker had to call her name softly.","Boss Beckham was someone she had gone to great lengths to arrange a meeting with, and she couldn’t let her daughter spoil this opportunity.","Iris came back to her senses, looked at her mother, and asked in a low voice, “What’s up?!”","Elia Parker helplessly gave her a look, reminding her of the man sitting opposite them.","Then, she turned her face and looked at the man with a big smile, “Hehe, Boss Beckham, this is my daughter, Iris!”","“It’s my responsibility to have a place to repair the car.” Zhou Niannian was still worried that Ye Jian would be criticized. The car plate number was obviously from the military district. How was she going to answer to them when she went back?","Hearing this, Ye Jian smiled. She could tell that Zhou Niannian was worried. “Don’t worry, nothing will happen to me. I’ll feel more at ease if I bring it back to fix.”","Zhou Niannian finally calmed down a little. She still had something to say, but her captain still needed to ask a few routine questions. Hence, she pursed her lips and let her captain talk first.","Firstly, he asked Ye Jian where she saw the scene and where she was coming from. Then, he asked if there were any other suspicious points. Just like what Captain Jiang said, it only took three to five minutes."]},{"number":4071,"title":"Chapter 4071: Mist","paragraphs":["Chapter 4071: Mist","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Okay, there are no problems on our side. Thank you for your cooperation.”","After asking those simple questions, Captain Jiang didn’t say anything else. It was all thanks to the military school student in front of him that Zhou Niannian was safe. He didn’t have much to ask either. He could just ask Zhou Niannian.","Zhou Niannian immediately pulled Ye Jian to the side.","She sized up Ye Jian secretly. Seeing that there was a faint smile on her face, Zhou Niannian couldn’t tell if Ye Jian had been criticized over the phone call just now. She asked softly, “Will you really not be criticized when you go back? There are many rules in the military unit. If you’re not careful, you’ll step on a minefield. You were driving a bulletproof car. Will you really be fine?”","She was already in a bad mood after Ye Jian’s family member passed away. If she caused Ye Jian to be criticized by her leader because of her, Zhou Niannian would have to consider apologizing to Ye Jian.","...","Seeing that Zhou Niannian was so worried about her, Ye Jian pursed her lips and said, “Nothing will happen. Don’t worry. When you go back, investigate who they are and why there are foreigners watching you. Think about who you’ve offended during this period of time.","“Although you’ve just started working, those who seek revenge won’t stop just because you’ve just started working.”","Ye Jian, who liked Zhou Niannian very much, inevitably spoke a little more. Zhou Niannian couldn’t help but smile and say, “Those who don’t know better might think that you’re my cousin. I’m older than you.”","“I’m sure that I didn’t offend anyone recently, but the same can’t be said about my family. That’s why people think that when the enemy saw that they couldn’t lay their hands on my father, my mother, and my brother, they specially chose me.","“I’ll only be able to offend people after I work for a longer time. Now, I’m only in charge of the security of places with high traffic. At most, I’ll offend some pickpockets.","“It’s normal for pickpockets to hate us after they’re caught. However, I don’t think they have the ability to go overseas and hire foreigners to take revenge on me with guns.","“Don’t worry about me. I’ll definitely investigate it properly. Just now, my colleagues laughed at me and said that I managed to provoke foreigners to take revenge on me. They said I broke a record in the team.","“Offending people is just that. In our line of work, it would be strange if we don’t offend people.”","Zhou Niannian wasn’t worried that she would encounter such a thing again. She couldn’t avoid being hunted down. Today, such a thing happened. She took it as a reminder. Before the matter was investigated, she had to be more vigilant.","However, this made her consider getting a gun after work. She wanted to see if she could get one.","Something flashed past Ye Jian’s mind because of Zhou Niannian’s words. It was too fast. Just as she wanted to grab a hold of that thought, it disappeared.","Then, she heard Zhou Niannian say, “Ye Jian, what’s your cell phone number? Can you give it to me? Can we be friends? I like your personality.”","“You snatched the words from me. I wanted to ask for your cell phone number too because I wanted to be friends.” Ye Jian didn’t waste any more effort thinking about what had flashed past her mind just now. Coincidentally, she also wanted to make friends with Zhou Niannian, so she hurriedly gave her her cell phone number.","Zhou Niannian, who was looking for her cell phone in her pocket, paused for a moment. Then, she raised her hand and slapped her forehead. “Look at me, I left my cell phone in the car! I’ll give you my number. Call me.”","After entering the number and dialing it, the two women, who were quite skilled, exchanged contact numbers. For a long time after that, besides An Jiaxin, Zhou Niannian was Ye Jian’s other best friend."]},{"number":4072,"title":"Chapter 4072: Looking For A Scolding","paragraphs":["Chapter 4072: Looking For A Scolding","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian called Zhou Niannian’s number. When she heard the call go through, the two of them looked at each other and smiled.","Zhou Niannian wanted to ask Ye Jian if she had gotten better these few days. However, when she saw the gentle smile on Ye Jian’s face, she swallowed her questions.","She wouldn’t ask anymore.","If she asked, it would undoubtedly tear apart the scar on Ye Jian’s heart. It would remind her of her deceased family member again and evoke her longing for them. Zhou Niannian shouldn’t ask.","It was not bad to chat with Ye Jian just like this.","...","Zhou Niannian was a smart and kind-hearted woman. She didn’t have the heart to tear away the smile on Ye Jian’s face. She started chatting casually. “How about we meet at a place to spar next time? When I was in the police academy, it was basically one against six. And I could win them all.","“After coming to this team, it became difficult for me to win one-on-one, let alone one-on-six. My captain even said that this is good enough. After training with them for a year and a half, one-on-two would definitely be enough.","“Alas, my ambition isn’t one-on-two. It’s one-on-three! I’ve already boasted to my brother that I’ll fight one-on-three within a year and one-on-six within two years. If I can only fight one-on-two within a year, I’ll lose all my face.","“I was about to lose my confidence, but now that I’ve met you...” Zhou Niannian’s smile got brighter.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but ask her, “Now that you’ve seen me, you’re confident again.”","“That’s right. I’ll fight one-on-six within two years! Hahaha, won’t the male police in my team be proud?”","Ye Jian shook her head and corrected her seriously. “They would be embarrassed.”","Zhou Niannian laughed until her shoulders twitched. One-on-six. She wasn’t afraid of being laughed at as it was indeed her dream.","She still had to have dreams. What if they came true?","A colleague from the SWAT team jogged over. The team was prepared to bring the person who would snap into two him if he struggled to break free. However, they couldn’t untie the silver wire that looked like silver and steel. After reporting to Leader Jiang Yu, someone came to look for Ye Jian.","Ye Jian immediately went over and untied the Westerner. Soon, the silver wire was untied and returned to her hand. At this moment, two thin and deep strangulation marks appeared on the Western man’s neck.","After his neck was free, the Western man, who was no longer worried about suffocating, rejected the handcuffs. Then, he was forcefully pushed to the ground by a male SWAT officer. His face was grinding against the asphalt of the road as the officer forcibly twisted the man’s hands behind his back. The officer cuffed them tightly.","Seeing that he couldn’t break free, the Western man started cursing again. He used his identity as a foreigner to look down on the Chinese special forces.","Hearing this, Zhou Niannian looked around. Then, she ran to the green belt and grabbed two handfuls of grass before stuffing them into the man’s mouth.","She said fiercely, “You came here to kill people and you’re still so arrogant. Do you want to be extradited back to your country? Let me tell you, there’s no way that’s happening! What can you expect from a hog but a grunt?!","“You still want to apply for asylum? You directly endangered our country’s national security and violated the personal rights of our citizens. You still want asylum? The international law doesn’t protect people like you, okay?”","Ye Jian saw that Zhou Niannian had done the same thing as her. The smile in her eyes was overflowing. She was very sincere. No wonder her grandpa said that she was very suitable for her cousin."]},{"number":4073,"title":"Chapter 4073: Something’s Wrong","paragraphs":["Chapter 4073: Something’s Wrong","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian’s cousin was too cold of a man. He was as lonely as a snow mountain. If there was a cheerful woman by his side, it would definitely bring a lot of warmth to her cousin’s life.","Her grandpa was good at judging people. If he felt that Zhou Niannian was suitable for her cousin, he would definitely be suitable.","However, this wasn’t a decision that Grandpa could make. It still depended on the person involved.","If Zhou Niannian didn’t have a boyfriend and if Zhou Niannian liked her cousin, she had to make his cousin have a good impression of Zhou Niannian.","The Western man kept spitting out the grass and soil in his mouth. One of the SWAT officers who was escorting him into the car said sternly, “We’re only stuffing your mouth with grass now. Later, we’ll stuff a bullet into your mouth!”","...","“If he curses again, give him a bullet!” Zhou Niannian’s voice was even more vicious than a male SWAT officer’s. She glared at the Western man sitting in the car and saw a strange glint in his eyes. Zhou Niannian didn’t avoid his gaze because of this. Instead, she looked back with an even sharper aura. She only retracted her gaze coldly when she saw the astonishment in his eyes.","Was he trying to scare her?","Who was he trying to scare?!","The Western man who was kicked unconscious by Ye Jian was sent to the ambulance. Of course, the Chinese SWAT officers accompanied him the entire time. They had handcuffed his hands as well.","The two Western men were escorted away. However, the fellow who was hit by Ye Jian’s car on the green belt tree escaped. Zhou Niannian didn’t tell Ye Jian this. She whispered to Captain Jiang, “This is my business. It has nothing to do with her. Don’t trouble her anymore.”","Moreover... Ye Jian’s family member had just passed away two days ago. How could she worry about other things when she was sad?","The car sent by the company hadn’t arrived. Zhou Niannian hadn’t left either. Captain Jiang sent a car and two SWAT officers to wait with Ye Jian. He went back to the brigade first.","There would definitely be an overnight interrogation later. Zhou Niannian wouldn’t be able to go home either. She would have to go back to the brigade later.","Ye Jian, who was specially brought into the dark by Zhou Niannian, watched the entire process. The more she watched, the more she liked Zhou Niannian’s personality. She was generous, appropriate, and clean. She couldn’t help but want to ask a very personal question.","Although she wanted to ask, Ye Jian didn’t ask until she left with the guard company.","She wanted to ask Zhou Niannian if she had a boyfriend, but with their current relationship, it was very rude to ask this question. She wanted to ask, but she endured it.","Ye Jian poked her head out of the car and waved at the woman who was still standing under the street lamp and watching her leave. She smiled brightly and said, “Contact me when you’re free!”","Her voice was like the cool morning breeze in summer and the gentleness of spring. Zhou Niannian couldn’t help but smile when she heard it. She waved her hand and replied, “Okay! Let’s keep in touch!”","She could feel that Ye Jian had a good impression of her. This good impression was filled with admiration. Coincidentally, she also admired Ye Jian and had a good impression of her. Hehe, Zhou Niannian was definitely going to make this friend.","Zhou Niannian held her cell phone and saved Ye Jian’s cell phone number. She happily got into the police car and returned to the brigade with her colleagues.","At this moment, she started to calm down and think about why foreigners were chasing after her with guns.","On the other hand, Ye Jian was talking to Major General Yang on her phone. “I’m already in the car. I’m preparing to go home now. I’ll catch the plane to school tomorrow morning.”","“Alright, go and rest early. I’ll inform you immediately if there’s any updates on the National Defense’s investigation. We can confirm that Principal Chen’s murderer is from an illegal overseas organization. However, the scope is too wide, and the investigation will take a long time. After you return to school, try not to go out as much as possible. If you see any suspicious foreigners, inform us immediately.”","As soon as Major General Yang finished speaking, Ye Jian, who was leaning against the seat, straightened her back. A foreign illegal organization... She finally understood what was wrong when she was talking to Zhou Niannian just now!"]},{"number":4074,"title":"Chapter 4074: The Murderer","paragraphs":["Chapter 4074: The Murderer","Editor: Henyee Translations","At first, Zhou Niannian said that other than her, it was normal for her family to be targeted. She had only started working and had not even encountered a big case, but she was already targeted by foreigners. Zhou Niannian herself found it unbelievable. Later, Zhou Niannian said that she did not have any enemies. Other than catching a few pickpockets, there was nothing else.","But what if Zhou Niannian was implicated because of Uncle Chen’s murder? What if a foreign organization had targeted her?","Wouldn’t this explain everything?","Ye Jian caught the crux of the matter. When she opened her mouth again, her voice was as cold as ice. “Major General, the female SWAT officer I helped tonight was on duty at the train station when my Uncle Chen was killed.”","On the other end of the cell phone, Major General Yang hadn’t gotten off work. After the Spring Festival, there were many things that needed to be decided. Major General Yang walked out of the military headquarters at midnight almost every day.","...","He was holding the receiver with one hand and reviewing documents with a fountain pen in the other. When he heard this, his facial expression turned serious. He asked in a low voice, “What do you wish to say?”","Little Ye must have discovered something. If not, she wouldn’t have suddenly mentioned it.","“Zhou Niannian encountered two foreigners shooting at her tonight. She told me that she hasn’t come into contact with any big cases or offended anyone since she took up her post. Unlike her parents and brother, she doesn’t have any enemies.","“She even told me that she couldn’t figure it out herself why a few foreigners were targeting her. She guessed that it might be her parents or her elder brother’s enemies.","“Major General, do you think it’s possible that these people attacked Zhou Niannian because she saw the murderer at the scene when Uncle Chen was killed?","“This can explain why Zhou Niannian was targeted by a few foreigners.”","Ye Jian slowly explained her suspicions. She sorted out the seemingly unrelated matters and found a common entry point. This way, the unrelated matters became related.","Zhou Niannian was shot at by two foreigners with guns. Zhou Niannian didn’t understand it herself. However, if this matter was overlapped with Uncle Chen’s case, everything would make sense!","After Ye Jian’s analysis, Major General Yang didn’t agree immediately. He put down the fountain pen in his hand and asked, “Who are Zhou Niannian’s parents? Who’s her big brother? Did you ask for this information just now?”","“I don’t know who her parents are, but she mentioned her brother, Zhou Huainan. She also mentioned that her mother said that countless lawyers hired by bad people were defeated by her mother’s iron ways.”","Ye Jian paused for a moment before continuing, “I have Zhou Niannian’s number. If you want to know, I can contact her immediately.”","“Okay! Contact Zhou Niannian now. Also, what you said is not unlikely. The two of them are being taken away by the SWAT team. They’ll be relatively secure there. Tell Zhou Niannian your guess. Since she’s a SWAT officer, her senses should be good.","“I’ll investigate who Zhou Huainan is first. From what she said, her parents and elder brother should have a certain status.”","Although what Ye Jian said was still a guess, Major General Yang was used to believing Ye Jian’s intuition. He knew that she wasn’t someone who spoke without thinking. The two matters didn’t seem to have anything to do with each other, but the biggest connection was that Zhou Niannian was on duty on the day Principal Chen was killed. She was the first SWAT officer to arrive at the scene."]},{"number":4075,"title":"Chapter 4075: Can You Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 4075: Can You Escape","Editor: Henyee Translations","Perhaps the foreigners thought that Zhou Niannian had discovered the murderer and came back to silence her... It wasn’t strange to think in this direction!","Major General Yang’s expression turned serious. If that was the case, Ye Jian wasn’t the one in danger now. It was... Zhou Niannian!","After ending the call, Major General Yang made use of the time to investigate Zhou Huainian’s identity. It was easier for the military to investigate someone’s identity.","Ye Jian immediately called Zhou Niannian.","Zhou Niannian, who had just reached Tongping Avenue, took out the phone in her pocket. She thought that it was a call from her brother. When she saw the caller ID, Zhou Niannian smiled and picked up the call in a light voice. “Hello, Ye Jian. Did you reach so soon?”","...","“No, I’m still in the car. I discovered something suspicious and wanted to talk to you.” Ye Jian didn’t ask Zhou Niannian who her parents were immediately. Instead, she told Zhou Niannian her guess.","Zhou Niannian was afraid that her colleagues beside her would hear her. She leaned against the car and covered her cell phone the entire time.","As she listened, her facial expression became more and more serious. Ye Jian’s guess made her think that it was possible.","“Okay, I understand. I’ll contact the captain immediately. I’ll sort out the situation on my side. If I really did see something, that’d be a good thing!”","Zhou Niannian lowered her voice and spoke to Ye Jian. Outside, the light from the street lamps flashed past her face. She was half exposed to the lights and half hidden in the dark. There was a rare ruthlessness on her face. “Don’t worry, I’ll definitely cooperate with you!”","Ye Jian smiled when she heard that. She replied, “Yes, thank you, Niannian.”","For some reason, although she only met Zhou Niannian tonight, she felt that Zhou Niannian was a reliable and trustworthy friend.","That was right, Zhou Niannian was her friend now. They were like old friends.","Zhou Niannian felt that there was no need to thank her. It was within her responsibility. Hearing that, she replied softly, “I’ve always felt guilty. If it’s really like what you said, I’ll be very happy.","“As long as I’m fine, they won’t stop. They’ll definitely continue to choose to attack. In that case, I’ll wait for them to come!”","She wanted to use herself as bait to lure the real murderer out!","Ye Jian tightened her grip on her cell phone when she heard that. Even Uncle Chen couldn’t escape. Zhou Niannian... could she escape?","“I hope it’s not. Niannian, it’s too dangerous.” Ye Jian’s throat was so dry that every word hurt. She tensed up. “My Uncle Chen couldn’t even avoid it...”","“Don’t worry, don’t worry. Leave these matters to us. You’re still a student. Study hard. I’ll contact my captain now. Go home and rest early. We’ll talk next time.”","After she finished speaking in one breath, Zhou Niannian hung up. Ye Jian listened to the beeping sound on the other end and put down her hand. She held her cell phone and pressed it against her forehead.","If everything was as she had guessed, Zhou Niannian’s life would really be in danger!","Ye Jian didn’t manage to ask who Zhou Niannian’s parents were. She held her cell phone tightly until her knuckles turned white. She took a deep breath and called Major General Yang.","Major General Yang already knew who Zhou Niannian’s parents were.","Although they were in different systems, he had heard of Commissioner Zhou Hailin from the Ministry of Public Security."]},{"number":4076,"title":"Chapter 4076: Careful","paragraphs":["Chapter 4076: Careful","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Huainan’s personal information had already been transferred over. Major General Yang looked at it and said to Ye Jian, “Commissioner Zhou is a undefeated when it comes to handling cases. He has solved countless strange cases, and his methods are quite swift and decisive. When he was working in Jiangbei, he caught all the local underground forces in one fell swoop. It can be said that he has made countless enemies.”","Ye Jian had never come into contact with the public security system, so she was unfamiliar with Zhou Niannian’s father, Commissioner Zhou Hailin. When she heard Major General Yang’s tone of voice, she wondered if she could go online to understand him when she returned to Dan Gui Garden.","However, she couldn’t look up personal information online now, unlike in the future. She probably wouldn’t find anything.","“A few years ago, the underworld even issued a killing order. The bounty was very high and wanted Commissioner Zhou’s life. As a result, his son, Zhou Huainan, solved the case and wiped out this group of people.”","The pride in Zhou Niannian’s eyes when she mentioned Zhou Huainan flashed past Ye Jian’s mind. Having such a powerful brother was indeed something to be proud of.","...","On the phone, Major General Yang’s voice was serious as he told Ye Jian, “If Zhou Niannian is really implicated because of Principal Chen’s case, we have to talk to Commissioner Zhou. We can’t hide everything. We have to reveal a little.","“Leave this matter to us. You don’t have to worry. Even Zhou Niannian is being targeted. You have to be careful. Nothing must happen to you.","“You didn’t show your face tonight, right? Were you seen by the two foreigners?”","Ye Jian replied, “They didn’t see me clearly. I didn’t think of avoiding them, but Zhou Niannian pulled me away cautiously. When we were fighting, I stood in the dark and didn’t show my face. Later, I kicked them until they fainted. They probably didn’t see me clearly.”","Recalling the entire process, Ye Jian felt that the two of them didn’t see her clearly. It was late at night, and they broke the two street lamps in advance. How could they have seen her clearly?","There was no danger on her side, but Zhou Niannian was in danger.","Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly and told Major General Yang her worries. “Zhou Niannian is in real danger now. Since they didn’t succeed this time, they’ll do it again.","“Major General, I can’t let harm go Zhou Niannian’s way because of Uncle Chen. I’d rather let the overseas organization know of my existence than let Zhou Niannian be in danger.”","“It’s true that Zhou Niannian is in danger, but Ye Jian, we’re not to be trifled with. If the two things are really related, we have their people in our hands now. I contacted the relevant departments just now, and they’re also investigating with all their might. We’ve already taken action. Those demons hiding in the dark should be even more afraid!","“This is our country’s territory. As long as they don’t leave, we’ll track them down. Zhou Niannian is in danger, but so are they!","“You don’t have to worry too much. You should take care of yourself now. Once the overseas organizations know of your existence, they’ll definitely look for you. The people who’ll be sent to kill you won’t be just a few small fries like tonight.","“We all know that this group of people is not simple. We’ll make arrangements for Zhou Niannian. You just need to take good care of yourself, do you understand? Be careful. Don’t be too careless.”","Before hanging up, Major General Yang reminded Ye Jian worriedly."]},{"number":4077,"title":"Chapter 4077: Silent","paragraphs":["Chapter 4077: Silent","Editor: Henyee Translations","The SWAT team quickly received an order from their superiors. The two cars that were escorting the two foreigners were about to drive back into the team when they turned left at the intersection and drove in another direction.","Zhou Niannian, who was still in the car, held her cell phone tightly and looked at it with a complicated gaze.","She wasn’t afraid of danger. She wasn’t afraid that her life would be over. She was just afraid that her life would be gone and the real murderer wouldn’t be killed!","Now, they weren’t giving her a chance at all. They said that they had other arrangements and immediately made them. Their speed was so fast that she didn’t even have time to react.","“Zhou Niannian, you’re in a very dangerous situation now. The other party’s background is unknown. It’s very likely that they’re not your parents’ and brother’s enemy. You’ve unintentionally seen someone and now they want to silence you.","...","“Don’t go home for the next few days. We’ll send you out of the brigade tonight. Didn’t you say that you want to enter the training base that your brother went to? We’re already making arrangements for you. After we’re done, we’ll immediately send you overseas for a year of closed-door training. During that year, you’ll cut off all contact with your family and the country. The only person who can contact you is the person in charge of arranging the special forces’ overseas training in the public security system.”","Five minutes ago, Zhou Niannian received a call from the Ministry of Public Security. Five minutes ago, she was still thinking about using herself as bait to find the murderer of Ye Jian’s family. Five minutes later... she needed to go to her brother’s current unit until she went overseas.","She could only obey the entire arrangement. Just like that, she was suddenly arranged to go overseas for training.","What was the background of the murderer who killed Ye Jian’s family member? Why did the higher-ups value them so much?","Did they investigate clearly? Did they already know the identities of the two foreigners? Why did they suddenly arrange for her to go overseas?","Wasn’t this... too fast?","There were limited slots for overseas training. Would she be snatching other people’s slots?","At this moment, Zhou Niannian’s heart was in a mess. Her palms were sweating. She seemed to have thought of something and immediately sent a message to Ye Jian.","[Ye Jian, I’ve been arranged to go overseas for a year of closed-door training. I’ll cut off all contact with the country within a year. Don’t worry about me being in danger now.]","When Ye Jian received the message, she was still on the phone with Major General Yang. The latest news was that ten minutes ago, an adult man who had escaped from a car accident... died in another car accident.","It was an Asian face with an unknown identity and of an unknown nationality... There was no document that could prove his identity. He only had an assembled pistol with six bullets in it. Other than that, there was nothing else.","“Your guess might be right, but these people are not the main criminals. Now, we need to focus on capturing the two foreign men and see if we can pry anything out of them.”","Major General Yang’s serious voice came from the phone. Ye Jian pursed her lips tightly.","The person who escaped died in a car accident. It was obvious that he was silenced.","“The arrangements for Zhou Niannian should be ready. We’ll sent her overseas for a year of closed-door training. Her team had such a plan before. They submitted the application report three days ago. Everything is falling into place at the right time, so we’ll just send her overseas directly.”","Ye Jian felt relieved when she heard that. This was for the best!","“Now, there’s still your safety problem. I haven’t reported what happened tonight to Commander Xia. If Commander Xia knows that this group of people still dares to come out and kill to silence, the sky in the capital city... will probably change.”"]},{"number":4078,"title":"Chapter 4078: The Night Is Still Long","paragraphs":["Chapter 4078: The Night Is Still Long","Editor: Henyee Translations","Principal Chen was killed because the other party was well-prepared. In addition, no one knew that Principal Chen had entered the capital city’s military headquarters. Commander Xia only criticized the leader of the sniper base in private and didn’t pursue the matter.","This time, there was going to be a huge storm.","After hanging up, Ye Jian finished reading the message from Zhou Niannian. She pressed the cell phone buttons with her slender fingers and replied to Zhou Niannian. However, after 20 minutes, Ye Jian didn’t receive any more messages from Zhou Niannian. She called her and realized that her phone was switched off.","Ye Jian looked at the silent phone for a while before looking outside.","At 11:00 pm, the streets of the capital city were no longer as noisy as they were during the day. There were not many pedestrians on the streets anymore. Even the lights of the street lamps seemed to have dimmed a lot. It seemed so quiet. The quiet night looked so beautiful, but in the dark corners where no one could see, countless sins and evils were growing. No one knew when they would reveal ferocious faces to destroy this beauty.","...","Ye Jian’s peaceful and beautiful life had been completely broken by sin and evil after Uncle Chen’s death.","She didn’t know how the higher-ups would investigate this. Just like back then, when they were investigating Li Chuhai, every step was extremely difficult. It could be said that they were taking it step by step, afraid that they would alarm Old Master Li, who had retreated behind the scenes.","Now, there were no traces of Uncle Chen’s murder. When would they be able to find out something?","Once it involved foreign organizations, it would only be more difficult.","Now, Ye Jian hoped that what happened tonight was related to Uncle Chen’s murderer. However, when she thought of Zhou Niannian, she didn’t want that to be the case.","It was a contradictory and complicated thought.","Ye Jian, who hadn’t gotten much shut eye in the past few days, closed her eyes to hide the coldness in them. She seemed to be resting with her eyes closed, but her pursed lips betrayed her.","Although she had closed her eyes, her brain didn’t stop thinking. She was still thinking about something.","The darkness before dawn had not ended. The night was still long.","After returning to Dan Gui Garden, Ye Jian pulled the main power switch up and knew that there was no one at home. She knew that the old man had gone to the experimental base, but she didn’t know where Uncle Fu had gone.","Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief knowing that Uncle Fu wasn’t around. After washing up, Ye Jian, who hadn’t slept for the past few days, didn’t manage to fall asleep until four in the morning. At around eight in the morning, she was woken up by the doorbell.","Ye Jian, who was going downstairs, saw the face on the screen of the surveillance cameras. She thought for a moment and patted her face before opening the door.","When she returned to Dan Gui Garden, she had wondered if she would meet Qin Xiu. She didn’t expect to really meet him.","The closed door opened. Qin Xiu smiled and greeted the person who opened the door. “Uncle Fu, good morning... Ye Jian.”","His voice turned from light-hearted to stunned. The change in his tone happened in an instant.","Qin Xiu, who was at the door, looked at Ye Jian, who was standing inside. He was a little stunned. He thought that Uncle Fu would open the door, but he didn’t expect Ye Jian to open the door.","He saw her again while he was unprepared for it.","Ye Jian looked at the change in Qin Xiu’s handsome expression and wanted to laugh. It was probably rare for a diplomat to be dumbfounded.","“Good morning,” she greeted him with a smile, still slightly distant.","Qin Xiu, who had recovered, smiled. He looked at Ye Jian and realized that he had disturbed her sleep.","He cleared his throat and said, “I’m sorry for disturbing your sleep. When did you come home?”"]},{"number":4079,"title":"Chapter 4079: A Lifelong Mistake","paragraphs":["Chapter 4079: A Lifelong Mistake","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian looked outside. Standing at the door and talking wasn’t a good idea. She turned sideways and said to Qin Xiu, “I just came back in the early morning. Come in and have a seat.”","If it wasn’t Qin Xiu standing at the door, Ye Jian wouldn’t have opened it casually.","Ye Jian’s invitation made Qin Xiu, the undefeated diplomat, not know how he walked in from the entrance and sat on the couch. Even when Ye Jian poured him a glass of water, Qin Xiu stood up in a flurry like a child and took the glass.","In comparison, Ye Jian was much calmer.","“I have something to talk to you about. I’m sorry, I just woke up. I’ll wash my face and brush my teeth first. Sit down first.” Ye Jian didn’t seem to notice Qin Xiu’s flurry. She smiled faintly and went upstairs to wash her hair.","...","Qin Xiu came to this home more often than her. He probably wouldn’t feel uncomfortable sitting alone.","Ye Jian felt that Qin Xiu wouldn’t feel uncomfortable. But in fact... Qin Xiu was really uncomfortable.","This wasn’t his first time coming to the Fu family’s home. When he was in his rebellious stage, the Fu family’s home was like his second home. During that period, his favorite place was the Fu family’s home.","Every time Grandpa Fu saw him come over, he would ask him with a smile, “Are you hungry? If you’re hungry, eat more rice. You’ll only have the energy to continue playing after you’re full. When you’re done playing, remember to go home. You can’t play until you can’t even find your way home.”","He smiled kindly and persuaded him slowly. During that period of time, the words of persuasion from his family were ear-piercing to him. Qin Xiu didn’t listen to a word they said.","However, he would listen to Grandpa Fu’s persuasion without missing a word. Sometimes, he could even chat with Grandpa Fu about himself and complain about his family.","Back then, Grandpa Fu would always say to him, “Whether you listen or not depends on you. Whether they say it or not is your parents’ business. You can choose not to listen or leave. However, you can’t cut off the concern parents have for their children.”","This was the place where he came the most during his year of rebellion. Qin Xiu put down the porcelain cup that was a little hot. He gently touched the couch with his hand and looked at the coffee table in front of him as well as the television cabinet in front. Everything about the Fu family’s home was still so familiar. It hadn’t changed at all from a few years ago. The only change was that... a woman he liked now lived here.","She was the only woman he had fallen in love with in the past 30 years.","Unfortunately, the woman he liked didn’t like him.","Qin Xiu sighed softly and picked up the glass of water on the coffee table again. He lowered his head and took a sip of the water in the porcelain cup. The mist blurred his elegant and handsome face as well as the bitterness in his eyes.","That year, the sun was shining brightly. Standing indoors, he saw a woman with picturesque features sitting outside. If he had known that he would like her one day, he would have walked out without hesitation.","Unfortunately, there were no ifs. If you missed it, you missed it. If you missed it once, you missed it for life.","Qin Xiu hadn’t finished his glass of water. Ye Jian, who had finished washing up, came downstairs. Qin Xiu looked at the woman walking toward him and noticed her distant demeanor. He drank the water to suppress the bitterness in his mouth before putting down the cup. He took the initiative to ask, “I’m sorry, I still have to rush for my flight at noon. Time is a little tight. I wonder if there’s anything you need to discuss with me?”","It was better for him to take the initiative and tell her... that he wouldn’t stay for long, so she didn’t have to worry.","It was true that he was flying in the afternoon, but there was still a lot of time. He only said this to reassure her."]},{"number":4080,"title":"Chapter 4080: Forget","paragraphs":["Chapter 4080: Forget","Editor: Henyee Translations","His words made Ye Jian, who was sitting up straight, pause for a moment. As expected of a diplomat. When he was generous and appropriate, he could make people feel refreshed.","If time was really tight, why would he come to her house?","Ye Jian didn’t expose his kind words. She sat down and deliberated for a moment before saying, “Please don’t mention to my grandfather that you met me in the hospital a few days ago. This matter is a little complicated. I don’t want Grandpa to know.","“I’m sorry to have delayed your time because of this,” she apologized sincerely.","Although she knew that he said that time was tight to resolve the awkwardness between them, this apology was what she wanted to say.","...","She was very grateful for his distance and gentlemanly demeanor.","Qin Xiu frowned slightly and heaved a sigh of relief.","When Ye Jian opened the door just now, he thought that Grandpa Fu was really sick. Especially when he saw that Uncle Fu wasn’t at home, he felt even more uncertain.","Now that she told him that she needed him to hide the fact that she had gone to the hospital, it meant that Grandpa Fu wasn’t the one who was sick.","If it wasn’t Grandpa Fu... could it be Uncle?","Qin Xiu, who had just heaved a sigh of relief, tensed up again. He looked at Ye Jian intently. There was no smile on his elegant and handsome face. “Where’s Uncle? How’s his health?”","“It’s not my father either.” Ye Jian realized that he had misunderstood. She lowered her eyes slightly and replied, “It’s not my grandfather or my father. Don’t misunderstand.”","Ye Jian didn’t tell Qin Xiu who it was. To her, this was a personal matter. Her relationship with Qin Xiu wasn’t good enough for them to talk about personal matters.","Qin Xiu, whose gaze had changed, sat beside her. However, the woman, who was a distance away from him on the couch, had already pursed her thin lips.","Recalling what she said last time, Qin Xiu suppressed the question. He had wanted to ask her who it was. He raised his hand and looked at his watch. He stood up elegantly. “I understand. Don’t worry, I won’t mention it to anyone.","“It’s getting late. I’ll make a move first. Goodbye, Ye Jian.”","After he finished speaking, he didn’t wait for Ye Jian to stand up and send him off politely. He nodded slightly and left the Fu family’s home with his long legs.","Her rejection was like a sharp blade that cut into his heart again and again. It cut into his heart until it was dripping with blood. It was like a flaming wind that blew past his heart, turning his heart into a desolate desert where sand and rocks flew everywhere. It was so dark that he didn’t even know if the sun would rise tomorrow.","This heartless woman. He couldn’t get close to her. He couldn’t even get close to her. In that case, he would leave.","He wanted to leave and see if he could forget her.","‘Please allow me to use my last bit of pride to say goodbye to you. Goodbye, heartless woman. I hope that I can forget you one day. I hope that when I see you one day, my heart will be as calm as water...’","Qin Xiu didn’t tell Ye Jian that he was about to go far away to a distant and dangerous country. He left the Fu family’s home and closed the door behind him. In that instant, his composure instantly disappeared.","He was no longer as elegant as before. He was no longer as calm as before. When he went down the steps, he staggered and almost fell down.","At this moment, Qin Xiu, who seemed fragile, swayed with every step he took. Every step he took felt heavy.","‘Goodbye, Ye Jian.","‘If I come back alive, I hope that I’ll be able to face you calmly.’"]},{"number":4081,"title":"Chapter 4081: Fate And Calamity","paragraphs":["Chapter 4081: Fate And Calamity","Editor: Henyee Translations","After walking out of the door, Qin Xiu turned around and looked at the red wall. It was a white-tiled bungalow. The smile on his face was like a thin ray of sunlight on the edge of a cloud. Although it was beautiful, it was extremely short.","At home, Ye Jian listened to the clicking sound of the door being closed. Her gaze landed on the porcelain cup that Qin Xiu had drunk from. There was a faint smile on her face.","Speaking from the bottom of his heart, Qin Xiu was indeed a very good man. He was a gentleman. He was a very good man. He could take a step back and give people a more comfortable space. He wasn’t abrupt or offensive. He made people feel at ease.","She admired such a good man, but it was limited to admiration.","She had Captain Xia, the best man in the world. Hence, no matter how outstanding another man was, he was not as good as her Captain Xia.","...","It was good that she had Captain Xia as her lover in this life.","Ye Jian didn’t chase after Qin Xiu. She picked up the porcelain cup on the coffee table and entered the kitchen. After a while, the sound of water splashing could be heard from the kitchen.","She had to leave for school too. She didn’t wake up until eight o’clock. Her flight was at 11.30 am. She was on a tight schedule.","Due to the traffic jam, it was already 10:40 am when she arrived at the airport. Ye Jian, who was carrying her camouflage luggage, ran all the way. After checking in, she ran to the security check. Fortunately, she didn’t miss the timing for the security check.","Qin Xiu, who had also arrived at the airport and was talking to his colleagues from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, saw her again... More than two hours ago, he had said goodbye to this woman. He watched as she ran past him and didn’t notice that he was standing at the side. If she just looked around slightly, she would be able to see that he was also there.","The ruthless woman didn’t see him. She ran to check in and then ran all the way to the security check. She didn’t see him at all.","At this moment, Qin Xiu thought it was funny but was also feeling some anger.","He was laughing because it should be impossible for them to keep meeting each other like this. He was angry... because if it was impossible, why did they keep seeing each other?","How could she inadvertently give him a ray of light?","With the light, he slammed into it like a moth.","“When we reach Molaban, we even have to go to the bathroom together. We can’t get separated,” a staff member from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs teased. “We get separated when we go to the bathroom every year. It can’t happen again.”","“Especially Ambassador Qin. If you want to go to the bathroom, you must tell us.”","Qin Xiu didn’t hear that. His gaze was still on Ye Jian, who was undergoing the security check. He only reacted when his colleague called him ‘Ambassador Qin’ again.","However, he didn’t know what his colleague had said just now. In short, they were all unimportant matters. They wouldn’t say anything important in public.","Seeing that his three colleagues were waiting for his reply, Qin Xiu smiled and said, “I’m sorry. I was distracted just now and didn’t hear what you said.”","His direct admission was met with teasing from his colleagues.","“Don’t tell me you were mesmerized by a beautiful woman? I didn’t expect Ambassador Qin to be attracted to beauty.”","“Our Ambassador Qin is a single noble. It’s normal for him to pay more attention to beautiful women.”","“Although there are many beautiful women, the ambassador’s heart hasn’t moved. I wonder when he’ll send us wedding invites.”","The three colleagues teased him together. Qin Xiu couldn’t help but smile. He had indeed seen a beautiful woman just now. His heart had already been moved. However, the woman he liked was heartless. If it was at a a big capital city or a big airport, he wouldn’t dare to greet her."]},{"number":4082,"title":"Chapter 4082: Helpless","paragraphs":["Chapter 4082: Helpless","Editor: Henyee Translations","He didn’t dare to move forward or get close. He just watched quietly as she passed the security check and entered the waiting lounge.","He didn’t tell her where he was going, and she didn’t tell him either. She actually came to the airport too. She didn’t accompany him or send him off. They were clearly familiar with each other, but they were like strangers.","Hearing his colleagues’ teasing, Qin Xiu smiled and said, “On my wedding day, I’ll definitely treat everyone to a wedding banquet. Now... let’s find a place to sit and wait. We’ll go over together when everyone is here.”","This was the domestic boarding building, and they were going to the international boarding building. They were still waiting for a Chinese chef to join them.","The weather in the capital city was very good. Although the temperature was low, the sun was shining brightly outside. Pedestrians came and went. They were all in a hurry.","...","The airport was a place for separation and reunion. Some people left, while others came. Life was like this too. Some people would come quietly without leaving any traces, while others came quietly but left behind eternal traces.","Ye Jian, who rushed back to school to report, didn’t know that she had met Qin Xiu at the airport again. When she reached the school, she finished reporting first. Before handing over her cell phone, she sent a message to Xia Jinyuan’s personal cell phone as usual. She knew that he couldn’t see it, but she wanted to tell him that a new semester had arrived.","It was the second semester of her third year. When he left, the second semester of her second year hadn’t started.","The phone screen indicated that the message had been sent. Ye Jian looked at it in a daze. There was a hint of relief in her eyes, but she was even more so worried.","She didn’t know how Captain Xia was recovering. It would take more than a month for him to recover from the stab in his chest. He couldn’t do any strenuous activities during this period of time. He could only recuperate.","With his inability to accept not moving for a day, she didn’t know how he would manage to persevere through this period of bed rest.","Holding her cell phone, Ye Jian kept thinking about it. She didn’t notice that He Jing and Xu Wen were tiptoeing closer to her. The closer they were to her, the lighter their footsteps and slower their movements...","After making a hand gesture, the two of them wanted to scare Ye Jian. Unexpectedly, Ye Jian, who had her back facing them, suddenly turned around and shouted at the two of them. The two of them were shocked and successfully frightened by Ye Jian.","“You scared me to death! My soul almost left my body.” Xu Wen patted her chest and said with lingering fear. At this moment, her heart was still pounding.","He Jing was a little better. After the winter vacation, she became thinner. She patted her chest to calm herself down and said to Ye Jian, “I heard that your winter vacation was very exciting. You even competed with the pickpockets. One against eight. You’re amazing!”","In the dormitory, He Jing was the oldest, Ye Jian was the second oldest, and Xu Wen was the youngest. The three people who had been in the same dormitory for two and a half years were comrades and also good friends.","The students who came to school early to report on Ye Jian’s achievements during the winter vacation already knew that she could fight eight people at once even with a cold. She easily knocked down the pickpockets. The next day, when she got off the train, they even took revenge on her. In the end, she took care of them.","This was not all. When they went to the train station to carry out the mission during the new year, they were targeted by the accomplices of the pickpockets. Those people wanted to take revenge with knives, but they were dealt with by Ye Jian as usual. Everyone was sent to the police station.","During the Spring Festival, the Nanguang Line had invested a considerable amount of police force. It was said that the various bureaus in Nanguang were almost filled with pickpockets.","Ye Jian had just arrived and had yet to meet the students in her class. The students in her class already knew about what had happened to during her winter vacation in Nanguang. Hearing that, she smiled and asked, “Where did you hear about this? Could it be that you were serving in Nanguang as well?”"]},{"number":4083,"title":"Chapter 4083: Break Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 4083: Break Up","Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’m not that powerful. The seniors spoke about it when they came back. All the students who came two days earlier in our class know about it. Wen and I heard it from Song Zhiqiu just now.”","After He Jing finished speaking, Xu Wen continued, “There’s another piece of news. Song Zhiqiu brought a handsome man along. I heard that he’s even more handsome than Song Zhiqiu. I plan to bring our Jing to meet a handsome man!”","“You’re the one who wants to meet handsome men, right? You like to pull Jing along every time.” Ye Jian smiled and glanced at Xu Wen. Xu Wen, who was in her third year, had improved a lot compared to Xu Wen who was in her first year. She seemed to have changed into a different person.","In the words of the officer, she had been reborn!","Even so, there were parts of her that remained the same. For instance, she still liked to look at handsome men.","Every time she said that she wanted to see a handsome man, He Jing would reject her and reiterate that she had a partner and could not act this way.","...","Xu Wen had a partner too. This was a secret among the three of them.","However, this time, He Jing said, “Accompany Ye Jian to hand over her phone first. Then, we’ll go over to look for Song Zhiqiu. Song Zhiqiu is treating us tonight. There’s a place called Rooster Restaurant that’s a few minutes walk from our school.”","They were just reporting themselves today. There were no other course arrangements. There was no evening study session either. In addition, since they were in school, most of them would have to buy something. They could usually get the admission slip to go out.","Ye Jian didn’t plan to go out. She was puzzled by He Jing’s answer.","He Jing, who had never gone to see handsome men with Xu Wen, was acting abnormally today.","He Jing knew that Ye Jian was meticulous. She must have noticed something. Anyway, she didn’t want to hide it. He Jing, who had lost a lot of weight, said generously, “I broke up with that person. It happened around Spring Festival.”","Ye Jian suddenly looked up at He Jing. “Why? You even changed your university preferences to get closer to him. It wasn’t easy for you guys to get together. Why did you split up?”","“It’s all because of his parents,” Xu Wen said indignantly. She pouted.","He Jing straightened her military cap and smiled faintly. “His parents don’t approve of me because they think that he isn’t young anymore. I’m still studying. After I graduate, I won’t be in a hurry to have a child. You know that the elders in the village have a strong tradition. They aren’t willing to accept a girl who doesn’t plan to have a child in the next five years as their daughter-in-law. Hence, they kicked up a fuss at home and even arranged a blind date for him behind my back.","“My sister knew about it and told me. I called my ex and asked him about it. Although he didn’t go on a blind date with the person his family introduced to him, he couldn’t go against his parents’ wishes. We didn’t talk for ten days. When I called home during the Spring Festival, my sister told me that my ex’s father wanted to strangle him with a rope and that his uncle hit him with a vine. My family also advised me not to waste my time on him, seeing as his family is like this.”","He Jing told Ye Jian about how her Spring Festival went in a very calm tone. Although there was a faint smile on her lips, her red and teary eyes told Ye Jian that her heart was not calm.","“I compromised, and so did he. Thus, we broke up.” He Jing’s nose was stuffy. She took a deep breath, and the smile on her face became a small one. “Maybe we don’t love each other deeply enough. There’s no other choice but to break up.”","Xu Wen lowered her head. She was unhappy about what happened to her good friend. Her voice was choked up. “Why are there such parents? Why do their children have to get married and have babies early?”"]},{"number":4084,"title":"Chapter 4084: Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 4084: Shock","Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing that Xu Wen still had something to say, Ye Jian knew that Xu Wen’s unfinished words were definitely not good. She immediately said in a low voice, “Wen, let Jing catch her breath.”","“I’m calm enough. I did feel uncomfortable the first few days after we broke up. We dated for three years and were thinking of getting married. Then, we broke up just like that. I was so sad that it was as if my heart was dug out.","“During the day, I trained fiercely. At night, I continued to train fiercely with the soldiers. Thanks to my breakup, I was sent to the grassroots company and got an ‘excellent’ grade. Now, everything is over. I just feel a little sad when I mention it. I don’t feel so uncomfortable anymore.”","He Jing wiped her tears away. She said to Ye Jian, “I’ve thought it through now. We’re not allowed to date anyway. So be it. I can study hard without any distractions and stop thinking about things that have nothing to do with studies.","“Wen is right. There are plenty of fish in the sea. It’s okay. I’ve passed this hurdle. There are better people waiting for me.”","After wiping her tears, He Jing, who came from Qinghai, was the same as before. Although she wasn’t very beautiful, her perseverance made her likable.","...","A valiant female soldier did not have to be beautiful. Having a strong aura was enough!","Ye Jian didn’t comfort her. She patted He Jing’s shoulder lightly and tidied her collar. She smiled and said, “There are plenty of fish in the sea. Wen is right this time.","“Since you’ve chosen to compromise, you have to accept it. Since both sides have chosen to compromise, you have to accept it even more. There’s nothing to it. There are better things waiting for you.","“Come, hand over your phone with me first. Then, we’ll go look for Song Zhiqiu. I want to see how handsome the handsome man that Wen has been talking about is.”","Although Ye Jian didn’t like handsome men, she could still take a look.","He Jing couldn’t help but smile. “Her taste has always been average. I’ve never thought the people she thought were handsome were truly handsome.”","“Hey, are you doubting my taste? You’re the one who doesn’t have good taste, okay? Jian, let me tell you, this handsome man is really handsome. Go, go, go. Hurry up and surrender your phone. Let’s hurry up and take a look.”","Ye Jian and He Jing were pushed by her. The two of them looked at each other and smiled. Then, they laughed and shook their heads.","“Let’s go.”","“Let’s go.”","“I wanted to leave long ago. It’s you two who were dawdling,” Xu Wen muttered. The three of them chatted and laughed as they walked side-by-side toward the instructor’s office.","However, Ye Jian didn’t expect the handsome man Xu Wen was talking about... to be Yang Heng.","Ever since she bade farewell to Yang Heng in the Southern Province, it had been almost two years since they last met. When they met again, their friendship hadn’t changed. However, the military uniform on his body still surprised Ye Jian.","“Why did you join the military? Shouldn’t you be in the police?” Ye Jian asked Yang Heng.","Xu Wen, who was waiting for Song Zhiqiu to introduce the handsome man, widened her eyes when she saw this.","No way, Jian actually knew him!","Song Zhiqiu looked at his cousin, Yang Heng, and smiled. “I already said that Ye Jian would be surprised to see your military uniform, but you didn’t believe me.","“Of course, she’d be shocked. No one expected you to choose to join the army!”","Ye Jian didn’t expect it, and Yang Heng didn’t expect it either.","He raised his fist and bumped it lightly with Ye Jian’s fist. Yang Heng pulled his collar and raised his eyebrows as he asked Ye Jian, “How is it? Is it okay?”"]},{"number":4085,"title":"Chapter 4085: Green","paragraphs":["Chapter 4085: Green","Editor: Henyee Translations","He looked more than okay!","“This is great. I’m really surprised. I didn’t hear about you joining the military.” Ye Jian took a step back and sized up Yang Heng carefully. “You’re indeed handsome. You’re much more handsome than when you were in casual clothes.","“Why did you join the military?” she asked again.","Yang Heng, who had a crew cut, looked much tougher now. “Just because. I don’t even know why I signed up. It was a moment of hot-headedness, I guess.","“I’ve joined the translation department.. You’ve taken the martial arts route while I’ve taken the language route.”","Yang Heng, who came back from studying abroad, had chosen to join the military just because of Auntie Song Lanting’s words. “Since you haven’t thought of where you want to go after coming back to the country, you can join the military too. You’re not that old. Go and try and see if you can get in.”","...","Yang Heng was 23 years old when he came back after graduating from university overseas. He was one year younger than the age limit of 24. Most importantly, he graduated with a master’s degree. After layers of political review, Yang Heng joined the army last winter.","He was assigned to the translation department of a certain base and became an interpreter in the military unit.","This time, he didn’t come with Song Zhiqiu. Instead, he came with his regimental commander to the National Science University to do something.","After hearing the reason why Yang Heng joined the army, Ye Jian couldn’t help but sigh. “I didn’t expect you to join the army too. Before the holidays, Zhiqiu and I talked about you. We both thought that you would stay in Australia for your girlfriend.”","“Hahaha, that beauty from Australia already has a new lover. My cousin...” Because it was Ye Jian, Song Zhiqiu didn’t think too much and wanted to reveal Yang Heng’s love history. Before he could say it, Yang Heng nudged his stomach with his elbow.","“Song Zhiqiu, don’t you dare say another word.” Yang Heng gritted his teeth and warned him. This was such an embarrassing matter... He didn’t want to mention it. It was a dark history that he didn’t want to remember in his lifetime.","Song Zhiqiu, who was holding his stomach, groaned and didn’t continue. He only said to Ye Jian, “I’ll tell you when I’m free. We’ll hide from him.”","Xu Wen and He Jing didn’t understand anything immediately. When Ye Jian saw Yang Heng’s dark expression, she pursed her lips and smiled. She looked at Yang Heng meaningfully.","Although he stopped Song Zhiqiu in time, she still knew something.","The woman already had a new lover. These words contained a lot of information.","Yang Heng felt uncomfortable under Ye Jian’s gaze. He glared at Ye Jian and sighed helplessly. “It’s a huge psychological pressure to be your friend. You’re so smart. Do I have any privacy left?”","“Privacy? The entire family has been laughing for half a day. How can this be called privacy?” Song Zhiqiu rubbed his stomach and laughed secretly. Then, he said to Ye Jian, “My cousin is treating tonight. Let’s go out for dinner. Xu Wen, He Jing, you guys should come along too.”","Ye Jian hurriedly introduced her friends to Yang Heng. She was so shocked by Yang Heng’s military uniform that she forgot to introduce them.","After the introduction, Xu Wen smiled and said to Song Zhiqiu, “Your cousin is much more handsome than you.”","Song Zhiqiu looked at Yang Heng and asked Xu Wen seriously, “Were you sent to the desert during winter vacation or something?”","“What?” Xu Wen didn’t understand what he meant. She was puzzled.","Ye Jian looked at the two cousins and smiled at Xu Wen. “He means to ask if your eyes have been blinded by sand.”"]},{"number":4086,"title":"Chapter 4086: Choice","paragraphs":["Chapter 4086: Choice","Editor: Henyee Translations","What was in the desert?","Sand!","Ye Jian, who understood what he meant, got Song Zhiqiu’s thumbs-up.","Ye Jian bowed and replied, “You flatter me.”","After getting reminded, Xu Wen raised her leg and kicked Song Zhiqiu’s leg. As they were in school, the inspectors were already on duty. Song Zhiqiu, who was kicked, was worried that an inspector would appear from somewhere, so he could only bear with it.","Ye Jian and He Jing smiled. They didn’t think much of it.","...","As for Yang Heng, he had seen the world before. When he saw his cousin getting kicked, he was enlightened.","As it turned out, the woman he liked was her. Not bad. She was a female soldier with delicate facial features and big eyes. She was very cute.","Xu Wen was a woman with big eyes. Song Zhiqiu and Yang Heng were handsome boys. When they smiled, the happiness they emitted could infect others.","In the past, Ye Jian wondered why Yao Jing liked Yang Heng. Now, she thought it was probably because he could bring forth happy smiles in others. He could dispel the darkness in Yao Jing’s heart and bring light to her gloomy world.","“The female students in your dormitory are not bad. One look and I can tell that they match your rhythm.” Yang Heng looked at the two of them who were laughing and smiled politely at the quiet He Jing. Then, he said to Ye Jian, “Your dormitory should be very lively.”","“You can even tell that? It looks like you’ve become more meticulous after joining the military.” Ye Jian, who was still not used to Yang Heng joining the military, couldn’t help but size up her old friend. In the end, she was still lamenting that he actually joined the military because of Auntie’s words and became an interpreter in the military unit.","It sounded unbelievable.","In this day and age, studying abroad was equivalent to gaining a layer of gold. Yang Heng was a master’s student, and the school he studied in was one of the top schools in Australia. It was impossible for him to have nothing to do when he came back.","Unless he wanted to join the military.","Yang Heng said, “In the past, when I heard that you wanted to enter the National Science University and go to the military unit, I thought that there was nothing good about the military unit. With your results, you could even study abroad with a scholarship.","“After that, I found out that you really entered the National Science University. I did some research overseas and felt that it wasn’t bad. At that time, I actually already had some thoughts about it.","“After that, I came back halfway and met you. I felt that you were different from before after going to the military school. Zhiqiu also talked about your school’s training from time to time. When I heard that, my interest got greater and greater. I came back to the country to catch up with the winter recruitment and purely wanted to try. Who knew that I would really get to enter the military unit?","“Although I’m only in charge of interpreting, I still had to train during the recruitment period. Oh my god, I regretted it on the first day.","“On the first day, I was so tired that I didn’t even want to eat. I just wanted to go back to my bed and lie down. Unexpectedly, the bed was so uncomfortable... I was a new recruit who had only been in the company for a month, but I really want to be a deserter.”","At the mention of the company, Yang Heng poured out all his grievances. Ye Jian and He Jing turned around from time to time and smiled.","He Jing felt that Xu Wen wasn’t blind this time. Song Zhiqiu’s cousin was indeed handsome.","He was handsome, but he was so handsome that people felt that he was out of their league.","Ye Jian comforted Yang Heng, saying, “It was the same when we were new recruits. It’s mainly because we’ve developed some habits. When we came to the military unit, we had to follow the rules that restricted us, and we weren’t used to it at first. Once we got used to it, we didnt’ feel anything anymore.”"]},{"number":4087,"title":"Chapter 4087: Soldier Style","paragraphs":["Chapter 4087: Soldier Style","Editor: Henyee Translations","When training became a habit, there was nothing to be uncomfortable about.","Now, Yang Heng had to get used to it. He had developed an indifference when he was studying abroad, but that was being kept at bay by the rules of the military unit. He looked like a soldier.","“Yes, I got used to it later. One time on my day off, I woke up too relaxed and realized that the gathering time was over. I was so frightened that I crawled out. I only remembered that I was on leave sometime later.","“I slowly understood the joy of training. I also like the disciplined life of the military unit.”","After becoming a soldier, there were more and more common topics between old friends. Ye Jian pulled He Jing over and chatted with her from time to time. In addition, Xu Wen and Song Zhiqiu would interject with their conversation. In the blink of an eye, they chatted for more than two hours.","...","Song Zhiqiu looked at the time and said in surprise, “We’ve been chatting around the sports ground for more than two hours.” He looked at Ye Jian. “Why don’t we go out for dinner now? There’ll still be a table if we go early. We can come back early after dinner. We can also talk about how you fought eight people on the train. After you came out, you fought another group of people and four more people were apprehended at the train station.","“The students who came to school in advance are waiting for your detailed report.”","Yang Heng didn’t know about this, but he knew that Ye Jian had done something big.","When she was in senior high, she liked to do big things without batting an eyelid. When she was in military school, she was still the same. It was fine if she didn’t do anything, but once she did, it was quite astonishing.","His cousin said that Ye Jian was a famous person in their military school. Everyone in the school knew Ye Jian. He believed this without a doubt.","With Ye Jian’s ability and character, she would be able to shock everyone wherever she went.","Ye Jian didn’t expect that this small matter would spread in school. She raised her hand and touched her forehead. She smiled and sighed. “It’s really nothing. I just happened to encounter those things. You’re a military school student, right? It’s not a big deal to deal with a few pickpockets.","“If it were you, you would’ve done the same. However, now that I’m the protagonist, a small matter has become a huge matter.”","“This means that you have a very high image in the hearts of the students. Just like in senior high, you were worshipped by the students. You shouldn’t be humble. Everyone knows that it’s useless to be humble. If it were me, I would’ve been afraid even though I’m a soldier. I wouldn’t be as calm as you.”","Yang Heng told the truth truth. He understood Ye Jian’s character and knew that she kept a low profile. Other people would only magnify the things they did, but she was the complete opposite. She was afraid that other people would know about her good deeds.","It was like this in the past, and now, it was still the same.","“Your abilities have improved, and your soldier aura is getting stronger. But your low-key personality is still the same as before. There’s really no change.”","He Jing and Xu Wen approved of this sentence. Xu Wen even said to Song Zhiqiu, “Your cousin’s speech is much better than yours. You have to study hard.”","Song Zhiqiu glanced at Xu Wen in amusement. She was the only one who thought that his words were lacking.","That night, Ye Jian left the school with them and had dinner outside. During dinner, she was quite vigilant, afraid that she would be targeted. Fortunately, nothing happened until she returned to school.","Perhaps, just like what Major General Yang said, the murderer hiding in the dark was afraid.","Yang Heng stayed in school for three days. Three days later, the PhD students from the military school’s electromagnetic laboratory left the school with Yang Heng and the rest."]},{"number":4088,"title":"Chapter 4088: Less Time Together, More Easily Separated","paragraphs":["Chapter 4088: Less Time Together, More Easily Separated","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was normal for laboratory staff to bring PhD students out of school, but not everyone knew about it. Normally, laboratory staff were needed to go to some ‘unspeakable’ bases.","Ye Jian didn’t know that Yang Heng and the rest had left the school with the members of the electromagnetic laboratory. She only knew that her old friend, whom she hadn’t seen for a long time, had left the school at 6:00 am this morning.","Yesterday, Yang Heng told her that he would leave the school at 6:00 am this morning. As for when they would meet again, it was hard to say.","It could be a few years or very soon.","As time passed, her childhood friends were growing older too. No one knew when they would meet again. Yang Heng smiled at Ye Jian and said, “I don’t know when we’ll meet, but I know that I’ll drop by your school to visit you again. I can get in just by showing my ID card.”","...","He was telling the truth.","The military school was under military management. Just like the military unit, it was impossible for just anyone to enter. Especially since there were many laboratories in the National Science University. These laboratories often had the latest confidential information of research and development. Once the confidential information was leaked, it would not be an ordinary matter.","Even the students of the school couldn’t enter these laboratories. Only those in charge of the laboratories and qualified people could enter.","Even for a famous person like Ye Jian, the laboratories were a restricted area for her. They wouldn’t be opened to her casually.","Yang Heng didn’t tell Ye Jian who he was escorting. He only told her when he would leave. Ye Jian knew when he would leave, but she and Song Zhiqiu couldn’t send him off. They had already said their goodbyes. They would wait for the next time.","After entering the second half of the third year, all the classes and training became more intense. From the start of school until the May holidays, Ye Jian didn’t leave the school at all. In order to become an outstanding student, Ye Jian was extremely busy every day. Even He Jing and Xu Wen were influenced by her. Every time the three of them returned to the dormitory, the first thing they did was move the stools out and sit for more than ten minutes before getting up to wash up.","As she busied herself, He Jing quickly walked out of her heartbreak. She put this first love, which she had put a lot of effort into, into her memories and no longer thought about it.","She didn’t have the energy to think about it anymore. It was too tiring. Sometimes, she even wondered if Ye Jian was doig it on purpose. She was so busy that she almost forgot that she was a lovelorn person.","However, this year was probably a breakup season. There were a few male students in the class who had fallen out of love too. The reason was simple. It was fine if they didn’t get together much, but they couldn’t even make phone calls. They couldn’t find each other even if they wanted to. The girls felt like they didn’t have boyfriends. When they asked to break up, the guys merely replied with an, “Oh.”","Song Zhiqiu and the other guys told Ye Jian these things secretly. When they said it, they looked sad as if they were the ones who had fallen out of love.","Ye Jian rarely paid attention to the private matters of the students in her class. Hence, she always felt that there shouldn’t be many students in her class who had fallen in love. It wasn’t until five male students fell out of love before the May holidays that Ye Jian realized that as it turned out... there were actually so many people like her who did things underground.","She didn’t expect their relationships to break so soon either. The words ‘the less time we spend together, the more easily we’ll leave’ came true for them. It couldn’t be said who was right and who was wrong. It was just that when one decided to find a soldier who didn’t have the time to spend time with one, one had to be prepared to have a boyfriend who wasn’t like a boyfriend.","She had told Jiaxin this before."]},{"number":4089,"title":"Chapter 4089: Give Birth To A Child Soon","paragraphs":["Chapter 4089: Give Birth To A Child Soon","Editor: Henyee Translations","What made Ye Jian happy was that An Jiaxin called the day before the May holidays. She said that she and T6 would be getting engaged during the May holidays and asked if she had the time to attend their engagement party.","It would take place at T6’s hometown.","T6’s hometown... was in the city where the National Science University was located. Ye Jian was here now, but she wouldn’t be here during the May holidays.","Ye Jian, who was packing her luggage halfway, ran out to answer the call. She was extremely surprised by their engagement, but... she couldn’t be there to wish them well.","She said helplessly, “Jiaxin, before I answered your call, I was packing my luggage in the dormitory. I’ll be leaving for a certain mountain area for training at 11:00 pm tonight. I really want to attend your engagement ceremony with Wu Yue, but I’m sorry, Jiaxin. My time doesn’t allow me to go.”","...","On the other side, An Jiaxin covered the phone and said to her boyfriend, Wu Yue, who was lying on top of her as if he had gone limp. “Jian doesn’t have time to attend our engagement ceremony. She’s going out for training.”","Wu Yue was hugging his future wife openly now. Hearing that, he replied to An Jiaxin with a knowing expression. “Based on my understanding, even though students from ordinary universities are really on holiday, students from the military school are not. Just like you, you got to come back two days early.","“As for the military school’s holidays, other than the winter and summer vacations, some students will have holidays. The rest of the holidays are fake. It’s normal for them not to get days off.”","An Jiaxin sighed in disappointment. She changed her tone to a disapproving one and said playfully into the phone, “I knew you wouldn’t have the time. Forget it. For the sake of our many years of friendship, I’ll forgive you if you say a few auspicious words and make me happy.”","Auspicious words? That was simple!","“I wish you a hundred years of happiness and that you’ll grow old with each other. May you have a happy life... Give birth to a child soon!”","After saying a long string of auspicious words, Wu Yue loved the part when she said that they would birth to a child soon. He, who had been listening silently, finally made a sound. “I’ll accept your blessings and give birth to a child soon!”","Ye Jian heard Wu Yue’s voice and immediately said, “Wu Yue, I’m warning you as Jiaxin’s good friend. If you dare to treat Jiaxin badly, I’ll be the first to not let you off.”","“Hahaha, you should say this to Jiaxin. I don’t dare to treat her badly. I’m just short of worshipping her now. If you see my slave-like face, you’ll definitely despise me.”","Wu Yue didn’t take the phone. He rested his chin on Jiaxin’s shoulder and laughed happily. “Jiaxin is still studying. The parents of our families are discussing getting engaged first. On the same day Jiaxin graduates, we’ll get our marriage certificate. This is called double happiness!”","Getting their marriage certificate after Jia Xin graduated was indeed a double blessing.","Now, including G3, there were two pairs of married couples in the team this year.","Ye Jian regretted not being able to make it in time for G3’s wedding. This time, she had to miss Jiaxin and T6’s engagement ceremony too. When Ye Jian returned to the dormitory to continue packing her luggage, she was a little disappointed.","She had hoped that she wouldn’t miss Jiaxin and T6’s wedding.","The sense of loss gradually disappeared as she boarded the bus and headed to a certain mountain area. In the next seven days, the third-year students would have an outdoor assessment. The results of this assessment would be directly included in the final graduation results. There was not much time for Ye Jian to pay attention to other things.","Xu Wen was a little nervous. When she got into the bus, she chose to sit beside Ye Jian and held Ye Jian’s hand tightly with both hands. It was as if grabbing Ye Jian gave her a sense of security. He Jing glared at her secretly."]},{"number":4090,"title":"Chapter 4090: Can You Beat Me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4090: Can You Beat Me?","Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s all you’ve got? What’s there to be afraid of? It’s not like you haven’t lived outside before. What are you afraid of?” He Jing glared at her and spoke as if she expected better from her.","Although Xu Wen was listening, she never stopped grabbing Ye Jian’s hand. She said, “I don’t want to be afraid either, but I can’t control it. It’s in the middle of nowhere. They’re even making us sleep in the mountains. We don’t even have tents. We have to pass through a piece of land in the middle of the night...”","As she spoke, Xu Wen shivered and asked Ye Jian weakly, “Ye Jian, do you think we’ll encounter ghosts when we pass through?”","“Do you think it’s so easy for you to see ghosts?” He Jing rolled her eyes and said to Ye Jian, “Ignore her. The more you talk to her, the more timid she becomes. This time, the results will be calculated. The fourth-year seniors have already reminded you that the outdoor assessment is a test of courage. The more you’re afraid of something, the more reason the assessment team will make things hard for you. Don’t scare yourself.”","Xu Wen was so nervous that she wanted to go to the bathroom. “What should I do? I want to go to the bathroom now...”","...","“Hold it in!”","“I can’t hold it in. Who asked you to say that? The more you speak, the more nervous I get. I’ll want to go to the bathroom when I’m nervous and afraid.”","He Jing was almost confused by Xu Wen. Afraid that she would disturb the other students on the bus, she tried her best to lower her voice and grit her teeth. “Do you want to get good results?”","“Yes, of course!” Xu Wen replied firmly without any hesitation.","He Jing felt that there was a chance. She clenched her fists and made a cheering gesture. “What’s there to be afraid of? As long as you can good results, you don’t have to be afraid of anything.”","“I want to be fearless too, but I’m afraid. What can I do?”","He Jing wanted to pounce on Xu Wen and strangle her. Then, she closed her eyes and retracted her hands. “I won’t persuade you anymore. Ye Jian, I’ll leave her to you.”","Ye Jian, who was resting with her eyes closed, smiled and replied, “I’m not persuading her. If she has the ability, she can jump off the bus and return to school now.”","...","In that case, Xu Wen really didn’t have the ability!","With a ‘sad’ expression, Xu Wen held Ye Jian’s hand and squeezed her eyes open, trying to squeeze out a few tears to achieve a better effect. “Jian, I’ll leave my safety to you. Please protect me well. Thank you.”","Before she could cry, He Jing pinched her face. “Xu Wen, protect your dignity!”","“He Jing, if my face bruises because of you, I won’t let you off!”","“Ha, can you beat me?”","The two of them spoke one after another. In the end, Xu Wen was the first to fall asleep. It was already past two in the morning. According to their military school’s schedule, she would have fallen asleep long ago.","As soon as she fell asleep, He Jing stretched her sore waist and said to Ye Jian, who hadn’t fallen asleep either. “She’s finally asleep. What do you think we should do after she graduates?”","He Jing sighed worriedly. “Sometimes, she’s as timid as a mouse. Sometimes, she fantasizes about the sky. Usually, she’ll scare herself before anything happens. We still have a year as classmates. Where will she go then?”","Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile and shake her head. “You always say that I take care of Wen. Actually, you take care of her more than me. At least, I’m never worried about whether she’ll take good care of herself after separating from us.”"]},{"number":4091,"title":"Chapter 4091: He Is Deeply In Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 4091: He Is Deeply In Love","Editor: Henyee Translations","On the surface, Ye Jian may seem to have taken care of Xu Wen a lot. In fact, her care for Xu Wen was all about nurturing Xu Wen’s personal ability. For example, she would pull Xu Wen along during training. No matter how tired or bitter Xu Wen was, and even if she shouted that she couldn’t persevere, Ye Jian would never let Xu Wen off.","This was the nurturing of Xu Wen’s personal ability. Xu wen had to rely on herself to persevere. Ye Jian would stand at the side and watch over her.","He Jing was different.","“Jing, people can still live without each other. When the environment changes and the people around her change, Wen will change too. If you say that she’s afraid, then let her be afraid. She’ll get used to facing fear herself. Slowly, there’ll be nothing to be afraid of.”","Ye Jian said softly. She looked at Xu Wen, whose head was resting on her shoulder. In the dark, Ye Jian’s clear black eyes were filled with deep nostalgia. “We have to move forward. Only when we can walk alone will we know how to walk.”","...","Just like her. Captain Xia had left her for so long. She encountered everything alone and faced difficulties alone. Even though Captain Xia wasn’t by her side, she still walked on her own.","He Jing muttered softly, “We have to move forward. Only when we can walk alone will we know how to walk...” She muttered back and forth a few times. When she looked up again, her face was already covered in tears.","That was true.","When she first broke up with him, she kept thinking about what she should do in the future. What should she do without him in the future?","At that time, she was so pessimistic. She thought that breaking up meant that her faith had collapsed. She thought she wouldn’t even be able to live the rest of her life.","In the end...","Without the person she loved deeply in the past, she walked all the way here alone. When she thought about it again, although she was still sad, she didn’t have the pessimism that life would be painful without him.","Just like what Ye Jian said, only when one was alone would one know how to move forward.","Ye Jian was just surviving one obstacle after another. She saw the man she loved collapse with her own eyes. She didn’t fall. She saw her respected family member leave with her own eyes. She didn’t fall. She was like the most tenacious flower on the highlands. No matter how difficult the road ahead was, she could withstand the cold and produce the most beautiful flowers.","...","Xia Jinyuan gently touched the scar on his chest with his fingers. He looked at the east where the sun was rising. Bathing in the sunlight, he lost his usual coldness. There was only a smile that was warmer than the sun on his lips and eyebrows.","He already had evidence and information about the intelligence transactions between Cobra and many countries. Now, he was just waiting for Luke to take action and send this information back to Russia. Then, it would be sent to a certain Western country that Cobra was ostensibly loyal to.","Before this, he had always thought that Cobra was just serving a country. Now that he was able to enter Cobra’s study, he realized how many poisonous nests this cunning and ever-changing snake had.","He used the wealth in his hands to open up information channels one after another. He transferred the information of this country to another country and then transferred the information of another country to this country. He used his identity as a painter and philanthropist to enter and leave the political parties of the various countries to obtain more information that was beneficial to him. He used this method of survival to obtain wealth and his current position.","The unlocked door was pushed open. Luke walked in and saw his partner standing in front of the balcony, admiring the sunrise while wearing a white long-sleeved shirt. From the looks of it... he had to admit that this guy’s figure was amazing!"]},{"number":4092,"title":"Chapter 4092: Come Back Quickly","paragraphs":["Chapter 4092: Come Back Quickly","Editor: Henyee Translations","Luke thought enviously. He sized up the tall and handsome body of the Asian man. The morning breeze blew past the balcony and blew up his white shirt. The sunlight passed through the thin white shirt, outlining his strong waist that only Asian men had. At that moment, Luke felt that he, a man who only liked big butts and big breasts, couldn’t help but swallow his saliva.","This fellow’s figure, damn it! It was too good!","Xia Jinyuan seemed to be completely immersed in the beauty of the sunrise and didn’t notice that he had entered. He was slowly buttoning up his shirt, showing no signs of turning around.","No, with his partner’s vigilance, he would have noticed it the moment he pushed open the room. He didn’t respond because he trusted Luke and thought that he wouldn’t hurt him.","He trusted Luke very much. Sometimes, he would even do as he said without suspecting anything.","...","For instance, the day before yesterday, he wanted to know which country Cobra would be meeting with and where they would be meeting. He was just asking casually. After a while, Xia told him.","Luke pursed his lips silently. His gaze gradually became complicated.","Although his partner was very mysterious, he was also very honest. Although he was very careful, he never asked what he was secretly doing.","He was absolutely loyal to Cobra and trusted him.","Hence, now, Cobra liked to bring him around and was beginning to value him more and more. Perhaps, there was no boss who wouldn’t like a subordinate who would use his life to protect him.","Including a cunning person like Cobra.","As for Luke himself, he liked this kind of partner too.","Unfortunately, their cooperation shouldn’t last long. It should be ending very soon... Very soon.","If there was a chance in the future, he would explain why he did that. He would sincerely bring Xia out for a drink and talk about the life that truly belonged to Luke.","“Xia, are you seducing me now?” Putting away the complicated look in his eyes, Luke smiled. At the same time, he waved a set of car keys between his fingers and whistled.","Xia Jinyuan fastened his cufflinks unhurriedly and didn’t answer. Then, he whistled alone.","Luke had been in a good mood recently.","Of course, he was in a good mood too.","Why?","The reason was simple.","That was because they should be able to go home soon.","Based on Russia’s efficiency and the current president’s swift and decisive methods, it was time to put away the five-and-a-half-year plan that Russia had set up.","It was time to end this trap set up by the Chinese soldier who had involved himself halfway.","Luke, who was in a good mood, thought that he had done a good job of disguising himself. He thought that his identity had not been discovered. His identity had just not been discovered by Cobra. But his partner, an elite special forces soldier from the top Chinese special forces, had already discovered it.","Xia Jinyuan retracted his smile and turned around. He glanced at Luke coldly and said calmly, “If you were a woman, I might consider it.”","“Hahaha, well, I can’t become a woman. Let’s go, Xia. I’ll bring you for a ride. The sun outside is so bright, and it wasn’t easy for you to end your life like a monk. We really should go out for a ride.”","“There are more and more beauties on Molaban Street. We’ll drive past them. The wind will blow their thin and short dresses, revealing their sexy underwear... Hahaha, Xia, let’s go. I can’t wait anymore!” Luke said loudly, using his promiscuous image to hide his true identity."]},{"number":4093,"title":"Chapter 4093: Hiding","paragraphs":["Chapter 4093: Hiding","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan spent two months recuperating in Myanmar. It was not until the wound on his chest had completely healed that Luke told Cobra that they could return to Molaban. After coming back, Luke had also received the heavy responsibility handed to him by Cobra. However, he was slightly worse off than Xia Jinyuan.","Luke didn’t have Xia Jinyuan’s courage to make a desperate move. Hence, even though he had been hiding for almost six years, he didn’t come into contact with Cobra’s secrets. However, with Xia Jinyuan’s invisible help, he made great progress.","Now, the situation was getting clearer. Even if Luke only provided a few clues from Xia Jinyuan, it was enough for Russia to create a gap in the impenetrable wall. This gap would become the exit for Luke to return to Russia and Xia Jinyuan to return to China in advance.","He was very happy that he would be able to return to his long-awaited hometown soon. While he was happy, he felt more and more guilty toward Xia Jinyuan. He knew that once something happened to Cobra, something would happen to his partner too.","That was because Russia wouldn’t keep someone who could pose a threat to him, especially if he was Cobra’s most trusted subordinate.","...","He had protested, but it was invalid. The Intelligence Bureau rejected his protest without any room for discussion and told him that if he wanted to return to Signal Flag, everyone around him, especially the partner that Cobra had assigned to him, had to die.","If his partner didn’t die, Russia would be in trouble. Signal Flag would be in trouble too. This included Luke.","Luke had even thought of secretly letting Xia go, but he knew very well that this was a stupid idea. If he let Xia go, the Russian side would still be able to find Xia and carry out an assassination.","Looking at his partner who said harsh words but still cooperated with him in times of action, Luke, who was laughing, knew deep down how he was actually feeling.","‘Xia, my partner, how should I save you?’","Xia Jinyuan looked at his smile and stared at him with his deep black eyes. Then, he frowned slightly. “Luke, are you... hiding something from me?”","This was Xia Jinyuan’s probing. Since he knew that he was leaving soon, he would see if Luke would reveal anything to him.","If he revealed something, he would reveal something too. For instance... he would choose to leave without relying on external help.","During this period of time, especially in the past week, he had seen Luke’s struggles. However, he never voiced out his thoughts.","Until now, Luke hadn’t suspected Xia’s identity. He probably wouldn’t know what his identity was until he left.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t plan to tell Luke either. Although the relationship between Russia and China was alright, they were still two countries. He didn’t plan to negotiate too intimately with Luke.","Seeing that Luke’s smile was stiff because of his words, Xia Jinyuan frowned even more. “Your actions seem quite strange. It makes me feel that you’re hiding something big from me.”","“No, no, no. Not at all. You misunderstood.” Luke shrugged and spread his hands so that Xia Jinyuan could size him up better. “Look, buddy. What big things can I hide from you?”","“Alright, Xia. Put on your shoes and go on a date with beautiful women with me. The weather is so good. It’s most suitable to bring some women on a car ride.”"]},{"number":4094,"title":"Chapter 4094: Warning","paragraphs":["Chapter 4094: Warning","Editor: Henyee Translations","Alright, since Luke still wasn’t revealing anything, it was even more impossible for Xia Jinyuan to reveal anything. Xia Jinyuan retracted his gaze and said calmly, “I’m sorry. I don’t have the time to watch you have sex with a beautiful woman in a car. I need to accompany Mr. Cobra to meet a client from China.”","“Client? What client? Why haven’t I heard of him?” The stiffness on Luke’s face faded. He widened his eyes and looked like he had an opinion. He said loudly, “Xia, in order to reject me, are you making use of Mr. Cobra’s name?”","Luke didn’t know that Cobra was going to meet a client. He also knew that his partner wouldn’t lie to him. However, he wanted to know what client Cobra was going to meet.","Xia Jinnian, who had tied his tie, glanced at Luke, who was trying to get information out of him again. To be honest, Luke’s ability to get information out of him was really average. Of course, it was limited to in front of him. In front of others, Luke would never make such a mistake that would easily let Cobra discover the problem.","Luke knew that Cobra was going to see a Chinese client, but he didn’t know who it was. That was why he asked this on purpose to see if he could get anything out of Xia Jinyuan.","...","Xia Jinyuan saw through his plan at a glance and said calmly, “Mr. Cobra plans to invest in China. China has also expressed great interest. I still have serious matters to attend to. Please move away, thank you.”","Xia Jinyuan didn’t hide it and talked about it casually. Cobra wouldn’t hide this kind of thing from Luke. He might have told him something else.","Cobra was very cunning. Sometimes, he would split the information into several parts and let different people complete it. This was why when Luke came to Cobra’s side, he couldn’t collect strong evidence.","“Mr. Cobra mentioned it before when he went to see his Chinese client. He said that he needed to consider it carefully. Why did he change his mind now?” Luke asked.","Xia Jinyuan had already finished tidying up. Seeing that Luke hadn’t left, he frowned even more. “It’s not up to us to interfere with who Mr. Cobra wants to see. Luke, you’ve been acting strangely recently. I hope you can restrain yourself in front of Mr. Cobra and the others. You’d better keep your mouth shut like before.","“I don’t want to get used to a new partner.” It was both a reminder and a warning.","He was happy to return to the country soon, but it was best not to get carried away.","However, he could understand how Luke felt at this moment. It was indeed exciting to finally be able to return to the country after leaving for almost six years.","If he had been away for so long, he might have been as excited as Luke.","Luke’s heart turned cold. He looked at Xia Jinyuan, who had already walked to the door. The darkness in his eyes couldn’t help but deepen. Was Xia... reminding him just now?","Why did he feel that Xia seemed to have discovered something? However, it didn’t feel like he had.","Luke pursed his lips tightly.","Xia Jinyuan, who had already walked out of the door, said without looking back, “Come out and close the door for me, thanks.”","Luke didn’t answer immediately. If Xia had really discovered something, he should have told Cobra. But he never did.","But why did he feel that Xia had discovered something?","If Xia had really found out something but he didn’t tell Cobra, what could be the reason for that?","Luke didn’t answer Xia Jinyuan. He fell into deep thought.","Xia Jinyuan walked out and didn’t care what Luke was conflicted about. He would leave on his own. He didn’t need Luke’s help. As long as the Russian side didn’t come out and cause trouble, everything would be fine."]},{"number":4095,"title":"Chapter 4095: Extremely Wrong","paragraphs":["Chapter 4095: Extremely Wrong","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan saw the suit and leather shoes Cobra was wearing. He couldn’t help but be surprised because Cobra hated wearing formal attire. He was always wearing an artist’s casual attire.","Cobra saw the surprise in Xia’s eyes and couldn’t help but laugh. “I need to see a very important client from China today. Whether I can invest in China or not depends on his help. That’s why I need to be very careful.”","Xia Jinyuan nodded slightly, indicating that he would treat it seriously too. He wouldn’t say anything else.","He had nothing to say when he was with the venomous snake, Cobra.","Cobra had always wanted to enter the Chinese market, but China had always been very cautious. They were not tempted by his high investment. This time, Cobra finally had a chance, so he would naturally treat it carefully.","...","However, Xia didn’t expect the important Chinese client that Cobra was talking about to be... Qin Xiu!","The moment he saw Qin Xiu, Xia Jinyuan’s heart dropped. He really didn’t know that Qin Xiu, the Chinese ambassador based in Molaban, would meet a businessman!","Why would Qin Xiu be meeting a businessman?","He hadn’t contacted the country for another month. Was there something he didn’t know?","Xia Jinyuan’s heart sank. He stood beside Cobra with a cold expression and watched the two of them shake hands. Then, he saw Qin Xiu’s gaze sweep past his face. He didn’t stop for a second as if he didn’t know him. He smiled at Cobra and said, “I’m sorry for being late and keeping you waiting.”","“No, no, no. Ambassador, you’re not late. I arrived early.” At this moment, Cobra lowered his stance slightly. He was now a businessman who wanted to enter the Chinese market. A businessman would never be able to hold his head high in front of a country’s high government unless he wanted to lose the country’s market.","Qin Xiu made an inviting gesture. “Then let’s go in and talk. I still have a meeting in the afternoon, so we only have one hour of communication. Time is a little tight. Please forgive me.”","As the ambassador of a country, Qin Xiu was able to control his identity easily. The nobility and magnanimity he should have were vividly displayed in one sentence.","Cobra, who had been using the alias ‘Krone’ outside, immediately knew that the ambassador in front of him was not easy to communicate with even though he was very young.","One hour. He thought that the Chinese ambassador would give him the entire morning. He had even arranged lunch!","In the end, the Chinese ambassador only gave him an hour to communicate.","What could one hour of communication do?","He had to let this young Chinese ambassador know that he had the ability to enter the Chinese market and achieve a win-win situation.","Unfortunately, Qin Xiu didn’t give Cobra a chance to prove his wealth.","The entire exchange was indeed about Cobra entering the Chinese market, but it wasn’t like what Cobra had hoped. He didn’t have the initiative.","Xia Jinyuan was sitting diagonally opposite Qin Xiu. He only needed to raise his head slightly to see him. Qin Xiu didn’t look over at him all throughout.","Qin Xiu conducted the entire exchange in a gentle but domineering manner. He first talked about the legal restrictions of Chinese foreign business. Then, he talked about what qualifications foreign businessmen had to enter China. Along the way, he even talked about how China’s work would be affected if foreign businessmen entered the Chinese market.","Cobra thought that the young Chinese ambassador would be easy to deal with. Now, he knew that he was very wrong!"]},{"number":4096,"title":"Chapter 4096: You’re Amazing, My Love Rival","paragraphs":["Chapter 4096: You’re Amazing, My Love Rival","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan didn’t interact much with Qin Xiu, and he had never seen Qin Xiu deal with foreign affairs. This time, he saw that Qin Xiu was able to talk until Cobra’s expression became more and more serious. Several questions were blocked by Qin Xiu with little effort. Xia Jinyuan admired him and felt a little complicated.","This love rival was indeed powerful!","“Every country has its own laws and regulations. If you enter our market, the first thing you need to do is to understand our laws and regulations. At the same time, you need to pay close attention to the policy movements of core government institutions like our National Assets Commission. You can’t use ignorance as an excuse to escape responsibility.”","Cobra grabbed the chance to speak. He smiled and said, “Of course. If I enter the Chinese market, I have to understand the laws and regulations of China.”","Qin Xiu smiled and shook his head. “Mr. Krone, I think it’s too late for you to understand China’s legal regulations if you do it after entering the Chinese market.”","...","Cobra’s expression turned colder. Xia Jinyuan felt that he was holding back his anger.","Tsk, tsk, tsk. The country’s ambassador was indeed impressive. Look, Cobra was about to suffer internal injuries from holding himself back.","No matter what the other party thought, it wouldn’t affect Qin Xiu’s communication. Qin Xiu crossed his fingers on the conference table and continued with a tough smile, “Also, I’ve seen your application in detail. There’s something about acquisitions.","“Here, I need to remind you very seriously that while acquisitions are possible, they must be legal and not malicious in nature. I’ll provide your information to the National Assets Supervision Commission. Once your company enters the Chinese market, it will become a focus of the company.”","That meant that China had already set their sights on Cobra’s company before it even started.","This was not what Cobra expected at all!","He wanted to make use of the fact that he was dealing with the Chinese diplomatic ambassador to make it easier for him to do things after entering the Chinese market. He didn’t want to be watched by the Chinese!","Qin Xiu’s time was a little tight. He didn’t give Cobra much chance to ask questions. After he finished explaining his main purpose for coming, he smiled. He, who was as elegant as a noble prince, no longer had the domineering aura he had just now. He suddenly became very easy-going. “This is the main points I wished to talk about today. I hope you can understand them, Mr. Krone. We welcome foreign businessmen into the Chinese market and look forward to working with you.”","Xia Jinyuan knew that Cobra was in a bad mood. He thought that they would reach an agreement this time, but the Chinese ambassador was so domineering that he didn’t even have the chance to ask for anything. How could Cobra not be angry?","Facing his love rival, Xia Jinyuan had to admit that this love rival... was outstanding. He admired him.","Xia Jinyuan was probably the only one who respected his love rival!","“Mr. Krone, you can consider it again and do a detailed investigation of the Chinese market. I feel that you don’t know much about our Chinese market, but...” At this point, Qin Xiu paused slightly. He didn’t avoid sizing up Cobra. His gentle expression turned a little serious and cold. “However, Mr. Krone, you give me the feeling that you’re very anxious to enter the Chinese market, so much so that you don’t care even if you’ll lose money.","“This feeling is very strange. Since you’re the biggest entrepreneur in Molaban, he should be very concerned about losses and profits. But reading your application, I didn’t get this feeling at all.”","When Cobra heard this, his pupils constricted."]},{"number":4097,"title":"Chapter 4097: The Consequence Of Underestimating","paragraphs":["Chapter 4097: The Consequence Of Underestimating","Editor: Henyee Translations","He was indeed very anxious to enter the Chinese market. Moreover, he was prepared to incur losses in the early stages. In order to enter the Chinese market, an economist who supported him behind his back had even made a detailed loss report to him.","However, the Chinese market was huge. He was not worried even if he lost money in the early stages.","First of all, the money that he would be losing wasn’t his personal money.","Secondly, as long as the company took root in China, the huge market in China would not make him lose money for long.","With support, there was no need to worry about the cut-off of the capital chain. As long as they could stabilize their position in China, they would be able to bear the losses.","...","Hence, after researching the Chinese market, he added his own opinion to the declaration that the economist prepared for him.","This was because they could tell from their research that China needed a large amount of foreign investment to drive their economy.","In the declaration, he mentioned the ‘acquisition’ that could best represent a company’s financial resources. The economist who prepared the declaration for him also thought that after the Chinese side saw his declaration, they would definitely welcome Cobra into the Chinese market.","He was not afraid of losses, could bear losses, and had enough financial resources to ‘acquire’. How could China, which was a backward place, reject such a good foreign company?","There was no way China would reject Cobra.","The economist who drafted the declaration for him even used a very contemptuous tone to judge China. “Don’t worry, sir. When a country like China sees your declaration, the entire country will welcome you warmly. Their workers will even treat you like their parents. They won’t complain even if you ask them to do anything.","“China is just an underdeveloped country. Compared to our country, they’re too far behind. However, they want to become a big country with economic power. Hence, after this declaration is submitted, I can tell you with certainty that the Chinese diplomatic ambassador of Molaban will definitely come to see you personally.","“At that time, you’ll know how urgently China needs you to save their poor and create wealth for them. They’ll even go to the point of treating you like God.”","Yes, when this internationally renowned economist told Cobra that, he really thought so too.","As a matter of fact, he did get a personal meeting with the Chinese ambassador of Molaban. When he received the call two days ago, he specially contacted the economist and told him that the Chinese ambassador had really contacted him personally.","On the phone, the famous economist smiled at him and said, “Everything is under our control, sir. Now, it’s time for you to make your request to the Chinese ambassador.","“If they know that we’re bringing wealth to China, they’ll have to cooperate with us. We’re giving alms, and they can only cooperate obediently. You know, you can solve the food and clothing problems of many poor people.”","Cobra had thought so too. No country would reject such a good foreign investment. It was the same for a poor developing country like China.","But now, Cobra knew that he was wrong. The economist who had given him countless suggestions and helped him was wrong too.","The young Chinese diplomat in front of him looked like an elegant gentleman. When he opened his mouth, he realized that his gentlemanly facade was just meant to confuse others. The words he said were so domineering that Cobra had no way out. Cobra didn’t even have a chance to explain."]},{"number":4098,"title":"Chapter 4098: The Ambassador’s Style","paragraphs":["Chapter 4098: The Ambassador’s Style","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the young diplomatic ambassador from China. Cobra looked down on this ambassador before meeting him, so he paid a heavy price!","Cobra wanted to enter the Chinese market like a savior?","Dream on!","The young diplomatic ambassador was full of doubts about Cobra’s declaration. He didn’t care about such a declaration at all. If Cobra wasn’t the most outstanding entrepreneur and philanthropist in Molaban, the Chinese ambassador might not have met him at all!","He thought that he would be able to enter the Chinese market smoothly, but his expression was much more serious than before.","...","The expressionless Xia Jinyuan’s lips curled up slightly. He had heard the conversation between Cobra and the economist. The economist’s contempt for China meant that it was impossible for Cobra to enter the Chinese market through the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.","Now that he heard Qin Xiu’s merciless rejection, Xia Jinyuan felt as if he had drunk a glass of cold water in June. His entire body was comfortable.","This time, that famous economist would be in trouble.","Why did Qin Xiu want to see Cobra personally? The reason was simple. Cobra’s declaration was filled with a sense of superiority. He felt that going to China was him doing charity. He wanted to save the poor in this poor country and bring wealth to China.","From the beginning to the end, Qin Xiu had read the declaration with a cold expression. After reading it, he instructed the staff to contact the secretary of ‘Mr. Krone’. That was why they were meeting now.","Now that he saw the seriousness on Cobra’s face, he could tell that he was very angry.","But so what?","Today, he came as the Chinese diplomatic ambassador to kill the other party’s arrogance. However, he didn’t reject him completely until... he saw Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan.","Nationality: China","Identity: Active special forces soldier and... Ye Jian’s boyfriend.","Why was he here?","Why did he become Krone’s bodyguard?","How did he manage to stand beside Krone?","Why did he appear?","The moment Qin Xiu saw Xia Jinyuan, all kinds of questions popped up in his mind. He even thought about asking Xia Jinyuan secretly, but the other party’s coldness toward him made him restrain his gaze.","As a soldier, Xia Jinyuan appeared behind a famous entrepreneur and philanthropist... He still remembered that Xia Jinyuan’s military rank was not low. Xia Jinyuan, who had a high military rank, made Qin Xiu realize that there was something wrong with Cobra. It was a huge problem. If not, it was impossible for him to be targeted by Xia Jinyuan from the military.","From the moment he saw Xia Jinyuan to the moment he spoke, it had only been a few seconds. Yet, it was enough time for him to change the script he had prepared for Cobra.","He used a very strong attitude to attack the other party’s every weakness so that the other party could forget about entering the Chinese market to fish in troubled waters.","Qin Xiu looked at the time and stood up elegantly. He lowered his eyes slightly and looked down at Cobra. “Because I have doubts about your declaration, I wanted to see you personally.","“Unfortunately, I’ve reminded you of what to do, but you still haven’t realized your shortcomings. You’re just insisting that you have enough money.","“Of course, I know that you have enough wealth, but you haven’t shown me enough sincerity. Alright, Mr. Krone, I still have another meeting to attend. Goodbye.”","After he finished speaking, he didn’t give Cobra a chance to stop him at all. He nodded slightly like a gentleman and turned to leave.","A bodyguard beside Cobra saw this and said in a low voice, “Mr. Cobra.” He was asking if they needed to stop the Chinese ambassador."]},{"number":4099,"title":"Chapter 4099: Save It","paragraphs":["Chapter 4099: Save It","Editor: Henyee Translations","Trying to detain the Chinese ambassador in front of a Chinese soldier?","Xia Jinyuan glanced at the bodyguard coldly and said in a cold voice, “This is the ambassador representing China.”","The slightly cold voice was very soft, and it was slightly higher than the bodyguard’s voice. Qin Xiu, who was standing at the door and waiting for the staff beside him to open the heavy wooden door, looked a little guilty.","Xia Jinyuan was warning the people around Krone not to act rashly. However, he seemed to be reminding himself that if a bodyguard dared to attack a country’s ambassador, the entrepreneur behind the bodyguard, Mr. Krone, was not a kind person.","Krone was definitely not a kind person. Otherwise, why would he be targeted by the Chinese military?","...","He needed to contact the country.","Xia Jinyuan’s warning made Cobra glance at the bodyguard gloomily. When the wooden door of the conference room opened, he said sincerely to Qin Xiu, “Ambassador, I’m sorry for my rashness, but please believe me. I really hope to enter the Chinese market and achieve a win-win situation.”","Qin Xiu, who was as tall as a bamboo, turned around and smiled elegantly. “Of course, I believe in that, but I think you still need to understand our country’s market. Goodbye, Mr. Krone.”","Xia Jinyuan heard Cobra gritting his teeth. However, in front of a country’s ambassador, Cobra didn’t reveal his gloomy side.","He even turned his head and said to Xia Jinyuan, “Xia, help me send the Chinese ambassador off.”","Since the Chinese ambassador didn’t give him any face, why did he have to send him off personally?","“There’s no need. I can leave myself.” Qin Xiu raised his hand and rejected him directly. He didn’t want Cobra or his men to walk side-by-side with him as that would affect China’s image.","Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting down, didn’t move at all. When Qin Xiu rejected him, he even smiled coldly. It was only when Cobra warned him secretly that he retracted the coldness on his face.","The two staff members from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs looked at the ambassador walking in front. The two of them looked at each other and didn’t understand why the ambassador changed his mind at the last minute.","He just said that he would kill Krone’s arrogance. He didn’t say that he would reject him.","Why did he suddenly change his mind?","The two of them didn’t ask Qin Xiu immediately. They took two cars back to the embassy.","It was much easier for Qin Xiu to contact the country than it was for Xia Jinyuan. After getting into the bulletproof anti-tracking and anti-bugging sedan specially made for diplomats, Qin Xiu took out his phone and pressed the buttons on his cell phone a few times. He contacted Commander Xia.","If he wanted to know Xia Jinyuan’s situation, he could ask Commander Xia.","It would only take a few minutes for Qin Xiu to acquire Commander Xia’s personal phone number.","Commander Xia was a little surprised when he heard Qin Xiu’s identity.","That was until Qin Xiu said that he met Xia Jinyuan at Molaban. He was standing behind a famous entrepreneur as a bodyguard.","Commander Xia couldn’t help but raise his hand and pinch the bridge of his nose. Qin Xiu met Little Six, who was on a mission... It was unexpected.","“I want to know if anyone noticed that you know him when you saw him just now?” Commander Xia asked in a deep voice. This was very important. He had to know.","Qin Xiu knew that he was right to not pay too much attention to Xia Jinyuan just now. He lowered his voice and replied, “Commander Xia, don’t worry. I didn’t make too much eye contact with him. We pretended not to know each other. I can guarantee that no one realized that I knew him.”"]},{"number":4100,"title":"Chapter 4100: Respect From His Love Rival","paragraphs":["Chapter 4100: Respect From His Love Rival","Editor: Henyee Translations","That was good!","Commander Xia heaved a sigh of relief and said to Qin Xiu, “He’s on a high-risk mission. The entrepreneur you met today is Cobra, who uses the alias Krone. He has the secrets of several countries, including our country. He sells secrets for a living. At the same time, he’s a drug dealer and the person in charge of the underground dark market.","“This person is extremely cunning. Xia Jinyuan appeared beside him mainly to collect evidence of his crimes and cut off the link between him and the spies in China.","“Qin Xiu, please continue to pretend that you don’t know him to prevent him from being in danger.”","Qin Xiu’s palms were filled with sweat when he heard that. He didn’t expect the famous entrepreneur, Mr. Krone, to have so many underground identities.","...","He curled his sweaty palms. When he opened his mouth again, his voice was even colder. “In that case, Xia Jinyuan is in quite the danger, right? Commander Xia, I want to contact him unilaterally. Is it possible?”","“There’s no need for that. This kind of mission is most suitable for individual combat. We don’t need anyone’s help, and we can’t send anyone to help him. He’s been lurking for almost a year and a half. Our country has countless criminal evidence against Cobra. Now that it’s time to reel in the net, he can deal with it alone.","“Until he asks for help, we can only wait.”","Qin Xiu, who hung up the phone, didn’t come back to his senses for a long time. He knew that Xia Jinyuan’s identity wasn’t simple. That year, when he and Ye Jian came back from Lin Country, he saw Xia Jinyuan hugging Ye Jian with his own eyes.","It was a secret that they were going to Lin Country, but Xia Jinyuan knew about it. From that moment on, he knew that Xia Jinyuan wasn’t an ordinary soldier. He wasn’t just going to the army to slack off and using Commander Xia’s name to rise up the ranks.","Now that he knew that Xia Jinyuan, the crown prince of the military, was actually on such a high-risk mission, he was shocked and admired him.","With the Xia family’s current status, why would they need him to risk his life?","There was no need for that.","Even with the backing of the Xia family, no one would dare to say anything even if he didn’t take up a mission like this.","However, he still did it.","He took root in the military unit in such a way. He didn’t publicize the things he did or make a high profile. Even if the big and small circles in the capital city misunderstood him, he didn’t stand up and explain himself.","“Xia Jinyuan, you have a clear conscience. No wonder, no wonder...” Qin Xiu, who was holding his cell phone tightly, raised his hand to cover his forehead. He lowered his head and laughed softly.","‘No wonder Ye Jian loves you so much. No wonder no one can interfere with your relationship.’","Now, he understood.","He, Qin Xiu, had confessed to Ye Jian on the day the two of them returned from the overseas competition. He had almost embarrassed himself!","As he smiled, the corners of Qin Xiu’s eyes flickered.","‘Qin Xiu, Qin Xiu, you have to work hard. You have to... work hard to forget the woman you’ve fallen in love with.’","In the car, Qin Xiu smiled bitterly while Xia Jinyuan faced the gloomy-faced Cobra indifferently.","In Molaban, he was the only one who could give others a hard time and make them shut up. In the end, he suffered a huge loss from Qin Xiu, and this loss was delivered to his door. The anger in Cobra’s heart at this time was as bad as his expression and voice.","The person who accepted Cobra’s anger was none other than the famous Western economist who thought that there was no reason for China to reject Cobra.","“I’ve been humiliated, and you still have the face to continue lecturing? Let me tell you now, I’ll make sure you die quickly! Damn it!”","After shouting, the furious Cobra ended the call by smashing his cell phone."]}]);
